#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຮາດແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Not all problems can be solved with better hardware, but choosing the right "
"hardware is an absolute necessity for large scale deployments."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກບັນຫາຈະແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ດ້ວຍຮາດແວທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ແຕ່ການເລືອກຮາດແວທີ່ເໝາະສົມແມ່ນຄວາມຈຳເປັນຢ່າງຍິ່ງສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:3
msgid "The minimum requirements for the {productname} Server are:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳສຳລັບ {productname} Server ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:4
msgid "Eight or more recent {x86_64} CPU cores."
msgstr "CPU {x86_64} ລຸ້ນໃໝ່ 8 ຄໍ (cores) ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:5
msgid "32{nbsp}GiB RAM."
msgstr "RAM 32{nbsp}GiB."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:6
msgid "For installations with thousands of clients, use 64{nbsp}GB or more."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ມີລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍພັນເຄື່ອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ 64{nbsp}GB ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:7
msgid "Fast I/O storage devices, such as locally attached SSDs."
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີການຮັບ-ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (I/O) ໄວ, ເຊັ່ນ SSD ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:8
msgid "For PostgreSQL data directories, we recommend locally attached RAID-0 SSDs."
msgstr "ສຳລັບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂໍ້ມູນ PostgreSQL, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ RAID-0 SSD ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If the {productname} Server is virtualized, enable the `elevator=none` "
"kernel command line option, for the best input/output performance.  You can "
"check the current status with [command]``cat "
"/sys/block/<DEVICE>/queue/scheduler``.  This command will display a list of "
"available schedulers with the currently active one in brackets.  To change "
"the scheduler before a reboot, use [command]``echo none > "
"/sys/block/<DEVICE>/queue/scheduler``."
msgstr "ຖ້າ {productname} Server ເປັນລະບົບສະເມືອນ (Virtualized), ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ `elevator=none` ໃນ kernel command line ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບການຮັບ-ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``cat /sys/block/<DEVICE>/queue/scheduler``. ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ scheduler ທີ່ມີຢູ່ ໂດຍອັນທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຈະຢູ່ໃນວົງເລັບ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນ scheduler ກ່ອນຈະ reboot, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [command]``echo none > /sys/block/<DEVICE>/queue/scheduler``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:10
msgid "The minimum requirements for the {productname} Proxy are:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:11
msgid ""
"One {productname} Proxy per 500-1000 clients, depending on available network "
"bandwidth."
msgstr "ມີ {productname} Proxy 1 ເຄື່ອງ ຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍ 500-1000 ເຄື່ອງ, ຂຶ້ນກັບແບນວິດ (bandwidth) ຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:12
msgid "Two or more recent {x86_64} CPU cores."
msgstr "CPU {x86_64} ລຸ້ນໃໝ່ 2 ຄໍ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:13
msgid "16{nbsp}GB RAM, and sufficient storage for caching."
msgstr "RAM 16{nbsp}GB, ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ພຽງພໍສຳລັບການເຮັດແຄຊ (caching)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Clients should never be directly attached to the {productname} Server in "
"production systems."
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (production), ລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ຄວນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In large scale installations, the {productname} Proxy is used primarily as a "
"local cache for content between the server and clients.  Using proxies in "
"this way can substantially reduce download time for clients, and decrease "
"Server egress bandwidth use."
msgstr "ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, {productname} Proxy ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຊົ່ວຄາວ (local cache) ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ. ການໃຊ້ proxy ໃນລັກສະນະນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດເວລາໃນການດາວໂຫຼດຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ແບນວິດຂາອອກຂອງເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The number of clients per proxy will affect the download time.  Always take "
"network structure and available bandwidth into account."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍຕໍ່ proxy ຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ເວລາດາວໂຫຼດ. ຄວນພິຈາລະນາໂຄງສ້າງເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ແບນວິດທີ່ມີຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:17
msgid ""
"We recommend you estimate the download time of typical usage to determine "
"how many clients to connnect to each proxy.  To do this, you will need to "
"estimate the number of package upgrades required in every patch cycle.  You "
"can use this formula to calculate the download time:"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າປະເມີນເວລາດາວໂຫຼດຈາກການໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໄປ ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າຄວນມີລູກຂ່າຍຈັກເຄື່ອງຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ proxy. ໃນການເຮັດແບບນີ້, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງປະເມີນຈຳນວນການອັບເກຣດແພັກເກັດໃນແຕ່ລະຮອບການອັບເດດ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ສູດນີ້ຄິດໄລ່ເວລາດາວໂຫຼດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Size of updates * Number of clients / Theoretical download speed / 60\n"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງການອັບເດດ * ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍ / ຄວາມໄວດາວໂຫຼດຕາມທິດສະດີ / 60\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For example, the total time needed to transfer 400{nbsp}MB of upgrades "
"through a physical link speed of 1{nbsp}GB/s to 3000 clients:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເວລາທັງໝົດທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໃນການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອັບເກຣດ 400{nbsp}MB ຜ່ານຄວາມໄວລິ້ງ 1{nbsp}GB/s ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ 3000 ເຄື່ອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "400 MB  * 3000 / 119 MB/s / 60 = 169 min\n"
msgstr "400 MB * 3000 / 119 MB/s / 60 = 169 ນາທີ\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-api.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Hub API"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Hub API"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-api.adoc:2
msgid "Make sure the ``hub-xmlrpc-api`` service is started:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າບໍລິການ ``hub-xmlrpc-api`` ຖືກເລີ່ມແລ້ວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-api.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl start hub-xmlrpc-api\n"
msgstr "systemctl start hub-xmlrpc-api\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-api.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Once it is running, connect to the service at port 2830 using any "
"XMLRPC-compliant client libraries."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມັນເຮັດວຽກແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບບໍລິການທີ່ພອດ (port) 2830 ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີລູກຂ່າຍໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ XMLRPC."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-api.adoc:5
msgid "For examples, see xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-api.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Logs are saved in ``/var/log/hub/hub-xmlrpc-api.log``.  Logs are rotated "
"weekly, or when the log file size reaches the specified limit.  By default, "
"the log file size limit is 10{nbsp}MB."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ (Logs) ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ ``/var/log/hub/hub-xmlrpc-api.log``. ໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຈະຖືກໝູນວຽນ (rotated) ທຸກອາທິດ ຫຼື ເມື່ອຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ຮອດກຳນົດ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກແມ່ນ 10{nbsp}MB."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub XMLRPC API Authentication Modes"
msgstr "ໂໝດການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງ Hub XMLRPC API"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:2
msgid "The Hub XMLRPC API supports three different authentication modes:"
msgstr "Hub XMLRPC API ຮອງຮັບໂໝດການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ 3 ແບບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Manual mode (default): API credentials must be explicitly provided for each "
"server."
msgstr "ໂໝດປັບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ - Manual (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ): ຕ້ອງລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ API ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Relay mode: the credentials used to authenticate with the Hub are also used "
"to authenticate to each server."
msgstr "ໂໝດສົ່ງຕໍ່ - Relay: ຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບ Hub ຈະຖືກນຳໄປໃຊ້ຢືນຢັນກັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີຄືກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:5
msgid "You must provide a list of servers to connect to."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງລະບຸລາຍຊື່ເຊີເວີທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Auto-connect mode: credentials are reused for each server, and any "
"peripheral server you have access to is automatically connected."
msgstr "ໂໝດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດ - Auto-connect: ຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ຄືນກັບທຸກເຊີເວີ, ແລະ ເຊີເວີປາຍທາງໃດໆທີ່ເຈົ້າມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:8
msgid "This section provides examples of each authentication method."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງຂອງແຕ່ລະວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Manual Authentication"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ Manual"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In manual mode, credentials have to be explicitly provided for each "
"peripheral server before you can connect to it."
msgstr "ໃນໂໝດ manual, ຕ້ອງລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີປາຍທາງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:11
msgid "A typical workflow for manual authentication is:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ manual ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Credentials for the Hub are passed to the ``login`` method, and a session "
"key for the Hub is returned (``hubSessionKey``)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງ Hub ໄປຍັງເມທອດ ``login``, ແລະ ຈະໄດ້ຮັບ session key ຂອງ Hub ກັບຄືນມາ (``hubSessionKey``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Using the session key from the previous step, {productname} Server IDs are "
"obtained for all the peripheral servers attached to the Hub via the "
"``hub.listServerIds`` method."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ session key ຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ ເພື່ອດຶງ ID ຂອງ {productname} Server ສຳລັບເຊີເວີປາຍທາງທັງໝົດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Hub ຜ່ານເມທອດ ``hub.listServerIds``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Credentials for each peripheral server are provided to the "
"``attachToServers`` method."
msgstr "ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີປາຍທາງໃຫ້ກັບເມທອດ ``attachToServers``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:15
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:41
msgid "This performs authentication against each server's XMLRPC API endpoint."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (endpoint) XMLRPC API ຂອງແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:16
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:42
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:62
msgid "A ``multicast`` call is performed on a set of servers."
msgstr "ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແບບ ``multicast`` ຈະເຮັດວຽກກັບກຸ່ມຂອງເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:17
msgid ""
"This is defined by ``serverIds``, which contains the IDs of the servers to "
"target.  In the background, ``system.list_system`` is called on each "
"server's XMLRPC API"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ ``serverIds`` ເຊິ່ງລວມມີ ID ຂອງເຊີເວີເປົ້າໝາຍ. ໃນເບື້ອງຫຼັງ, ``system.list_system`` ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນ XMLRPC API ຂອງແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:18
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:44
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Hub aggregates the results and returns the response in the form of a "
"``map``."
msgstr "Hub ຈະຮວບຮວມຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄຳຕອບກັບມາໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ ``map``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:19
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:45
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:65
msgid "The map has two entries:"
msgstr "Map ຈະມີ 2 ລາຍການ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:20
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:46
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:66
msgid ""
"``Successful``: list of responses for those peripheral servers where the "
"call succeeded."
msgstr "``Successful``: ລາຍຊື່ຄຳຕອບຈາກເຊີເວີປາຍທາງທີ່ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:21
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:67
msgid ""
"``Failed``: list of responses for those peripheral servers where the call "
"failed."
msgstr "``Failed``: ລາຍຊື່ຄຳຕອບຈາກເຊີເວີປາຍທາງທີ່ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:22
msgid ""
"If you want to call a method on just one {productname} Server, then Hub API "
"also provides a ``unicast`` namespace.  In this case, the response will be a "
"single value and not a map, in the same way as if you called that "
"{productname} server's API directly."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດໃນ {productname} Server ພຽງເຄື່ອງດຽວ, Hub API ຍັງມີ namespace ແບບ ``unicast``. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ, ຄຳຕອບຈະເປັນຄ່າດ່ຽວ ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນ map, ຄືກັນກັບວ່າເຈົ້າເອີ້ນໃຊ້ API ຂອງເຊີເວີນັ້ນໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Python Script for Manual Authentication:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Python Script ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ Manual:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:24
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:49
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/usr/bin/python3\n"
"import xmlrpc.client\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/usr/bin/python3\n"
"import xmlrpc.client\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:25
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:50
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"HUB_XMLRPC_API_URL = \"<HUB_XMLRPC_API_URL>\"\n"
"HUB_USERNAME = \"<USERNAME>\"\n"
"HUB_PASSWORD = \"<PASSWORD>\"\n"
msgstr ""
"HUB_XMLRPC_API_URL = \"<HUB_XMLRPC_API_URL>\"\n"
"HUB_USERNAME = \"<USERNAME>\"\n"
"HUB_PASSWORD = \"<PASSWORD>\"\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:26
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:51
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "client = xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy(HUB_XMLRPC_API_URL, verbose=0)\n"
msgstr "client = xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy(HUB_XMLRPC_API_URL, verbose=0)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "hubSessionKey = client.hub.login(HUB_USERNAME, HUB_PASSWORD)\n"
msgstr "hubSessionKey = client.hub.login(HUB_USERNAME, HUB_PASSWORD)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:28
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:53
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Get the server IDs\n"
"serverIds = client.hub.listServerIds(hubSessionKey)\n"
msgstr ""
"# ດຶງ ID ຂອງເຊີເວີ\n"
"serverIds = client.hub.listServerIds(hubSessionKey)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# For simplicity, this example assumes you are using the same username and "
"password here, as on the hub server.\n"
"# However, in most cases, every server has its own individual credentials.\n"
"usernames = [HUB_USERNAME for s in serverIds]\n"
"passwords = [HUB_PASSWORD for s in serverIds]\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເພື່ອຄວາມງ່າຍ, ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານອັນດຽວກັນກັບ hub server.\n"
"# ແຕ່ໃນຄວາມເປັນຈິງ, ແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີມັກຈະມີຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງໃຜມັນ.\n"
"usernames = [HUB_USERNAME for s in serverIds]\n"
"passwords = [HUB_PASSWORD for s in serverIds]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Each server uses the credentials set above, client.hub.attachToServers "
"needs\n"
"# them passed as lists with as many elements as there are servers.\n"
"client.hub.attachToServers(hubSessionKey, serverIds, usernames, passwords)\n"
msgstr ""
"# ແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ, client.hub.attachToServers ຕ້ອງການ\n"
"# ຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໃນຮູບແບບ list ທີ່ມີຈຳນວນເທົ່າກັບຈຳນວນເຊີເວີ.\n"
"client.hub.attachToServers(hubSessionKey, serverIds, usernames, passwords)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Perform the operation\n"
"systemsPerServer = client.multicast.system.list_systems(hubSessionKey, "
"serverIds)\n"
"successfulResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Successful\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
"failedResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Failed\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກ\n"
"systemsPerServer = client.multicast.system.list_systems(hubSessionKey, serverIds)\n"
"successfulResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Successful\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
"failedResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Failed\"][\"Responses\"]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:32
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:56
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for system in successfulResponses:\n"
"  print(system)\n"
msgstr ""
"for system in successfulResponses:\n"
"  print(system)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:33
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:57
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Log out\n"
"client.hub.logout(hubSessionKey)\n"
msgstr ""
"# ອອກຈາກລະບົບ\n"
"client.hub.logout(hubSessionKey)\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Relay Authentication"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ Relay"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:35
msgid ""
"In relay authentication mode, the credentials used to sign in to the Hub API "
"are also used to sign in into the APIs of the peripheral servers the user "
"wants to work with.  In this authentication mode, it is assumed that the "
"same credentials are valid for every server, and that they correspond to a "
"user with appropriate permissions."
msgstr "ໃນໂໝດ relay, ຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າລະບົບ Hub API ຈະຖືກນຳໄປໃຊ້ເຂົ້າລະບົບ API ຂອງເຊີເວີປາຍທາງຄືກັນ. ໃນໂໝດນີ, ຈະຖືວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຊຸດດຽວກັນນັ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທຸກເຊີເວີ ແລະ ເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີສິດທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:36
msgid ""
"After signing in, you must call the ``attachToServers`` method.  This method "
"defines the servers to target in all subsequent calls."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກເຂົ້າລະບົບແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດ ``attachToServers``. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະກຳນົດເຊີເວີເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ງານທັງໝົດທີ່ຈະຕາມມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:37
msgid "A typical workflow for relay authentication is:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ relay ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Credentials for the Hub are passed to the ``loginWithAuthRelayMode`` method, "
"and a session key for the Hub is returned (``hubSessionKey``)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງ Hub ໄປຍັງເມທອດ ``loginWithAuthRelayMode``, ແລະ ຈະໄດ້ຮັບ session key ຂອງ Hub ກັບຄືນມາ (``hubSessionKey``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Using the session key from the previous step, {productname} Server IDs are "
"obtained for all the peripheral servers attached to the Hub via the "
"``hub.listServerIds`` method"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ session key ຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ ເພື່ອດຶງ ID ຂອງ {productname} Server ສຳລັບເຊີເວີປາຍທາງທັງໝົດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Hub ຜ່ານເມທອດ ``hub.listServerIds``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:40
msgid ""
"A call to `attachToServers` is made, and the same credentials used to sign "
"in to the Hub are passed to each server."
msgstr "ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ `attachToServers` ໂດຍສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນອັນດຽວກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າ Hub ໄປໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:43
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:63
msgid ""
"This is defined by ``serverIds``, which contains the IDs of the servers to "
"target.  In the background, ``system.list_system`` is called on each "
"server's XMLRPC API."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ ``serverIds`` ເຊິ່ງລວມມີ ID ຂອງເຊີເວີເປົ້າໝາຍ. ໃນເບື້ອງຫຼັງ, ``system.list_system`` ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນ XMLRPC API ຂອງແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:47
msgid "``Failed``: list of responses for those peripheral servers the call failed."
msgstr "``Failed``: ລາຍຊື່ຄຳຕອບຈາກເຊີເວີປາຍທາງທີ່ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Python Script for Relay Authentication:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Python Script ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ Relay:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"hubSessionKey = client.hub.loginWithAuthRelayMode(HUB_USERNAME, "
"HUB_PASSWORD)\n"
msgstr "hubSessionKey = client.hub.loginWithAuthRelayMode(HUB_USERNAME, HUB_PASSWORD)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Authenticate those servers(same credentials will be used as of hub to "
"authenticate)\n"
"client.hub.attachToServers(hubSessionKey, serverIds)\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບເຊີເວີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ (ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນຊຸດດຽວກັບ hub ໃນການຢືນຢັນ)\n"
"client.hub.attachToServers(hubSessionKey, serverIds)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:55
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Perform the needed operation\n"
"systemsPerServer = client.multicast.system.list_systems(hubSessionKey, "
"serverIds)\n"
"successfulResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Successful\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
"failedResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Failed\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຕ້ອງການ\n"
"systemsPerServer = client.multicast.system.list_systems(hubSessionKey, serverIds)\n"
"successfulResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Successful\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
"failedResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Failed\"][\"Responses\"]\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Auto-Connect Authentication"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ Auto-Connect"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Auto-connect mode is similar to relay mode, it uses the Hub credentials to "
"sign in in to all peripheral servers.  However, there is no need to use the "
"``attachToServers`` method, as auto-connect mode connects to all available "
"peripheral servers.  This occurs at the same time as you sign in to the Hub."
msgstr "ໂໝດ Auto-connect ຄ້າຍຄືກັບໂໝດ relay ຄືໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນ Hub ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ເຊີເວີປາຍທາງທັງໝົດ. ແຕ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເມທອດ ``attachToServers`` ເພາະໂໝດ auto-connect ຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບທຸກເຊີເວີທີ່ມີຢູ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ພ້ອມກັບຕອນທີ່ເຈົ້າເຂົ້າລະບົບ Hub."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:60
msgid "A typical workflow for auto-connect authentication is:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ auto-connect ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Credentials for the Hub are passed to the ``loginWithAutoconnectMode`` "
"method, and a session key for the Hub is returned (``hubSessionKey``)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງ Hub ໄປຍັງເມທອດ ``loginWithAutoconnectMode``, ແລະ ຈະໄດ້ຮັບ session key ຂອງ Hub ກັບຄືນມາ (``hubSessionKey``)."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Python Script for Auto-Connect Authentication:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Python Script ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ Auto-Connect:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"loginResponse = client.hub.loginWithAutoconnectMode(HUB_USERNAME, "
"HUB_PASSWORD)\n"
"hubSessionKey = loginResponse[\"SessionKey\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"loginResponse = client.hub.loginWithAutoconnectMode(HUB_USERNAME, HUB_PASSWORD)\n"
"hubSessionKey = loginResponse[\"SessionKey\"]\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub Installation"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Hub"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to install the ``hub-xmlrpc-api`` package, and "
"configure the Hub Server to use the API."
msgstr "ກ່ອນຈະເລີ່ມ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ ``hub-xmlrpc-api`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Hub Server ເພື່ອໃຊ້ API."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing and Configuring the Hub XMLRPC API"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Hub XMLRPC API"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On the Hub Server, or on a host that has access to all peripheral servers' "
"XMLRPC APIs, install the ``hub-xmlrpc-api`` package."
msgstr "ໃນ Hub Server ຫຼື ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ XMLRPC API ຂອງເຊີເວີປາຍທາງທັງໝົດ, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ ``hub-xmlrpc-api``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:5
msgid "The package is available in the {productname} {productnumber} repositories."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດນີ້ມີຢູ່ໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repositories) ຂອງ {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:6
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Set the Hub XMLRPC API service to start automatically at boot "
"time, and start it immediately:"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ບໍລິການ Hub XMLRPC API ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກອັດຕະໂນມັດຕອນເປີດເຄື່ອງ ແລະ ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກທັນທີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo systemctl enable hub-xmlrpc-api.service\n"
"sudo systemctl start hub-xmlrpc-api.service\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo systemctl enable hub-xmlrpc-api.service\n"
"sudo systemctl start hub-xmlrpc-api.service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:8
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Check that these parameters in the [path]``/etc/hub/hub.conf`` "
"configuration file are correct:"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ກວດສອບພາຣາມີເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [path]``/etc/hub/hub.conf`` ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:9
msgid "``HUB_API_URL``: URL to the Hub Server XMLRPC API endpoint."
msgstr "``HUB_API_URL``: URL ສຳລັບຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ XMLRPC API ຂອງ Hub Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Use the default value if you are installing `hub-xmlrpc-api` on the Hub "
"Server."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖ້າເຈົ້າຕິດຕັ້ງ `hub-xmlrpc-api` ໄວ້ໃນ Hub Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:11
msgid ""
"``HUB_CONNECT_TIMEOUT``: the maximum number of seconds to wait for a "
"response when connecting to a Server."
msgstr "``HUB_CONNECT_TIMEOUT``: ເວລາສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າການຕອບກັບເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:12
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:14
msgid "Use the default value in most cases."
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:13
msgid ""
"``HUB_REQUEST_TIMEOUT``: the maximum number of seconds to wait for a "
"response when calling a Server method."
msgstr "``HUB_REQUEST_TIMEOUT``: ເວລາສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າການຕອບກັບເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດຂອງເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:15
msgid ""
"``HUB_CONNECT_USING_SSL``: use HTTPS instead of HTTP for communicating with "
"peripheral Servers."
msgstr "``HUB_CONNECT_USING_SSL``: ໃຊ້ HTTPS ແທນ HTTP ໃນການສື່ສານກັບເຊີເວີປາຍທາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:16
msgid "Recommended for a secure environment."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:17
msgid "Restart services to pick up configuration changes."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງບໍລິການໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:18
msgid ""
"To use HTTPS to connect to peripheral Servers, you must set the "
"``HUB_CONNECT_USING_SSL`` parameter to ``true``, and ensure that the SSL "
"certificates for all the peripheral Servers are installed on the machine "
"where the ``hub-xmlrpc-api`` service runs.  Do this by copying the "
"``RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT`` certificate file from each peripheral Server's "
"**+http://<server-url>/pub/+** directory to "
"[path]``/etc/pki/trust/anchors/``, and run "
"[command]``update-ca-certificates``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub XMLRPC API Namespaces"
msgstr "Namespaces ຂອງ Hub XMLRPC API"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Hub XMLRPC API operates in a similar way to the {productname} API.  For "
"{productname} API documentation, see https://documentation.suse.com/suma."
msgstr "Hub XMLRPC API ເຮັດວຽກໃນລັກສະນະຄ້າຍຄືກັບ {productname} API. ສຳລັບເອກະສານຂອງ {productname} API, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/suma."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The Hub XMLRPC API exposes the same methods that are available from the "
"server's XMLRPC API, with a few differences in parameter and return types.  "
"Additionally, the Hub XMLRPC API supports some Hub-specific end points which "
"are not available in the {productname} API."
msgstr "Hub XMLRPC API ມີເມທອດຄືກັບທີ່ມີໃນ XMLRPC API ຂອງເຊີເວີ, ແຕ່ມີບາງຈຸດທີ່ຕ່າງກັນໃນເລື່ອງພາຣາມີເຕີ ແລະ ປະເພດຂອງຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງກັບ. ນອກຈາກນີ, Hub XMLRPC API ຍັງຮອງຮັບບາງ endpoint ສະເພາະຂອງ Hub ທີ່ບໍ່ມີໃນ {productname} API."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:4
msgid "The Hub XMLRPC API supports three different namespaces:"
msgstr "Hub XMLRPC API ຮອງຮັບ 3 namespaces ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:5
msgid "The ``hub`` namespace is used to target the Hub XMLRPC API Server."
msgstr "Namespace ``hub`` ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ເປັນ Hub XMLRPC API Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:6
msgid ""
"It supports Hub-specific XMLRPC endpoints which are primarily related to "
"authentication."
msgstr "ມັນຮອງຮັບຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (endpoints) XMLRPC ສະເພາະຂອງ Hub ເຊິ່ງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The ``unicast`` namespace is used to target a single server registered in "
"the hub."
msgstr "Namespace ``unicast`` ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ເປັນເຊີເວີດ່ຽວທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ໃນ hub."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:8
msgid ""
"It redirects any call transparently to one specific server and returns any "
"value as if the server's XMLRPC API endpoint was used directly."
msgstr "ມັນຈະສົ່ງຕໍ່ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄປຫາເຊີເວີໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາຄືກັບວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ XMLRPC API endpoint ຂອງເຊີເວີນັ້ນໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The ``multicast`` namespace is used to target multiple peripheral servers "
"registered in the hub."
msgstr "Namespace ``multicast`` ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ເປັນຫຼາຍເຊີເວີປາຍທາງທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ໃນ hub."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:10
msgid ""
"It redirects any call transparently to all the specified servers and returns "
"the results in the form of a ``map``."
msgstr "ມັນຈະສົ່ງຕໍ່ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄປຫາທຸກເຊີເວີທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ ແລະ ສົ່ງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບກັບມາໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ ``map``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:11
msgid ""
"If you do not specify a namespace, all calls are transparently redirected to "
"the underlying {productname} Server XMLRPC API of the Hub Server."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ລະບຸ namespace, ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາ {productname} Server XMLRPC API ພື້ນຖານຂອງ Hub Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This allows you to call all available methods on the {productname} Server "
"XMLRPC API."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ທຸກເມທອດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Server XMLRPC API."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Methods called without specifying any of the above namespaces will be "
"forwarded to the normal XMLRPC API of the hub.  This is the API exposed on "
"ports 80 and 443."
msgstr "ເມທອດທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍບໍ່ລະບຸ namespace ຂ້າງເທິງ ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາ XMLRPC API ປົກກະຕິຂອງ hub. ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນ API ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ຜ່ານພອດ 80 ແລະ 443."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:14
msgid "Some important considerations for hub namespaces:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວນພິຈາລະນາທີ່ສຳຄັນບາງຢ່າງສຳລັບ hub namespaces:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Individual server IDs can be obtained using "
"``client.hub.listServerIds(hubSessionKey)``."
msgstr "ສາມາດດຶງ ID ຂອງແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ ``client.hub.listServerIds(hubSessionKey)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The ``unicast`` namespace assumes all methods receive ``hubSessionKey`` and "
"serverID as their first two parameters, then any other parameter as "
"specified by the regular Server API."
msgstr "Namespace ``unicast`` ຖືວ່າທຸກເມທອດຈະຮັບ ``hubSessionKey`` ແລະ serverID ເປັນ 2 ພາຣາມີເຕີທຳອິດ, ຕາມດ້ວຍພາຣາມີເຕີອື່ນໆຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ Server API ປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client.unicast.[namespace].[methodName](hubSessionKey, serverId, param1, "
"param2)\n"
msgstr "client.unicast.[namespace].[methodName](hubSessionKey, serverId, param1, param2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:18
msgid ""
"The ``hubSessionKey`` can be obtained using different authentication "
"methods."
msgstr "ສາມາດຮັບ ``hubSessionKey`` ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The ``multicast`` namespace assumes all methods receive ``hubSessionKey``, a "
"list of ``ServerID`` values, then lists of per-server parameters as "
"specified by the regular server XMLRPC API."
msgstr "Namespace ``multicast`` ຖືວ່າທຸກເມທອດຈະຮັບ ``hubSessionKey``, ລາຍຊື່ຂອງຄ່າ ``ServerID``, ຕາມດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ຂອງພາຣາມີເຕີສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ server XMLRPC API ປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The return value is a ``map``, with ``Successful`` and ``Failed`` entries "
"for each server involved in the call."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງກັບແມ່ນ ``map``, ເຊິ່ງມີລາຍການ ``Successful`` ແລະ ``Failed`` ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client.multicast.[namespace].[methodname](hubSessionKey, [serverId1, "
"serverId2], [param1_s1, param1_s2], [param2_s1, param2_s2])\n"
msgstr "client.multicast.[namespace].[methodname](hubSessionKey, [serverId1, serverId2], [param1_s1, param1_s2], [param2_s1, param2_s2])\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub Reporting"
msgstr "ການອອກລາຍງານຂອງ Hub"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Hub prepares and provides content for multiple peripheral {productname} "
"Servers.  The goal of the reporting feature is to get data from these "
"Servers back and have combined reporting data available on the Hub.  The "
"data is made available for external Reporting Tools."
msgstr "Hub ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ກຽມ ແລະ ຈັດສົ່ງເນື້ອຫາໃຫ້ກັບ {productname} Server ປາຍທາງຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງ. ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດການອອກລາຍງານແມ່ນເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກເຊີເວີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກັບຄືນມາ ແລະ ຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານໄວ້ທີ່ Hub. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງມືອອກລາຍງານພາຍນອກສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The main database is a PostgresDB in the {productname} Hub system.  It "
"stores all the information collected from all the servers, and aggregates "
"them.  Every peripheral Server has its own reporting database where the "
"information is collected for that system.  In summary:"
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຫຼັກແມ່ນ PostgresDB ໃນລະບົບ {productname} Hub. ມັນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ຮວບຮວມມາຈາກທຸກເຊີເວີ ແລະ ນຳມາປະມວນຜົນຮ່ວມກັນ. ເຊີເວີປາຍທາງແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງຈະມີຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານຂອງຕົນເອງເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງລະບົບນັ້ນໆ. ໂດຍສະຫຼຸບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:5
msgid ""
"the DB in {productname} Hub stores, collects and eventually aggregates data "
"coming from all the DBs of the peripheral Servers,"
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນໃນ {productname} Hub ເກັບກຳ, ຮວບຮວມ ແລະ ປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມາຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເຊີເວີປາຍທາງທັງໝົດ,"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:6
msgid ""
"the DB in {productname} Hub stores also its own data from the systems "
"directly connected and managed by the Hub,"
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນໃນ {productname} Hub ຍັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຕົນເອງຈາກລະບົບທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ບໍລິຫານໂດຍ Hub ໂດຍກົງ,"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:7
msgid "the DB in peripheral {productname} Server stores its own data,"
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນໃນ {productname} Server ປາຍທາງຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງມັນເອງ,"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:8
msgid ""
"the reporting tool can be connected either to the Hub or to any "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືອອກລາຍງານສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້ທັງ Hub ຫຼື {productname} Server ເຄື່ອງໃດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The reporting database and schema are set up by default using the local "
"PostgreSQL server.  The reporting database is a separate database accessible "
"via the network."
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານ ແລະ schema ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ PostgreSQL server ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ. ຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານເປັນຖານຂໍ້ມູນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:11
msgid ""
"As a requirement we expect all server certificates are signed by the same "
"Root Certificate Authority (CA).  The whole {productname} Hub environment "
"should be using only one Root CA."
msgstr "ຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ, ພວກເຮົາຄາດຫວັງວ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີທັງໝົດຈະຖືກເຊັນໂດຍ Root Certificate Authority (CA) ອັນດຽວກັນ. ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} Hub ທັງໝົດຄວນໃຊ້ Root CA ພຽງອັນດຽວ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a DB user for the reporting"
msgstr "ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບການອອກລາຍງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Before connecting an external Reporting Tools to the Database, a user with "
"read-only permission should be created.  For doing that, it is possible to "
"use ``uyuni-setup-reportdb-user``."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄື່ອງມືອອກລາຍງານພາຍນອກກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ຄວນສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີສິດອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ (read-only). ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນັ້ນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ ``uyuni-setup-reportdb-user``."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: uyuni-setup-reportdb-user [options]\n"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ງານ: uyuni-setup-reportdb-user [options]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"options:\n"
"  --help\n"
"            show this help message and exit\n"
"  --non-interactive\n"
"            Switches to non-interactive mode\n"
"  --dbuser=DBUSER\n"
"            Report DB User\n"
"  --dbpassword=DBPASSWORD\n"
"            Report DB Password\n"
"  --add\n"
"            Add the new user\n"
"  --delete\n"
"            Delete the user\n"
"  --modify\n"
"            Set a new password\n"
msgstr ""
"options:\n"
"  --help\n"
"            ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອນີ້ແລ້ວອອກ\n"
"  --non-interactive\n"
"            ປ່ຽນເປັນໂໝດແບບບໍ່ມີການໂຕ້ຕອບ\n"
"  --dbuser=DBUSER\n"
"            ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານ\n"
"  --dbpassword=DBPASSWORD\n"
"            ລະຫັດຜ່ານຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານ\n"
"  --add\n"
"            ເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່\n"
"  --delete\n"
"            ລຶບຜູ້ໃຊ້\n"
"  --modify\n"
"            ຕັ້ງລະຫັດຜ່ານໃໝ່\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database Schema"
msgstr "Database Schema"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The schema exports the most important tables from the main {productname} "
"Database as a de-normalized variant containing only data which are relevant "
"for a report."
msgstr "Schema ນີ້ຈະສົ່ງອອກຕາຕະລາງທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນຫຼັກຂອງ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບ de-normalized ເຊິ່ງລວມມີສະເພາະຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບລາຍງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Ready-to-use reports are provided as views, aggregating data over multiple "
"tables."
msgstr "ລາຍງານທີ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານຈະຖືກໃຫ້ມາໃນຮູບແບບ views ເຊິ່ງຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຫຼາຍຕາຕະລາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Every table gets an extra id column (`mgm_id`) specifying the {productname} "
"server which provided the data.  On a single {productname} Server this "
"column has the standard value `1` which represent [literal]``localhost``.  "
"On the {productname} Hub it is replaced with the real server id the managed "
"server has in the hub database."
msgstr "ທຸກໆຕາຕະລາງຈະມີຄໍລຳ ID ເພີ່ມເຕີມ (`mgm_id`) ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າ {productname} server ໃດເປັນຜູ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນ. ໃນ {productname} Server ດ່ຽວ, ຄໍລຳນີ້ຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ `1` ເຊິ່ງໝາຍເຖິງ [literal]``localhost``. ໃນ {productname} Hub, ມັນຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍ ID ຈິງຂອງເຊີເວີທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ການບໍລິຫານໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ hub."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Another common additional field is `synced_date`, which represents the time "
"when the data were exported from the main {productname} Server database."
msgstr "ອີກຟິວ (field) ໜຶ່ງທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາຄື `synced_date` ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເວລາທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນຫຼັກຂອງ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Schema documentation can be found on the Left Navigation Bar -> "
"menu:Help[Report Database Schema]."
msgstr "ເອກະສານ Schema ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ແຖບເມນູດ້ານຊ້າຍ -> menu:Help[Report Database Schema]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data Generation and Update"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ ແລະ ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:23
msgid ""
"{productname} uses taskomatic jobs to generate the data for the reporting "
"database and to get the data from the peripheral servers to the hub."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ Taskomatic jobs ໃນການສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານ ແລະ ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກເຊີເວີປາຍທາງມາຫາ hub."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To generate and update the data on a peripheral server, the responsible "
"schedule is called `update-reporting-default`.  It is executed by default "
"daily at midnight."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງ ແລະ ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນໃນເຊີເວີປາຍທາງ, ຕາຕະລາງເວລາທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບຄື `update-reporting-default`. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກທຸກມື້ໃນເວລາທ່ຽງຄືນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:25
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Hub there is a second schedule which is important.  To "
"fetch the reporting data from all registered peripheral servers, the task "
"with the name `update-reporting-hub-default` is executed daily at 1:30 AM."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Hub ຍັງມີຕາຕະລາງເວລາທີສອງທີ່ສຳຄັນ. ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານຈາກເຊີເວີປາຍທາງທັງໝົດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້, ທາສ (task) ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ `update-reporting-hub-default` ຈະເຮັດວຽກທຸກມື້ໃນເວລາ 1:30 ໂມງເຊົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:26
msgid ""
"All times are in the local timezone of the server.  If the peripheral "
"servers are in different timezones, it is recommended to align all the "
"schedules.  Make sure that all reporting data are gathered at a specific "
"point in time, and `update-reporting-hub-default` is running when all "
"peripheral servers have actually finished their local jobs."
msgstr "ເວລາທັງໝົດແມ່ນອີງຕາມ ເຂດເວລາ (timezone) ຂອງເຊີເວີນັ້ນໆ. ຖ້າເຊີເວີປາຍທາງຢູ່ຄົນລະເຂດເວລາ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປັບຕາຕະລາງເວລາໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານທັງໝົດຖືກຮວບຮວມໃນເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ ແລະ `update-reporting-hub-default` ເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ເຊີເວີປາຍທາງທັງໝົດເຮັດວຽກຂອງຕົນເອງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning Reporting Jobs"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງ Reporting Jobs"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "`report_db_batch_size`"
msgstr "`report_db_batch_size`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of rows fetched and written from "
"one database to the other in one shot.\n"
"| Tune when            | Out of memory errors or on processing speed "
"problems.\n"
"| Value default        | 2000\n"
"| Value recommendation | 500 - 5000\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `report_db_batch_size = 4000`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
"                         Monitor memory usage closely before and after the "
"change.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍລະອຽດ          | ຈຳນວນແຖວສູງສຸດທີ່ດຶງ ແລະ ຂຽນຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນໜຶ່ງໄປຫາອີກຖານຂໍ້ມູນໜຶ່ງໃນຮອບດຽວ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເຕັມ (Out of memory) ຫຼື ມີບັນຫາຄວາມໄວໃນການປະມວນຜົນ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 2000\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 500 - 5000\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `report_db_batch_size = 4000`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ].\n"
"                         ຕິດຕາມການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຢ່າງໃກ້ຊິດຕັງແຕ່ກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "`report_db_hub_workers`"
msgstr "`report_db_hub_workers`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of workers requesting data from "
"peripheral servers on a hub at the same point in time.\n"
"| Tune when            | The number of peripheral servers increases "
"significantly (more than 100), or a faster synchronization is required.\n"
"| Value default        | 2\n"
"| Value recommendation | 2 - 10\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `report_db_hub_workers = 5`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
"                         Monitor memory and cpu usage of the hub closely "
"before and after the change.\n"
"                         Also monitor the load, cpu and memory usage of the "
"reporting database of the hub.\n"
"| Notes                | All the data collected from the peripheral server "
"must be written into the hub reporting database.\n"
"                         Tuning that database could increase the performance "
"as well.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍລະອຽດ          | ຈຳນວນ worker ສູງສຸດທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍຂໍ້ມູນຈາກເຊີເວີປາຍທາງເທິງ hub ໃນເວລາພ້ອມກັນ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ຈຳນວນເຊີເວີປາຍທາງເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ (ຫຼາຍກວ່າ 100 ເຄື່ອງ), ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ (sync) ທີ່ໄວຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 2\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 2 - 10\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `report_db_hub_workers = 5`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ].\n"
"                         ຕິດຕາມການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ CPU ຂອງ hub ຢ່າງໃກ້ຊິດຕັງແຕ່ກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"                         ລວມທັງຕິດຕາມ load, CPU ແລະ ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານເທິງ hub.\n"
"| ໝາຍເຫດ                | ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ເກັບມາຈາກເຊີເວີປາຍທາງຕ້ອງຖືກຂຽນລົງໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານຂອງ hub.\n"
"                         ການປັບແຕ່ງຖານຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນອາດຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງ Hub"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:2
msgid "To set up a Hub installation, you require:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການຕິດຕັ້ງ Hub, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:3
msgid "One central {productname} Server, which acts as the Hub Server."
msgstr "{productname} Server ສູນກາງ 1 ເຄື່ອງ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ Hub Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"One or more additional {productname} Servers, registered to the Hub as Salt "
"clients."
msgstr "{productname} Servers ເພີ່ມເຕີມ 1 ເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ Hub ໃນຖານະ Salt clients."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:5
msgid "This document refers to these as peripheral servers."
msgstr "ເອກະສານນີ້ຈະເອີ້ນເຊີເວີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ວ່າ ເຊີເວີປາຍທາງ (peripheral servers)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:6
msgid "Any number of clients registered to the peripheral servers."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບເຊີເວີປາຍທາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Ensure the Hub Server and all peripheral servers are running "
"{productname}{nbsp}4.1 or higher."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ Hub Server ແລະ ເຊີເວີປາຍທາງທັງໝົດກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ {productname}{nbsp}4.1 ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The Hub Server must not have clients registered to it.  Clients should only "
"be registered to the peripheral servers.  The exceptions are build hosts, "
"which can be connected to the Hub."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Peripheral Servers"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີປາຍທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Peripheral servers must be registered to the Hub Server as Salt clients.  "
"When you register the peripheral servers, assign them the appropriate "
"``SUSE Manager Server`` software channel as their base channel.  "
"Additionally, they must be registered to the Hub Server directly, do not use "
"a proxy."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີປາຍທາງຕ້ອງຖືກລົງທະບຽນກັບ Hub Server ໃນຖານະ Salt clients. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າລົງທະບຽນເຊີເວີປາຍທາງ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ ``SUSE Manager Server`` ທີ່ເໝາະສົມເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base channel). ນອກຈາກນີ, ພວກມັນຕ້ອງຖືກລົງທະບຽນກັບ Hub Server ໂດຍກົງ, ຫ້າມໃຊ້ proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about registering clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:12
msgid ""
"You need credentials to access the XMLRPC APIs on each server, including the "
"Hub Server."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ XMLRPC API ໃນແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ, ລວມທັງ Hub Server."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring Large Scale Deployments"
msgstr "ການເຝົ້າລະວັງການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can monitor your {productname} environment using Prometheus and "
"Grafana.  {productname} Server and Proxy are able to provide self-health "
"metrics.  You can also install and manage a number of Prometheus exporters "
"on Salt clients."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຝົ້າລະວັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} ຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana. {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy ສາມາດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນການວັດແທກສຸຂະພາບຂອງລະບົບເອງໄດ້. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ບໍລິຫານ Prometheus exporters ຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງໄວ້ໃນ Salt clients ໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Prometheus and Grafana packages are included in the {productname} Client "
"Tools for {sle}{nbsp}12, {sle}{nbsp}15, {rhel}{nbsp}7, {rhel}{nbsp}8 and "
"openSUSE 15.x."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana ລວມຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Client Tools ສຳລັບ {sle}{nbsp}12, {sle}{nbsp}15, {rhel}{nbsp}7, {rhel}{nbsp}8 ແລະ openSUSE 15.x."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Prometheus and Grafana packages are included in the {productname} Client "
"Tools for {sle}{nbsp}12, {sle}{nbsp}15, {centos}{nbsp}7, {centos}{nbsp}8 and "
"openSUSE 15.x."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana ລວມຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Client Tools ສຳລັບ {sle}{nbsp}12, {sle}{nbsp}15, {centos}{nbsp}7, {centos}{nbsp}8 ແລະ openSUSE 15.x."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You need to install Prometheus and Grafana on a machine separate from the "
"{productname} Server.  We recommend you use a managed Salt client as your "
"monitoring server."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana ໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກ {productname} Server. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Salt client ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ການບໍລິຫານເປັນເຊີເວີເຝົ້າລະວັງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information on monitoring, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເຝົ້າລະວັງ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/multi-server.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using Multiple Servers to Manage Large Scale Deployments"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຫຼາຍເຊີເວີເພື່ອບໍລິຫານການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/multi-server.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you need to manage a large number of clients, in most cases you can do so "
"with a single {productname} Server, tuned appropriately.  However, if you "
"need to manage tens of thousands of clients, you might find it easier to use "
"multiple {productname} Servers, in a hub, to manage them."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການບໍລິຫານລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍ {productname} Server ພຽງເຄື່ອງດຽວ ທີ່ຜ່ານການປັບແຕ່ງຢ່າງເໝາະສົມ. ແຕ່ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງບໍລິຫານລູກຂ່າຍເປັນໝື່ນເຄື່ອງ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະພົບວ່າມັນງ່າຍກວ່າທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ {productname} Servers ຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງໃນຮູບແບບ hub ເພື່ອບໍລິຫານພວກມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/multi-server.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} Hub helps you manage very large deployments.  The typical Hub "
"topology looks like this:"
msgstr "{productname} Hub ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າບໍລິຫານການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍໆໄດ້. ໂຄງສ້າງ (topology) ຂອງ Hub ທົ່ວໄປຈະມີລັກສະນະແບບນີ້:"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/multi-server.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "typical-hub-architecture-overview.svg"
msgstr "typical-hub-architecture-overview.svg"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/multi-server.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To copy contents between servers, you can use Inter-Server Synchronization "
"(ISS).  ISS allows you to export data from one server (source) and import it "
"on another (target) server.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:iss_intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສຳເນົາເນື້ອຫາລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ Inter-Server Synchronization (ISS). ISS ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນຈາກເຊີເວີໜຶ່ງ (ຕົ້ນທາງ) ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າມາຫາອີກເຊີເວີໜຶ່ງ (ປາຍທາງ). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:iss_intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operation Recommendations"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳດ້ານການດຳເນີນງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains a range of recommendations for large scale "
"deployments."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຳແນະນຳຕ່າງໆ ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Always start small and scale up gradually.  Monitor the server as you scale "
"to identify problems early."
msgstr "ຄວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກຂະໜາດນ້ອຍສະເໝີ ແລະ ຄ່ອຍໆຂະຫຍາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຕິດຕາມເຊີເວີໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຈົ້າຂະຫຍາຍລະບົບເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນບັນຫາໄດ້ໄວ."

#.  Might be worth alphabetising these. LKB 2018-08-09
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Client Onboarding Rate"
msgstr "ອັດຕາການນຳລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The rate at which {productname} can onboard clients is limited and depends "
"on hardware resources.  Onboarding clients at a faster rate than "
"{productname} is configured for will build up a backlog of unprocessed "
"keys.  This slows down the process and can potentially exhaust resources.  "
"We recommend that you limit the acceptance key rate programmatically.  A "
"safe starting point would be to onboard a client every 15 seconds.  You can "
"do that with this command:"
msgstr "ອັດຕາທີ່ {productname} ສາມາດນຳລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ (onboard) ແມ່ນມີຈຳກັດ ແລະ ຂຶ້ນກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນຮາດແວ. ການນຳລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໄວເກີນກວ່າທີ່ {productname} ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດມີ key ທີ່ລໍຖ້າການປະມວນຜົນຄ້າງຢູ່ຫຼາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນຊ້າລົງ ແລະ ອາດຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຈົນໝົດ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຈຳກັດອັດຕາການຍອມຮັບ key ຜ່ານການຂຽນຄຳສັ່ງ. ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ປອດໄພຄືການນຳລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບທຸກໆ 15 ວິນາທີ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for k in $(salt-key -l un|grep -v Unaccepted); do salt-key -y -a $k; sleep "
"15; done\n"
msgstr "for k in $(salt-key -l un|grep -v Unaccepted); do salt-key -y -a $k; sleep 15; done\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Clients and the RNG"
msgstr "Salt Clients ແລະ RNG"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"All communication to and from Salt clients is encrypted.  During client "
"onboarding, Salt uses asymmetric cryptography, which requires available "
"entropy from the Random Number Generator (RNG) facility in the kernel.  If "
"sufficient entropy is not available from the RNG, it will significantly slow "
"down communications.  This is especially true in virtualized environments.  "
"Ensure enough entropy is present, or change the virtualization host options."
msgstr "ການສື່ສານທັງໝົດໄປຫາ ແລະ ມາຈາກ Salt clients ແມ່ນຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄວ້. ໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ, Salt ຈະໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ asymmetric ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງການຄ່າ entropy ຈາກລະບົບ Random Number Generator (RNG) ໃນ kernel. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ entropy ພຽງພໍຈາກ RNG, ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສື່ສານຊ້າລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບ virtualized. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີ entropy ພຽງພໍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຕົວເລືອກຂອງ virtualization host."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"You can check the amount of available entropy with the [command]``cat "
"/proc/sys/kernel/random/entropy_avail``.  It should never be below 100-200."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບຈຳນວນ entropy ທີ່ມີຢູ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``cat /proc/sys/kernel/random/entropy_avail``. ມັນບໍ່ຄວນຕ່ຳກວ່າ 100-200."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clients Running with Unaccepted Salt Keys"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍ Salt Keys ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຖືກຍອມຮັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Idle clients which have not been onboarded, that is clients running with "
"unaccepted Salt keys, consume more resources than idle clients that have "
"been onboarded.  Generally, this consumes about an extra 2.5 Kb/s of inbound "
"network bandwidth per client.  For example, 1000 idle clients will consume "
"about 2.5 Mb/s extra.  This consumption will reduce almost to zero when "
"onboarding has been completed for all clients.  Limit the number of "
"non-onboarded clients for optimal performance."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຢຸດພັກ (Idle) ເຊິ່ງຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ onboard, ຫຼື ກໍຄືລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍ Salt keys ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຖືກຍອມຮັບ, ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍກວ່າລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ onboard ແລ້ວ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ແບນວິດເຄືອຂ່າຍຂາເຂົ້າເພີ່ມປະມານ 2.5 Kb/s ຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ລູກຂ່າຍ 1000 ເຄື່ອງທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ onboard ຈະໃຊ້ແບນວິດເພີ່ມປະມານ 2.5 Mb/s. ການໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ຈະຫຼຸດລົງຈົນເກືອບເປັນສູນເມື່ອການ onboard ສຳເລັດໝົດທຸກເຄື່ອງ. ຄວນຈຳກັດຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ onboard ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:12
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disabling the Salt Mine"
msgstr "ການປິດໃຊ້ງານ Salt Mine"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:13
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In older versions, {productname} used a tool called Salt mine to check "
"client availability.  The Salt mine would cause clients to contact the "
"server every hour, which created significant load.  With the introduction of "
"a more efficient mechanism in {productname}{nbsp}3.2, the Salt mine is no "
"longer required.  Instead, the {productname} Server uses Taskomatic to ping "
"only the clients that appear to have been offline for twelve hours or more, "
"with all clients being contacted at least once in every twenty four hour "
"period by default.  You can adjust this by changing the "
"[systemitem]``web.system_checkin_threshold`` parameter in "
"[path]``rhn.conf``.  The value is expressed in days, and the default value "
"is [literal]``1``."
msgstr "ໃນເວີຊັນເກົ່າ, {productname} ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ Salt mine ເພື່ອກວດສອບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. Salt mine ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍຕິດຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີທຸກໆຊົ່ວໂມງ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ load ຫຼາຍ. ດ້ວຍການນຳໃຊ້ກົນໄກທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບກວ່າໃນ {productname}{nbsp}3.2, Salt mine ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ແທນທີ່ຈະເຮັດແນວນັ້ນ, {productname} Server ຈະໃຊ້ Taskomatic ເພື່ອ ping ຫາສະເພາະລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າ offline ເປັນເວລາ 12 ຊົ່ວໂມງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ໂດຍລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຕິດຕໍ່ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງໃນທຸກໆ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບຄ່ານີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນພາຣາມີເຕີ [systemitem]``web.system_checkin_threshold`` ໃນ [path]``rhn.conf``. ຄ່າແມ່ນກຳນົດເປັນຈຳນວນມື້, ແລະ ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [literal]``1``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:14
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Newly registered Salt clients will have the Salt mine disabled by default.  "
"If the Salt mine is running on your system, you can reduce load by disabling "
"it.  This is especially effective if you have a large number of clients."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ Salt mine ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຖ້າ Salt mine ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຫຼຸດ load ໄດ້ໂດຍການປິດມັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຫັນຜົນຊັດເຈນຖ້າເຈົ້າມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:15
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:16
msgid "Disable the Salt mine by running this command on the server:"
msgstr "ປິດ Salt mine ໂດຍການລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃນເຊີເວີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:16
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_mine_config_clean_up\n"
msgstr "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_mine_config_clean_up\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:17
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:18
msgid ""
"This will restart the clients and generate some Salt events to be processed "
"by the server.  If you have a large number of clients, handling these events "
"could create excessive load.  To avoid this, you can execute the command in "
"batch mode with this command:"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ ແລະ ສ້າງເຫດການ Salt ບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຊີເວີປະມວນຜົນ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ການຈັດການເຫດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ load ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫານີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດລັນຄຳສັ່ງໃນໂໝດ batch ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:18
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_mine_config_clean_up\n"
msgstr "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_mine_config_clean_up\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:19
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:20
msgid ""
"You will need to wait for this command to finish executing.  Do not end the "
"process with kbd:[Ctrl+C]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກຈົນສຳເລັດ. ຫ້າມຍົກເລີກຂັ້ນຕອນດ້ວຍການກົດ kbd:[Ctrl+C]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disable Unnecessary Taskomatic jobs"
msgstr "ປິດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Taskomatic jobs ທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To minimize wasted resources, you can disable non-essential or unused "
"Taskomatic jobs."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການເສຍຊັບພະຍາກອນໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປິດ Taskomatic jobs ທີ່ບໍ່ສຳຄັນ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:22
msgid ""
"You can see the list of Taskomatic jobs in the {productname} {webui}, at "
"menu:Admin[Task Schedules]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຂອງ Taskomatic jobs ໄດ້ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ທີ່ເມນູ menu:Admin[Task Schedules]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:23
msgid ""
"To disable a job, click the name of the job you want to disable, select "
"[guimenu]``Disable Schedule``, and click btn:[Update Schedule]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ job, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງ job ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປິດ, ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Disable Schedule``, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Update Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To delete a job, click the name of the job you want to delete, and click "
"btn:[Delete Schedule]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອລຶບ job, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງ job ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການລຶບ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Delete Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:25
msgid "We recommend disabling these jobs:"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ປິດ jobs ເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Daily comparison of configuration files: "
"[systemitem]``compare-configs-default``"
msgstr "ການປຽບທຽບໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າປະຈຳວັນ: [systemitem]``compare-configs-default``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Hourly synchronization of {cobbler} files: "
"[systemitem]``cobbler-sync-default``"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ໄຟລ໌ {cobbler} ທຸກໆຊົ່ວໂມງ: [systemitem]``cobbler-sync-default``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Daily gatherer and subscription matcher: "
"[systemitem]``gatherer-matcher-default``"
msgstr "ການຮວບຮວມ ແລະ ກວດສອບການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກປະຈຳວັນ: [systemitem]``gatherer-matcher-default``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Do not attempt to disable any other jobs, as it could prevent {productname} "
"from functioning correctly."
msgstr "ຫ້າມປິດ jobs ອື່ນໆ, ເພາະມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ {productname} ເຮັດວຽກຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Swap and Monitoring"
msgstr "Swap ແລະ ການເຝົ້າລະວັງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:31
msgid ""
"It is especially important in large scale deployments that you keep your "
"{productname} Server constantly monitored and backed up."
msgstr "ມັນສຳຄັນຫຼາຍໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເຝົ້າລະວັງ {productname} Server ຂອງເຈົ້າຢູ່ສະເໝີ ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ (back up) ໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Swap space use can have significant impacts on performance.  If significant "
"non-transient swap usage is detected, you can increase the available "
"hardware RAM."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ Swap ສາມາດມີຜົນກະທົບຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ. ຖ້າກວດພົບການໃຊ້ swap ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງໃນປະລິມານຫຼາຍ, ເຈົ້າຄວນເພີ່ມ RAM ຂອງຮາດແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:33
msgid ""
"You can also consider tuning the Server to consume less memory.  For more "
"information on tuning, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-scaling-minions.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດພິຈາລະນາປັບແຕ່ງເຊີເວີເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໜ້ອຍລົງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການປັບແຕ່ງ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-scaling-minions.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "AES Key Rotation"
msgstr "ການໝູນວຽນ AES Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Communications from the Salt Master to clients is encrypted with a single "
"AES key.  The key is rotated when:"
msgstr "ການສື່ສານຈາກ Salt Master ຫາລູກຂ່າຍແມ່ນຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດດ້ວຍ AES key ດ່ຽວ. Key ຈະຖືກໝູນວຽນເມື່ອ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:36
msgid "The ``salt-master`` process is restarted, or"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການ (process) ``salt-master`` ຖືກເລີ່ມໃໝ່, ຫຼື"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Any minion key is deleted (for example, when a client is deleted from "
"{productname})"
msgstr "ມີ minion key ໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກລຶບ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກ {productname})"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:38
msgid ""
"After the AES key has been rotated, all clients must re-authenticate to the "
"master.  By default, this happens next time a client receives a message.  If "
"you have a large number of clients (several thousands), this can cause a "
"high CPU load on the {productname} Server.  If the CPU load is excessive, we "
"recommend that you delete keys in batches, and in off-peak hours if "
"possible, to avoid overloading the server."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກ AES key ຖືກໝູນວຽນ, ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດຕ້ອງຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບ master ໃໝ່. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ (ຫຼາຍພັນເຄື່ອງ), ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ CPU load ໃນ {productname} Server ສູງຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າ CPU load ສູງເກີນໄປ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າລຶບ keys ເປັນຊຸດໆ (batches), ແລະ ເຮັດໃນຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານໜາແໜ້ນ (off-peak hours) ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້ ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເຮັດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີເຮັດວຽກໜັກເກີນໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:39
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:20
msgid "For more information, see:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:40
msgid "https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/intro_scale.html#too-many-minions-re-authing[https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/intro_scale.html#too-many-minions-re-authing]"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:41
msgid "https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#ping-on-rotate[https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#ping-on-rotate]"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Large Deployments Guide Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຄູ່ມືການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:2
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc:2
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:2
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:2
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/specialized-guides-overview.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Updated:** {docdate}\n"
msgstr "**ອັບເດດເມື່ອ:** {docdate}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:3
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:2
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-large-scale-tuning.adoc:2
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-scaling-minions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} is designed by default to work on small and medium scale "
"installations.  For installations with more than 1000 clients per "
"{productname} Server, adequate hardware sizing and parameter tuning must be "
"performed."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ {productname} ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ ແລະ ຂະໜາດກາງ. ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ມີລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍກວ່າ 1000 ເຄື່ອງຕໍ່ {productname} Server, ຕ້ອງມີການກຳນົດຂະໜາດຮາດແວທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການປັບແຕ່ງພາຣາມີເຕີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"There is no hard maximum number of supported systems.  Many factors can "
"affect how many clients can reliably be used in a particular installation.  "
"Factors can include which features are used, and how the hardware and "
"systems are configured."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງລະບົບທີ່ຮອງຮັບຢ່າງຕາຍຕົວ. ຫຼາຍປັດໄຈສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບໃນແຕ່ລະການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ປັດໄຈເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນລວມເຖິງຟີເຈີທີ່ໃຊ້, ແລະ ວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮາດແວ ແລະ ລະບົບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Large installations require standard Salt clients.  These instructions "
"cannot be used in environments using traditional clients or Salt SSH "
"minions."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຕ້ອງການ Salt clients ມາດຕະຖານ. ຄຳແນະນຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຊ້ traditional clients ຫຼື Salt SSH minions."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:6
msgid ""
"There are two main ways to manage large scale deployments.  You can manage "
"them with a single {productname} Server, or you can use multiple servers in "
"a hub.  Both methods are described in this book."
msgstr "ມີ 2 ວິທີຫຼັກໃນການບໍລິຫານການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່. ເຈົ້າສາມາດບໍລິຫານດ້ວຍ {productname} Server ພຽງເຄື່ອງດຽວ, ຫຼື ຈະໃຊ້ຫຼາຍເຊີເວີໃນຮູບແບບ hub ກໍໄດ້. ທັງສອງວິທີແມ່ນໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນປຶ້ມຫົວນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:7
msgid ""
"With large scale environments one should also consider the usage of "
"{productname} Proxies.  Sizing and location of the Proxies will dependent on "
"the deployment topology.  For more information see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ເຮົາຄວນພິຈາລະນາການໃຊ້ {productname} Proxies ດ້ວຍ. ການກຳນົດຂະໜາດ ແລະ ສະຖານທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ Proxy ຈະຂຶ້ນກັບໂຄງສ້າງເຄືອຂ່າຍ (topology) ຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Additionally, if you are operating within a Retail environment, you can use "
"{productname} {smr} to manage large deployments of point-of-service "
"terminals.  There is an introduction to {productname} {smr} in this book."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ, ຖ້າເຈົ້າເຮັດວຽກໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການຄ້າປີກ (Retail), ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} {smr} ເພື່ອບໍລິຫານການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຂອງຈຸດບໍລິການ (point-of-service terminals). ມີການແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບ {productname} {smr} ໄວ້ໃນປຶ້ມຫົວນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Tuning and monitoring large scale deployments can differ from smaller "
"installations.  This book contains guidance for both tuning and monitoring "
"within larger installations."
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງ ແລະ ການເຝົ້າລະວັງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ອາດຈະຕ່າງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ. ປຶ້ມຫົວນີປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຳແນະນຳທັງການປັບແຕ່ງ ແລະ ການເຝົ້າລະວັງສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing Large Scale Deployments in a Retail Environment"
msgstr "ການບໍລິຫານການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການຄ້າປີກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} {productnumber} is an open source infrastructure "
"management solution, optimized and tailored specifically for the retail "
"industry.  It uses the same technology as {susemgr}, but is customized to "
"address the needs of retail organizations."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} {productnumber} ແມ່ນໂຊລູຊັນບໍລິຫານຈັດການໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານແບບ open source, ທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງ ແລະ ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອອຸດສາຫະກຳການຄ້າປີກໂດຍສະເພາະ. ມັນໃຊ້ເຕັກໂນໂລຊີດຽວກັນກັບ {susemgr}, ແຕ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງອົງກອນການຄ້າປີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} is designed for use in retail situations where customers "
"can use point-of-service terminals to purchase or exchange goods, take part "
"in promotions, or collect loyalty points.  In addition to retail "
"installations, it can also be used for novel purposes, such as maintaining "
"student computers in an educational environment, or self-service kiosks in "
"banks or hospitals."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນສະຖານະການການຄ້າປີກ ບ່ອນທີ່ລູກຄ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຈຸດບໍລິການເພື່ອຊື້ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນເຄື່ອງ, ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມໂປຣໂມຊັນ, ຫຼື ສະສົມຄະແນນ. ນອກຈາກການຄ້າປີກແລ້ວ, ມັນຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ ການເບິ່ງແຍງຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງນັກຮຽນໃນສະຖາບັນການສຶກສາ, ຫຼື ຕູ້ບໍລິການຕົນເອງ (self-service kiosks) ໃນທະນາຄານ ຫຼື ໂຮງໝໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} is intended for use in installations that include "
"servers, workstations, point-of-service terminals, and other devices.  It "
"allows administrators to install, configure, and update the software on "
"their servers, and manage the deployment and provisioning of "
"point-of-service machines."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ມີທັງເຊີເວີ, ເຄື່ອງເວີກສະເຕຊັນ, ຈຸດບໍລິການ ແລະ ອຸປະກອນອື່ນໆ. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ບໍລິຫານລະບົບສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ອັບເດດຊອບແວໃນເຊີເວີ, ລວມທັງບໍລິຫານການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຈັດກຽມເຄື່ອງຈຸດບໍລິການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Point-of-Service (POS) terminals can come in many different formats, such as "
"point-of-sale terminals, kiosks, digital scales, self-service systems, and "
"reverse-vending systems.  Every terminal, however, is provided by a vendor, "
"who set basic information about the device in the firmware.  {productname} "
"{smr} accesses this vendor information to determine how best to work with "
"the terminal in use."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງຈຸດບໍລິການ (POS) ສາມາດມີໄດ້ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ ເຊັ່ນ ເຄື່ອງຄິດເງິນ, ຕູ້ຄີອອດ, ຊິງດິຈິຕອນ, ລະບົບບໍລິການຕົນເອງ ແລະ ລະບົບຮັບຄືນສິນຄ້າອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ທຸກໆເຄື່ອງແມ່ນມາຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor) ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານຂອງອຸປະກອນໄວ້ໃນເຟີມແວ (firmware). {productname} {smr} ຈະເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ຜະລິດນີ້ ເພື່ອກຳນົດວິທີການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດກັບເຄື່ອງນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In most cases, different terminals will require a different operating system "
"(OS) image to ensure they work correctly.  For example, an information kiosk "
"has a high-resolution touchscreen, where a cashier terminal might only have "
"a very basic display.  While both of these terminals require similar "
"processing and network functionality, they will require different OS "
"images.  The OS images ensure that the different display mechanisms work "
"correctly."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ເຄື່ອງທີ່ຕ່າງກັນຈະຕ້ອງການ OS image ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຕູ້ຄີອອດຂໍ້ມູນຈະມີໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດສູງ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຄື່ອງຄິດເງິນອາດຈະມີໜ້າຈໍສະແດງຜົນແບບພື້ນຖານ. ເຖິງວ່າເຄື່ອງທັງສອງຈະຕ້ອງການການປະມວນຜົນ ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, ແຕ່ພວກມັນກໍຕ້ອງການ OS image ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນນັ້ນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about setting up and using {productname} {smr}, see "
"xref:retail:retail-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ {productname} {smr}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:retail:retail-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/single-server.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using a Single Server to Manage Large Scale Deployments"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ເຊີເວີດ່ຽວເພື່ອບໍລິຫານການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/single-server.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section discusses how to set up a single {productname} Server to manage "
"a large number of clients.  It contains some recommendations for hardware "
"and networking, and an overview of the tuning parameters that you need to "
"consider in a large scale deployment."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະເວົ້າເຖິງວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server ພຽງເຄື່ອງດຽວເພື່ອບໍລິຫານລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ມັນປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຳແນະນຳສຳລັບຮາດແວ ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ລວມທັງພາບລວມຂອງພາຣາມີເຕີໃນການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງພິຈາລະນາໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:1
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-large-scale-tuning.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning Large Scale Deployments"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The instructions in this section can have severe and catastrophic "
"performance impacts when improperly used.  In some cases, they can cause "
"{productname} to completely cease functioning.  Always test changes before "
"implementing them in a production environment.  During implementation, take "
"care when changing parameters.  Monitor performance before and after each "
"change, and revert any steps that do not produce the expected result."
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳໃນພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອາດມີຜົນກະທົບທີ່ຮຸນແຮງຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຫາກໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ {productname} ຢຸດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ເລີຍ. ຄວນທົດສອບການປ່ຽນແປງສະເໝີກ່ອນຈະນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການເຮັດວຽກຈິງ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງການປັບແຕ່ງ, ໃຫ້ລະມັດລະວັງໃນການປ່ຽນແປງພາຣາມີເຕີ. ໃຫ້ຕິດຕາມປະສິດທິພາບທັງກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງການປ່ຽນແປງ, ແລະ ໃຫ້ຍົກເລີກຂັ້ນຕອນໃດໆກໍຕາມທີ່ບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜົນຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:4
msgid ""
"We strongly recommend that you contact SUSE Consulting for assistance with "
"tuning."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຕິດຕໍ່ SUSE Consulting ເພື່ອຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:5
msgid ""
"SUSE will not provide support for catastrophic failure when these advanced "
"parameters are modified without consultation."
msgstr "SUSE ຈະບໍ່ໃຫ້ການສະໜັບສະໜູນສຳລັບຄວາມຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວທີ່ຮຸນແຮງ ຫາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງພາຣາມີເຕີຂັ້ນສູງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄຳປຶກສາ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Tuning is not required on installations of fewer than 1000 clients.  Do not "
"perform these instructions on small or medium scale installations."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການປັບແຕ່ງສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ມີລູກຂ່າຍໜ້ອຍກວ່າ 1000 ເຄື່ອງ. ຫ້າມເຮັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ ຫຼື ຂະໜາດກາງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Tuning Process"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການປັບແຕ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Any {productname} installation is subject to a number of design and "
"infrastructure constraints that, for the purposes of tuning, we call "
"environmental variables.  Environmental variables can include the total "
"number of clients, the number of different operating systems under "
"management, and the number of software channels."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃດໆກໍຕາມ ລ້ວນແຕ່ຂຶ້ນກັບຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດ້ານການອອກແບບ ແລະ ໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານ ເຊິ່ງໃນການປັບແຕ່ງພວກເຮົາຈະເອີ້ນວ່າ ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environmental variables). ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ລວມເຖິງຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດ, ຈຳນວນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນພາຍໃຕ້ການບໍລິຫານ, ແລະ ຈຳນວນຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Environmental variables influence, either directly or indirectly, the value "
"of most configuration parameters.  During the tuning process, the "
"configuration parameters are manipulated to improve system performance."
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈະສົ່ງຜົນທັງທາງກົງ ແລະ ທາງອ້ອມຕໍ່ຄ່າຂອງພາຣາມີເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການປັບແຕ່ງ, ພາຣາມີເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກປັບເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບຂອງລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Before you begin tuning, you will need to estimate the best setting for each "
"environment variable, and adjust the configuration parameters to suit."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະເລີ່ມການປັບແຕ່ງ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງປະເມີນຄ່າທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ແລະ ປັບພາຣາມີເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:11
msgid ""
"To help you with the estimation process, we have provided you with a "
"dependency graph.  Locate the environmental variables on the dependency "
"graph to determine how they will influence other variables and parameters."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນຂະບວນການປະເມີນ, ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຈັດກຽມແຜນພູມຄວາມສຳພັນ (dependency graph) ໄວ້ໃຫ້. ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນແຜນພູມເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າມັນຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຕົວປ່ຽນ ແລະ ພາຣາມີເຕີອື່ນໆແນວໃດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Environmental variables are represented by graph nodes in a rectangle at the "
"top of the dependency graph.  Each node is connected to the relevant "
"parameters that might need tuning.  Consult the relevant sections in this "
"document for more information about recommended values."
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຖືກແທນດ້ວຍໂນດ (nodes) ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງສຸດຂອງແຜນພູມ. ແຕ່ລະໂນດຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບພາຣາມີເຕີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທີ່ອາດຕ້ອງມີການປັບແຕ່ງ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳໄດ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຂອງເອກະສານນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Tuning one parameter might require tuning other parameters, or changing "
"hardware, or the infrastructure.  When you change a parameter, follow the "
"arrows from that node on the graph to determine what other parameters might "
"need adjustment.  Continue through each parameter until you have visited all "
"nodes on the graph."
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງພາຣາມີເຕີໜຶ່ງອາດຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບພາຣາມີເຕີອື່ນໆນຳ, ຫຼື ອາດຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຮາດແວ ຫຼື ໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າປ່ຽນພາຣາມີເຕີໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຕາມລູກສອນຈາກໂນດນັ້ນໃນແຜນພູມ ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າພາຣາມີເຕີອື່ນໃດທີ່ອາດຕ້ອງປັບນຳ. ເຮັດແບບນັ້ນໄປເລື້ອຍໆຈົນຄົບທຸກໂນດໃນແຜນພູມ."

#.  missing file?
#. type: Positional ($1) AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning dependency graph"
msgstr "ແຜນພູມຄວາມສຳພັນໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ"

#.  missing file?
#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "parameter_graph.svg"
msgstr "parameter_graph.svg"

#.  Arghh! My eyes! LKB 2019-08-09
#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key to the Dependency Graph"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍສັນຍະລັກໃນແຜນພູມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:17
msgid "3D boxes are hardware design variables or constraints"
msgstr "ກ່ອງແບບ 3D ແມ່ນຕົວປ່ຽນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດ້ານການອອກແບບຮາດແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:18
msgid "Oval-shaped boxes are software or system design variables or constraints"
msgstr "ກ່ອງຮູບວົງມົນແມ່ນຕົວປ່ຽນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດ້ານການອອກແບບຊອບແວ ຫຼື ລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Rectangle-shaped boxes are configurable parameters, color-coded by "
"configuration file:"
msgstr "ກ່ອງຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກແມ່ນພາຣາມີເຕີທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້, ໂດຍແຍກສີຕາມໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:20
msgid "Red: Apache `httpd` configuration files"
msgstr "ສີແດງ: ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Apache `httpd`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:21
msgid "Blue: Salt configuration files"
msgstr "ສີຟ້າ: ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:22
msgid "Brown: Tomcat configuration files"
msgstr "ສີນ້ຳຕານ: ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Tomcat"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:23
msgid "Grey: PostgreSQL configuration files"
msgstr "ສີເທົາ: ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ PostgreSQL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:24
msgid "Purple: `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`"
msgstr "ສີມ່ວງ: `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Dashed connecting lines indicate a variable or constraint that might require "
"a change to another parameter"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບຂີດປະ ໝາຍເຖິງຕົວປ່ຽນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທີ່ອາດຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນພາຣາມີເຕີອື່ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Solid connecting lines indicate that changing a configuration parameter "
"requires checking another one to prevent issues"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບເສັ້ນທຶບ ໝາຍເຖິງການປ່ຽນພາຣາມີເຕີໜຶ່ງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບອີກອັນໜຶ່ງເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບັນຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:27
msgid ""
"After the initial tuning has been completed, you will need to consider "
"tuning again in these cases:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການປັບແຕ່ງເບື້ອງຕົ້ນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າອາດຕ້ອງພິຈາລະນາປັບແຕ່ງໃໝ່ໃນກໍລະນີເຫຼົ່ານີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:28
msgid "If your tuning inputs change significantly"
msgstr "ຖ້າຂໍ້ມູນປັດໄຈທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການປັບແຕ່ງມີການປ່ຽນແປງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:29
msgid "If special conditions arise that require a certain parameter to be changed."
msgstr "ຖ້າເກີດເງື່ອນໄຂພິເສດທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນພາຣາມີເຕີບາງຢ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:30
msgid "For example, if specific warnings appear in a log file."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າຄຳເຕືອນສະເພາະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ (log)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:31
msgid "If performance is not satisfactory"
msgstr "ຖ້າປະສິດທິພາບຍັງບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ໜ້າເພິ່ງພໍໃຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:32
msgid ""
"To re-tune your installation, you will need to use the dependency graph "
"again.  Start from the node where significant change has happened."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແຜນພູມຄວາມສຳພັນອີກຄັ້ງ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຈາກໂນດທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ສຳຄັນເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Environmental Variables"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:34
msgid ""
"This section contains information about environmental variables (inputs to "
"the tuning process)."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ຂໍ້ມູນນຳເຂົ້າສຳລັບຂະບວນການປັບແຕ່ງ)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network Bandwidth"
msgstr "ແບນວິດເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:36
msgid ""
"A measure of the typically available egress bandwith from the {productname} "
"Server host to the clients or {productname} Proxy hosts.  This should take "
"into account network hardware and topology as well as possible capacity "
"limits on switches, routers, and other network equipment between the server "
"and clients."
msgstr "ການວັດແທກແບນວິດຂາອອກ (egress bandwidth) ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປທີ່ມີຈາກ {productname} Server host ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື {productname} Proxy hosts. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນພິຈາລະນາທັງຮາດແວເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງເຄືອຂ່າຍ (topology) ລວມເຖິງຂີດຈຳກັດຄວາມສາມາດຂອງ switch, router ແລະ ອຸປະກອນເຄືອຂ່າຍອື່ນໆ ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel count"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel count)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:38
msgid ""
"The number of expected channels to manage.  Includes any vendor-provided, "
"third-party, and cloned or staged channels."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ຄາດວ່າຈະບໍລິຫານ. ລວມເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມາຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ, ຈາກພາຍນອກ (third-party), ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກ clone ຫຼື staged ໄວ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client count"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍ (Client count)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:40
msgid ""
"The total number of actual or expected clients.  It is important to tune any "
"parameters in advance of a client count increase, whenever possible."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈິງ ຫຼື ທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ມັນສຳຄັນຫຼາຍທີ່ຕ້ອງປັບແຕ່ງພາຣາມີເຕີໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າກ່ອນທີ່ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "OS mix"
msgstr "ສ່ວນປະສົມຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ (OS mix)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:42
msgid ""
"The number of distinct operating system versions that managed clients have "
"installed.  This is ordered by family ({sle}, openSUSE, {rhel}, or {ubuntu} "
"based).  Storage and computing requirements are different in each case."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງເວີຊັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ເຊິ່ງຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍພາຍໃຕ້ການບໍລິຫານ. ນີ້ຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມຕາມຕະກູນ (ອີງຕາມ {sle}, openSUSE, {rhel}, ຫຼື {ubuntu}). ຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ການປະມວນຜົນຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປໃນແຕ່ລະກໍລະນີ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "User count"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຜູ້ໃຊ້ (User count)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:44
msgid ""
"The expected maximum amount of concurrent users interacting with the {webui} "
"plus the number of programs simultaneously using the XMLRPC API.  Includes "
"`spacecmd`, `spacewalk-clone-by-date`, and similar."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ ເຊິ່ງຈະໃຊ້ງານ {webui} ພ້ອມກັນ ລວມທັງຈຳນວນໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ໃຊ້ XMLRPC API ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ລວມເຖິງ `spacecmd`, `spacewalk-clone-by-date` ແລະ ອື່ນໆທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "ພາຣາມີເຕີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:46
msgid "This section contains information about the available parameters."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບພາຣາມີເຕີທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "`MaxRequestWorkers`"
msgstr "`MaxRequestWorkers`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of HTTP requests served "
"simultaneously by Apache httpd.\n"
"                         Proxies, {webui}, and XMLRPC API clients each "
"consume one.\n"
"                         Requests exceeding the parameter will be queued and "
"might result in timeouts.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:user-count[User count] and proxy count "
"increase significantly and this line appears in "
"[path]``/var/log/apache2/error_log``: [systemitem]``[...] "
"[mpm_prefork:error] [pid ...] AH00161: server reached MaxRequestWorkers "
"setting, consider raising the MaxRequestWorkers setting``.\n"
"| Value default        | 150\n"
"| Value recommendation | 150-500\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/apache2/server-tuning.conf``, in the "
"`prefork.c` section\n"
"| Example              | `MaxRequestWorkers = 200`\n"
"| After changing       | Immediately change xref:server-limit[`ServerLimit`] "
"and check xref:max-threads[`maxThreads`] for possible adjustment.\n"
"| Notes                | This parameter was renamed to `MaxRequestWorkers`, "
"both names are valid.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/en/mod/mpm_common.html#maxrequestworkers\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "`ServerLimit`"
msgstr "`ServerLimit`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The number of Apache httpd processes serving HTTP "
"requests simultaneously.\n"
"                         The number must equal "
"xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`].\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`] "
"changes\n"
"| Value default        | 150\n"
"| Value recommendation | The same value as "
"xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`]\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/apache2/server-tuning.conf``, in the "
"`prefork.c` section\n"
"| Example              | `ServerLimit = 200`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/en/mod/mpm_common.html#serverlimit\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "`maxThreads`"
msgstr "`maxThreads`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The number of Tomcat threads dedicated to serving "
"HTTP requests\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`] "
"changes.\n"
"                         `maxThreads` must always be equal or greater than "
"xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`]\n"
"| Value default        | 150\n"
"| Value recommendation | The same value as "
"xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`]\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/tomcat/server.xml``\n"
"| Example              | `<Connector port=\"8009\" protocol=\"AJP/1.3\" "
"redirectPort=\"8443\" URIEncoding=\"UTF-8\" address=\"127.0.0.1\" "
"maxThreads=\"200\" connectionTimeout=\"20000\"/>`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-9.0-doc/config/http.html\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "`connectionTimeout`"
msgstr "`connectionTimeout`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The number of milliseconds before a non-responding "
"AJP connection is forcibly closed.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly and ``AH00992``, ``AH00877``, and ``AH01030`` errors appear in "
"Apache error logs during a load peak.\n"
"| Value default        | 900000\n"
"| Value recommendation | 20000-3600000\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/tomcat/server.xml``\n"
"| Example              | `<Connector port=\"8009\" protocol=\"AJP/1.3\" "
"redirectPort=\"8443\" URIEncoding=\"UTF-8\" address=\"127.0.0.1\" "
"maxThreads=\"200\" connectionTimeout=\"1000000\" "
"keepAliveTimeout=\"300000\"/>`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-9.0-doc/config/http.html\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍລະອຽດ          | ຈຳນວນມິນລິວິນາທີກ່ອນທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ AJP ທີ່ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງຈະຖືກບັງຄັບປິດ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ ແລະ ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ``AH00992``, ``AH00877``, ແລະ ``AH01030`` ໃນ Apache error logs ໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ມີ load ສູງ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 900000\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 20000-3600000\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | [path]``/etc/tomcat/server.xml``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `<Connector port=\"8009\" protocol=\"AJP/1.3\" redirectPort=\"8443\" URIEncoding=\"UTF-8\" address=\"127.0.0.1\" maxThreads=\"200\" connectionTimeout=\"1000000\" keepAliveTimeout=\"300000\"/>`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-9.0-doc/config/http.html\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "`keepAliveTimeout`"
msgstr "`keepAliveTimeout`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The number of milliseconds without data exchange "
"from the JVM before a non-responding AJP connection is forcibly closed.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly and ``AH00992``, ``AH00877``, and ``AH01030`` errors appear in "
"Apache error logs during a load peak.\n"
"| Value default        | 300000\n"
"| Value recommendation | 20000-600000\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/tomcat/server.xml``\n"
"| Example              | `<Connector port=\"8009\" protocol=\"AJP/1.3\" "
"redirectPort=\"8443\" URIEncoding=\"UTF-8\" address=\"127.0.0.1\" "
"maxThreads=\"200\" connectionTimeout=\"1000000\" "
"keepAliveTimeout=\"400000\"/>`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-9.0-doc/config/http.html\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍລະອຽດ          | ຈຳນວນມິນລິວິນາທີທີ່ບໍ່ມີການແລກປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ JVM ກ່ອນທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ AJP ທີ່ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງຈະຖືກບັງຄັບປິດ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ ແລະ ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ``AH00992``, ``AH00877``, ແລະ ``AH01030`` ໃນ Apache error logs ໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ມີ load ສູງ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 300000\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 20000-600000\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | [path]``/etc/tomcat/server.xml``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `<Connector port=\"8009\" protocol=\"AJP/1.3\" redirectPort=\"8443\" URIEncoding=\"UTF-8\" address=\"127.0.0.1\" maxThreads=\"200\" connectionTimeout=\"1000000\" keepAliveTimeout=\"400000\"/>`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-9.0-doc/config/http.html\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tomcat's `-Xmx`"
msgstr "Tomcat's `-Xmx`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum amount of memory Tomcat can use\n"
"| Tune when            | "
"xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] "
"is increased or\n"
"`OutOfMemoryException` errors appear in `/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`\n"
"| Value default        | 1{nbsp}GiB\n"
"| Value recommendation | 4-8{nbsp}GiB\n"
"| Location             | "
"[path]``/etc/tomcat/conf.d/tomcat_java_opts.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `JAVA_OPTS=\"... -Xmx8G ...\"`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage]\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.oracle.com/javase/8/docs/technotes/tools/windows/java.html\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍລະອຽດ          | ຈຳນວນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງສຸດທີ່ Tomcat ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ເມື່ອ xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື\n"
"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ `OutOfMemoryException` ໃນ `/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 1{nbsp}GiB\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 4-8{nbsp}GiB\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | [path]``/etc/tomcat/conf.d/tomcat_java_opts.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `JAVA_OPTS=\"... -Xmx8G ...\"`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ]\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://docs.oracle.com/javase/8/docs/technotes/tools/windows/java.html\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "`java.disable_list_update_status`"
msgstr "`java.disable_list_update_status`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Disable displaying the update status for clients of "
"a system group\n"
"| Tune when            | displaying the update status causes timeouts\n"
"| Value default        | `false`\n"
"| Value recommendation | \n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `java.disable_list_update_status = true`\n"
"| After changing       | ?\n"
"| Notes                |\n"
"| More information     | `man rhn.conf`\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍລະອຽດ          | ປິດການສະແດງສະຖານະການອັບເດດສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍໃນກຸ່ມລະບົບ\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ການສະແດງສະຖານະການອັບເດດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ timeout\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | `false`\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | \n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `java.disable_list_update_status = true`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງ       | ?\n"
"| ໝາຍເຫດ                |\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | `man rhn.conf`\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`"
msgstr "`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of threads in Tomcat dedicated "
"to asynchronous operations\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly\n"
"| Value default        | 5\n"
"| Value recommendation | 50 - 150\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `java.message_queue_thread_pool_size = 50`\n"
"| After changing       | Check "
"xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`], as each thread "
"consumes a PostgreSQL connection, starvation might happen if the allocated "
"connection pool is insufficient.\n"
"                         Check xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`], as each "
"thread might perform Salt API calls, starvation might happen if the "
"allocated Salt thread pool is insufficient.\n"
"                         Check xref:tomcat-xmx[Tomcat's `-Xmx`], as each "
"thread consumes memory, `OutOfMemoryException` might be raised if "
"insufficient.\n"
"| Notes                | Incoming Salt events are handled in separate thread "
"pool, see "
"xref:java-salt-event-thread-pool-size[`java.salt_event_thread_pool_size`]\n"
"| More information     | `man rhn.conf`\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍລະອຽດ          | ຈຳນວນ threads ສູງສຸດໃນ Tomcat ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກແບບ asynchronous\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 5\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 50 - 150\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `java.message_queue_thread_pool_size = 50`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`], ເພາະແຕ່ລະ thread ຈະໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ PostgreSQL, ອາດເກີດການຂາດແຄນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (starvation) ຫາກ connection pool ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ.\n"
"                         ກວດສອບ xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`], ເພາະແຕ່ລະ thread ອາດມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Salt API, ອາດເກີດການຂາດແຄນຫາກ Salt thread pool ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ.\n"
"                         ກວດສອບ xref:tomcat-xmx[Tomcat's `-Xmx`], ເພາະແຕ່ລະ thread ຈະໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ, ອາດເກີດ `OutOfMemoryException` ຫາກບໍ່ພຽງພໍ.\n"
"| ໝາຍເຫດ                | ເຫດການ Salt ທີ່ເຂົ້າມາຈະຖືກຈັດການໃນ thread pool ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ເບິ່ງ xref:java-salt-event-thread-pool-size[`java.salt_event_thread_pool_size`]\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | `man rhn.conf`\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "`java.salt_batch_size`"
msgstr "`java.salt_batch_size`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of minions concurrently "
"executing a scheduled action.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] reaches several "
"thousands and actions are not executed quickly enough.\n"
"| Value default        | 200\n"
"| Value recommendation | 200-500\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `java.salt_batch_size = 300`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
"                         Monitor memory usage closely before and after the "
"change.\n"
"| More information     | "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc[Salt Rate Limiting]\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍລະອຽດ          | ຈຳນວນ minions ສູງສຸດທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຕາມຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ຕັ້ງຕາຕະລາງໄວ້ພ້ອມໆກັນ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍ] ຮອດລະດັບຫຼາຍພັນເຄື່ອງ ແລະ ຄຳສັ່ງຕ່າງໆເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ໄວພໍ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 200\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 200-500\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `java.salt_batch_size = 300`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ].\n"
"                         ຕິດຕາມການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຢ່າງໃກ້ຊິດຕັງແຕ່ກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc[ການຈຳກັດອັດຕາການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Salt]\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "`java.salt_event_thread_pool_size`"
msgstr "`java.salt_event_thread_pool_size`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of threads in Tomcat dedicated "
"to handling of incoming Salt events.\n"
"| Tune when            | The number of queued Salt events grows. Typically, "
"this can happen during onboarding of large number of minions with higher "
"value of\n"
"                         "
"xref:java-salt-presence-ping-timeout[`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`].\n"
"                         The number of events can be queried by "
"[command]``echo \"select count(*) from susesaltevent;\" \\| spacewalk-sql "
"--select-mode-direct - ``\n"
"| Value default        | 8\n"
"| Value recommendation | 20-100\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `java.salt_event_thread_pool_size = 50`\n"
"| After changing       | Check the length of Salt event queue.\n"
"                         Check "
"xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`], as each thread "
"consumes a PostgreSQL connection, starvation might happen if the allocated "
"connection pool is insufficient.\n"
"                         Check xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`], as each "
"thread might perform Salt API calls, starvation might happen if the "
"allocated Salt thread pool is insufficient.\n"
"                         Check xref:tomcat-xmx[Tomcat's `-Xmx`], as each "
"thread consumes memory, `OutOfMemoryException` might be raised if "
"insufficient.\n"
"| More information     | `man rhn.conf`\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍລະອຽດ          | ຈຳນວນ threads ສູງສຸດໃນ Tomcat ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຈັດການເຫດການ Salt ທີ່ເຂົ້າມາ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ຈຳນວນເຫດການ Salt ທີ່ຄ້າງຄິວເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການ onboarding minions ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ໂດຍທີ່ມີຄ່າ\n"
"                         xref:java-salt-presence-ping-timeout[`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`] ສູງ.\n"
"                         ສາມາດກວດສອບຈຳນວນເຫດການໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``echo \"select count(*) from susesaltevent;\" \\| spacewalk-sql --select-mode-direct - ``\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 8\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 20-100\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `java.salt_event_thread_pool_size = 50`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບຄວາມຍາວຂອງຄິວເຫດການ Salt.\n"
"                         ກວດສອບ xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`], ເພາະແຕ່ລະ thread ຈະໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ PostgreSQL, ອາດເກີດການຂາດແຄນຫາກ connection pool ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ.\n"
"                         ກວດສອບ xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`], ເພາະແຕ່ລະ thread ອາດມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Salt API, ອາດເກີດການຂາດແຄນຫາກ Salt thread pool ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ.\n"
"                         ກວດສອບ xref:tomcat-xmx[Tomcat's `-Xmx`], ເພາະແຕ່ລະ thread ຈະໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ, ອາດເກີດ `OutOfMemoryException` ຫາກບໍ່ພຽງພໍ.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | `man rhn.conf`\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`"
msgstr "`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Before any action is executed on a client, a "
"presence ping is executed to make sure the client is reachable.\n"
"                         This parameter sets the amount of time before a "
"second command (in most cases `state.apply` or any other {salt} function) is "
"sent to the client to verify its presence.\n"
"                         Having many clients typically means some will "
"respond faster than others, so this timeout could be raised to accommodate "
"for the slower ones.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly, or some clients are responding correctly but too slowly, and "
"{productname} excludes them from calls.\n"
"                         This line appears in "
"[path]``/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log``: [systemitem]``\"Got no result for "
"<COMMAND> on minion <MINION_ID> (minion did not respond in time)\"``\n"
"| Value default        | 4 seconds\n"
"| Value recommendation | 4-20 seconds\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `java.salt_presence_ping_timeout = 10`\n"
"| After changing       | Large `java.salt_presence_ping_timeout` value can "
"reduce overall throughput.\n"
"                         This can be compensated by increasing "
"xref:java-salt-event-thread-pool-size[`java.salt_event_thread_pool_size`]\n"
"| More information     | "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-timeouts.adoc[Salt Timeouts]\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍລະອຽດ          | ກ່ອນທີ່ຄຳສັ່ງໃດໆຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນລູກຂ່າຍ, ຈະມີການ ping ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າມັນຍັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"                         ພາຣາມີເຕີນີກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາ (ວິນາທີ) ກ່ອນທີ່ຄຳສັ່ງທີສອງ (ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຄື `state.apply` ຫຼື ຟັງຊັນ {salt} ອື່ນໆ) ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍເພື່ອຢືນຢັນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່.\n"
"                         ການມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໝາຍຄວາມວ່າບາງເຄື່ອງຈະຕອບສະໜອງໄວກວ່າເຄື່ອງອື່ນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ timeout ນີ້ອາດຕ້ອງປັບໃຫ້ສູງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຮອງຮັບເຄື່ອງທີ່ຊ້າ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ, ຫຼື ລູກຂ່າຍບາງເຄື່ອງຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ແຕ່ຊ້າເກີນໄປ ແລະ {productname} ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອອກ.\n"
"                         ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມປະກົດໃນ [path]``/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`` ວ່າ: [systemitem]``\"Got no result for <COMMAND> on minion <MINION_ID> (minion did not respond in time)\"``\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 4 ວິນາທີ\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 4-20 ວິນາທີ\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `java.salt_presence_ping_timeout = 10`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງ       | ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `java.salt_presence_ping_timeout` ທີ່ສູງເກີນໄປອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍຮວມຫຼຸດລົງ.\n"
"                         ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ດ້ວຍການເພີ່ມ xref:java-salt-event-thread-pool-size[`java.salt_event_thread_pool_size`]\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-timeouts.adoc[Salt Timeouts]\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "`java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout`"
msgstr "`java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Before any action is executed on a client, a "
"presence ping is executed to make sure the client is reachable.\n"
"                         After "
"xref:java-salt-presence-ping-timeout[`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`] "
"seconds have elapsed without a response, a second command (in most cases "
"`state.apply` or any other {salt} function) is sent to the client and if "
"there is no response from the client for the amount of seconds specified "
"with this parameter one more call (`saltutil.find_job`) is sent for a final "
"check.\n"
"                         This parameter sets the number of seconds after the "
"second command after which the client is definitely considered timeout.\n"
"                         Having many clients typically means some will "
"respond faster than others, so this timeout could be raised to accommodate "
"for the slower ones.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly, or some clients are responding correctly but too slowly, and "
"{productname} excludes them from calls.\n"
"                         This line appears in "
"[path]``/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log``: [systemitem]``\"Got no result for "
"<COMMAND> on minion <MINION_ID> (minion did not respond in time)\"``\n"
"| Value default        | 1 second\n"
"| Value recommendation | 1-50 seconds\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout = 20`\n"
"| More information     | "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-timeouts.adoc[Salt Timeouts]\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍລະອຽດ          | ກ່ອນທີ່ຄຳສັ່ງໃດໆຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນລູກຂ່າຍ, ຈະມີການ ping ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າມັນຍັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"                         ຫຼັງຈາກ xref:java-salt-presence-ping-timeout[`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`] ວິນາທີຜ່ານໄປໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຕອບສະໜອງ, ຄຳສັ່ງທີສອງຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປ ແລະ ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ມີການຕອບສະໜອງພາຍໃນຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ກຳນົດໃນພາຣາມີເຕີນີ, ຈະມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງສຸດທ້າຍ (`saltutil.find_job`) ເພື່ອກວດສອບເປັນເທື່ອສຸດທ້າຍ.\n"
"                         ພາຣາມີເຕີນີກຳນົດຈຳນວນວິນາທີຫຼັງຈາກຄຳສັ່ງທີສອງ ກ່ອນທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຖືກຖືວ່າ timeout ຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ.\n"
"                         ການມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໝາຍຄວາມວ່າບາງເຄື່ອງຈະຕອບສະໜອງໄວກວ່າເຄື່ອງອື່ນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ timeout ນີ້ອາດຕ້ອງປັບໃຫ້ສູງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຮອງຮັບເຄື່ອງທີ່ຊ້າ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ, ຫຼື ລູກຂ່າຍບາງເຄື່ອງຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ແຕ່ຊ້າເກີນໄປ ແລະ {productname} ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອອກ.\n"
"                         ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມປະກົດໃນ [path]``/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`` ວ່າ: [systemitem]``\"Got no result for <COMMAND> on minion <MINION_ID> (minion did not respond in time)\"``\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 1 ວິນາທີ\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 1-50 ວິນາທີ\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout = 20`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-timeouts.adoc[Salt Timeouts]\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "`java.taskomatic_channel_repodata_workers`"
msgstr "`java.taskomatic_channel_repodata_workers`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Whenever content is changed in a software channel, "
"its metadata needs to be recomputed before clients can use it.\n"
"                         Channel-altering operations include the addition of "
"a patch, the removal of a package or a repository synchronization run.\n"
"                         This parameter specifies the maximum number of "
"Taskomatic threads that {productname} will use to recompute the channel "
"metadata.\n"
"                         Channel metadata computation is both CPU-bound and "
"memory-heavy, so raising this parameter and operating on many channels "
"simultaneously could cause Taskomatic to consume significant resources, but "
"channels will be available to clients sooner.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:channel-count[Channel count] becomes larger "
"than 50, or more concurrent operations on channels are expected.\n"
"| Value default        | 2\n"
"| Value recommendation | 2-10\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `java.taskomatic_channel_repodata_workers = 4`\n"
"| After changing       | Check "
"xref:taskomatic-java-maxmemory[`taskomatic.java.maxmemory`] for adjustment, "
"as every new thread will consume memory\n"
"| More information     | `man rhn.conf`\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "`taskomatic.java.maxmemory`"
msgstr "`taskomatic.java.maxmemory`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum amount of memory Taskomatic can use.\n"
"                         Generation of metadata, especially for some OSs, "
"can be memory-intensive, so this parameter might need raising depending on "
"the managed xref:os-mix[OS mix].\n"
"| Tune when            | "
"xref:java-taskomatic-channel-repodata-workers[`java.taskomatic_channel_repodata_workers`] "
"increases, OSs are added to {productname} (particularly {rhel} or {ubuntu}), "
"or `OutOfMemoryException` errors appear in "
"`/var/log/rhn/rhn_taskomatic_daemon.log`.\n"
"| Value default        | 4096 MiB\n"
"| Value recommendation | 4096-16384 MiB\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `taskomatic.java.maxmemory = 8192`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
"| More information     | `man rhn.conf`\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍລະອຽດ          | ຈຳນວນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງສຸດທີ່ Taskomatic ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"
"                         ການສ້າງ metadata, ໂດຍສະເພາະບາງ OS, ອາດໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພາຣາມີເຕີນີອາດຕ້ອງປັບເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບ xref:os-mix[ສ່ວນປະສົມຂອງ OS] ທີ່ບໍລິຫານ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ເມື່ອ xref:java-taskomatic-channel-repodata-workers[`java.taskomatic_channel_repodata_workers`] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ມີການເພີ່ມ OS ເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} (ໂດຍສະເພາະ {rhel} ຫຼື {ubuntu}), ຫຼື ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ `OutOfMemoryException` ໃນ `/var/log/rhn/rhn_taskomatic_daemon.log`.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 4096 MiB\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 4096-16384 MiB\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `taskomatic.java.maxmemory = 8192`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ].\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | `man rhn.conf`\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`"
msgstr "`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The number of Taskomatic worker threads.\n"
"                         Increasing this value allows Taskomatic to serve "
"more clients in parallel.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly\n"
"| Value default        | 20\n"
"| Value recommendation | 20-200\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount = 100`\n"
"| After changing       | Check "
"xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`] and "
"xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`] for adjustment\n"
"| More information     | "
"http://www.quartz-scheduler.org/documentation/2.4.0-SNAPSHOT/configuration.html\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍລະອຽດ          | ຈຳນວນ Taskomatic worker threads.\n"
"                         ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ Taskomatic ບໍລິຫານລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນເວລາພ້ອມກັນ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 20\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 20-200\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount = 100`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`] ແລະ xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`] ເພື່ອປັບຄ່າໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | http://www.quartz-scheduler.org/documentation/2.4.0-SNAPSHOT/configuration.html\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "`org.quartz.scheduler.idleWaitTime`"
msgstr "`org.quartz.scheduler.idleWaitTime`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:78
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Cycle time for Taskomatic.\n"
"                         Decreasing this value lowers the latency of "
"Taskomatic.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] is in the "
"thousands.\n"
"| Value default        | 5000 ms\n"
"| Value recommendation | 1000-5000 ms\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `org.quartz.scheduler.idleWaitTime = 1000`\n"
"| More information     | "
"http://www.quartz-scheduler.org/documentation/2.4.0-SNAPSHOT/configuration.html\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍລະອຽດ          | ຮອບເວລາການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Taskomatic.\n"
"                         ການຫຼຸດຄ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຄວາມໜ່ວງ (latency) ຂອງ Taskomatic.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍ] ຢູ່ໃນລະດັບຫຼາຍພັນເຄື່ອງ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 5000 ms\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 1000-5000 ms\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `org.quartz.scheduler.idleWaitTime = 1000`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | http://www.quartz-scheduler.org/documentation/2.4.0-SNAPSHOT/configuration.html\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "`MinionActionExecutor.parallel_threads`"
msgstr "`MinionActionExecutor.parallel_threads`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:80
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Number of Taskomatic threads dedicated to sending "
"commands to Salt clients as a result of actions being executed.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] is in the "
"thousands.\n"
"| Value default        | 1\n"
"| Value recommendation | 1-10\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `taskomatic.minion_action_executor.parallel_threads "
"= 10`\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "`SSHMinionActionExecutor.parallel_threads`"
msgstr "`SSHMinionActionExecutor.parallel_threads`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Number of Taskomatic threads dedicated to sending "
"commands to Salt SSH clients as a result of actions being executed.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] is in the "
"hundreds.\n"
"| Value default        | 20\n"
"| Value recommendation | 20-100\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | "
"`taskomatic.sshminion_action_executor.parallel_threads = 40`\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`"
msgstr "`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Maximum number of PostgreSQL connections "
"simultaneously available to both Tomcat and Taskomatic.\n"
"                         If any of those components requires more concurrent "
"connections, their requests will be queued.\n"
"| Tune when            | "
"xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] "
"or xref:max-threads[`maxThreads`] increase significantly, or when "
"xref:org-quartz-threadPool-threadCount[`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`] "
"has changed significantly.\n"
"                         Each thread consumes one connection in Taskomatic "
"and Tomcat, having more threads than connections might result in starving.\n"
"| Value default        | 20\n"
"| Value recommendation | 100 to 200, higher than the maximum of "
"xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] "
"+ xref:max-threads[`maxThreads`] and "
"xref:org-quartz-threadPool-threadCount[`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`]\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `hibernate.c3p0.max_size = 100`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:max-connections[`max_connections`] for "
"adjustment.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://www.mchange.com/projects/c3p0/#maxPoolSize\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ PostgreSQL ສູງສຸດທີ່ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ພ້ອມກັນ.\n"
"                         ຫາກສ່ວນປະກອບໃດໜຶ່ງຕ້ອງການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າທີ່ກຳນົດ, ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຈະຖືກຈັດເຂົ້າຄິວ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] ຫຼື xref:max-threads[`maxThreads`] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອ xref:org-quartz-threadPool-threadCount[`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼາຍ.\n"
"                         ແຕ່ລະເທຣດຈະໃຊ້ໜຶ່ງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນ Taskomatic ແລະ Tomcat, ການມີເທຣດຫຼາຍກວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຂາດແຄນຊັບພະຍາກອນ (starving).\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 20\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 100 ຫາ 200, ເຊິ່ງຄວນສູງກວ່າຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງ xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] + xref:max-threads[`maxThreads`] ແລະ xref:org-quartz-threadPool-threadCount[`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`]\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບ             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `hibernate.c3p0.max_size = 100`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:max-connections[`max_connections`] ເພື່ອປັບຄ່າໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://www.mchange.com/projects/c3p0/#maxPoolSize\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "`rhn-search.java.maxmemory`"
msgstr "`rhn-search.java.maxmemory`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum amount of memory that the `rhn-search` "
"service can use.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly, and `OutOfMemoryException` errors appear in `journalctl -u "
"rhn-search`.\n"
"| Value default        | 512 MiB\n"
"| Value recommendation | 512-4096 MiB\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `rhn-search.java.maxmemory = 4096`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ປະລິມານໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງສຸດທີ່ບໍລິການ `rhn-search` ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນ Client] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ແລະ ພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ `OutOfMemoryException` ໃນ `journalctl -u rhn-search`.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 512 MiB\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 512-4096 MiB\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບ             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `rhn-search.java.maxmemory = 4096`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ].\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "`shared_buffers`"
msgstr "`shared_buffers`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The amount of memory reserved for PostgreSQL shared "
"buffers, which contain caches of database tables and index data.\n"
"| Tune when            | RAM changes\n"
"| Value default        | 25% of total RAM\n"
"| Value recommendation | 25-40% of total RAM\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data/postgresql.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `shared_buffers = 8192MB`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-resource.html#GUC-SHARED-BUFFERS\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ປະລິມານໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຈອງໄວ້ສຳລັບ shared buffers ຂອງ PostgreSQL, ເຊິ່ງເກັບແຄຊ (caches) ຂອງຕາຕະລາງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນອິນເດັກ (index).\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ RAM\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 25% ຂອງ RAM ທັງໝົດ\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 25-40% ຂອງ RAM ທັງໝົດ\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບ             | [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data/postgresql.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `shared_buffers = 8192MB`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ].\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-resource.html#GUC-SHARED-BUFFERS\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_connections`"
msgstr "`max_connections`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Maximum number of PostgreSQL connections available "
"to applications.\n"
"                         More connections allow for more concurrent "
"threads/workers in various components (in particular Tomcat and Taskomatic), "
"which generally improves performance.\n"
"                         However, each connection consumes resources, in "
"particular xref:work-mem[`work_mem`] megabytes per sort operation per "
"connection.\n"
"| Tune when            | "
"xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`] changes "
"significantly, as that parameter determines the maximum number of "
"connections available to Tomcat and Taskomatic\n"
"| Value default        | 400\n"
"| Value recommendation | Depends on other settings, use "
"[command]``/usr/lib/susemanager/bin/susemanager-connection-check`` to obtain "
"a recommendation.\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data/postgresql.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `max_connections = 250`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
"                         Monitor memory usage closely before and after the "
"change.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-connection.html#GUC-MAX-CONNECTIONS\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ PostgreSQL ສູງສຸດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຕ່າງໆ.\n"
"                         ການມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມີເທຣດ/ຜູ້ເຮັດວຽກພ້ອມກັນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນສ່ວນປະກອບຕ່າງໆ (ໂດຍສະເພາະ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic), ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ.\n"
"                         ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ແຕ່ລະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ, ໂດຍສະເພາະ xref:work-mem[`work_mem`] ເມກາໄບຕ໌ຕໍ່ການດຳເນີນການຈັດລຽງ (sort) ຕໍ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ເນື່ອງຈາກຄ່ານີ້ເປັນຕົວກຳນົດຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສູງສຸດສຳລັບ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 400\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | ຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``/usr/lib/susemanager/bin/susemanager-connection-check`` ເພື່ອຮັບຄຳແນະນຳ.\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບ             | [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data/postgresql.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `max_connections = 250`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ].\n"
"                         ຕິດຕາມການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຢ່າງໃກ້ຊິດທັງກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-connection.html#GUC-MAX-CONNECTIONS\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "`work_mem`"
msgstr "`work_mem`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The amount of memory allocated by PostgreSQL every "
"time a connection needs to do a sort or hash operation.\n"
"                         Every connection (as specified by "
"xref:max-connections[`max_connections`]) might make use of an amount of "
"memory equal to a multiple of `work_mem`.\n"
"| Tune when            | Database operations are slow because of excessive "
"temporary file disk I/O.\n"
"To test if that is happening, add ``log_temp_files = 5120`` to "
"[path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data/postgresql.conf``, restart PostgreSQL, and "
"monitor the PostgreSQL log files.\n"
"If you see lines containing ``LOG:  temporary file:`` try raising this "
"parameter's value to help reduce disk I/O and speed up database "
"operations.\n"
"| Value recommendation | 2-20 MB\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data/postgresql.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `work_mem = 10MB`\n"
"| After changing       | check if the {productname} Server might need "
"additional RAM.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-resource.html#GUC-WORK-MEM\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ປະລິມານໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ PostgreSQL ຈັດສັນໃຫ້ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກຈັດລຽງ (sort) ຫຼື ແຮຊ (hash).\n"
"                         ແຕ່ລະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໃນ xref:max-connections[`max_connections`]) ອາດຈະໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເປັນຈຳນວນເທົ່າຂອງ `work_mem`.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ການດຳເນີນການຖານຂໍ້ມູນຊ້າລົງຍ້ອນມີ disk I/O ຂອງໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ.\n"
"ເພື່ອທົດສອບວ່າເຫດການນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ``log_temp_files = 5120`` ເຂົ້າໃນ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data/postgresql.conf``, ຣີສະຕາດ PostgreSQL, ແລະ ຕິດຕາມໄຟລ໌ log ຂອງ PostgreSQL.\n"
"ຫາກທ່ານເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຄຳວ່າ ``LOG: temporary file:`` ໃຫ້ລອງເພີ່ມຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດ disk I/O ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການດຳເນີນການຖານຂໍ້ມູນໄວຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 2-20 MB\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບ             | [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data/postgresql.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `work_mem = 10MB`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບວ່າ {productname} Server ອາດຕ້ອງການ RAM ເພີ່ມເຕີມຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-resource.html#GUC-WORK-MEM\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "`effective_cache_size`"
msgstr "`effective_cache_size`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Estimation of the total memory available to "
"PostgreSQL for caching.\n"
"                         It is the explicitly reserved memory "
"(xref:shared-buffers[`shared_buffers`]) plus any memory used by the kernel "
"as cache/buffer.\n"
"| Tune when            | Hardware RAM or memory usage increase "
"significantly\n"
"| Value recommendation | Start with 75% of total RAM.\n"
"                         For finer settings, use "
"xref:shared-buffers[`shared_buffers`] + free memory + buffer/cache memory.\n"
"                         Free and buffer/cache can be determined via the "
"`free -m` command (`free` and `buff/cache` in the output respectively)\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data/postgresql.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `effective_cache_size = 24GB`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage]\n"
"| Notes                | This is an estimation for the query planner, not an "
"allocation.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-query.html#GUC-EFFECTIVE-CACHE-SIZE\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ການຄາດຄະເນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທັງໝົດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ PostgreSQL ສຳລັບການເຮັດແຄຊ (caching).\n"
"                         ມັນຄືໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຈອງໄວ້ໂດຍສະເພາະ (xref:shared-buffers[`shared_buffers`]) ບວກກັບໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ kernel ໃຊ້ເປັນ cache/buffer.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | RAM ຂອງຮາດແວ ຫຼື ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ 75% ຂອງ RAM ທັງໝົດ.\n"
"                         ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ xref:shared-buffers[`shared_buffers`] + ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ວ່າງ (free memory) + ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ buffer/cache.\n"
"                         ຄ່າ Free ແລະ buffer/cache ສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ `free -m` (ເບິ່ງຄ່າ `free` ແລະ `buff/cache` ໃນຜົນລັອກຕາມລຳດັບ)\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບ             | [path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data/postgresql.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `effective_cache_size = 24GB`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ]\n"
"| ໝາຍເຫດ                | ນີ້ແມ່ນການຄາດຄະເນສຳລັບຕົວວາງແຜນການສອບຖາມ (query planner), ບໍ່ແມ່ນການຈັດສັນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຈິງ.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-query.html#GUC-EFFECTIVE-CACHE-SIZE\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "`thread_pool`"
msgstr "`thread_pool`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The number of worker threads serving Salt API HTTP "
"requests.\n"
"                         A higher number can improve parallelism of "
"{productname} Server-initiated Salt operations, but will consume more "
"memory.\n"
"| Tune when            | "
"xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] "
"or "
"xref:org-quartz-threadPool-threadCount[`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`] "
"are changed.\n"
"                         Starvation can occur when there are more Tomcat or "
"Taskomatic threads making simultaneous Salt API calls than there are Salt "
"API worker threads.\n"
"| Value default        | 100\n"
"| Value recommendation | 100-500, but should be higher than the sum of "
"xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] "
"and "
"xref:org-quartz-threadPool-threadCount[`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`]\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf``, in "
"the `rest_cherrypy` section.\n"
"| Example              | `thread_pool: 100`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:worker-threads[`worker_threads`] for "
"adjustment.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/netapi/all/salt.netapi.rest_cherrypy.html#performance-tuning\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "`worker_threads`"
msgstr "`worker_threads`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:98
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The number of `salt-master` worker threads that "
"process commands and replies from minions and the Salt API.\n"
"                         Increasing this value, assuming sufficient "
"resources are available, allows Salt to process more data in parallel from "
"minions without timing out, but will consume significantly more RAM "
"(typically about 70 MiB per thread).\n"
"                         Setting this value to very high values could cause "
"opposite effect as the workers will compete to each other for the CPU "
"resources and the performance could be dropped significantly.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly, xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`] increases significantly, or "
"`SaltReqTimeoutError` or `Message timed out` errors appear in "
"`/var/log/salt/master` could be a sign of too low or too high value of this "
"parameter.\n"
"| Value default        | 8\n"
"| Value recommendation | 8-32, depending on the number of the CPU cores "
"available for the server, it is recommended to keep the value slightly less "
"than the number of CPU cores.\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `worker_threads: 16`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
"                         Monitor memory usage closely before and after the "
"change.\n"
"                         It makes sense to monitor the `salt-master` stats "
"event by enabling `master_stats` and adjusting `master_stats_event_iter` to "
"fine tune the value of this parameter.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#worker-threads\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "`auth_events`"
msgstr "`auth_events`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:100
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Determines whether the master will fire "
"authentication events. Authentication events are fired when a minion "
"performs an authentication check with the master.\n"
"                         It helps to reduce the number of events published "
"with the Salt Master Event Publisher and reduce the workload on Event "
"Publisher subscribers.\n"
"| Tune when            | Large amount of `salt/auth` events published in the "
"Salt event bus, which in most cases are useless for the subscribers.\n"
"| Value default        | True\n"
"| Value recommendation | False\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `auth_events: False`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#auth-events\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ກຳນົດວ່າ master ຈະສົ່ງເຫດການການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (authentication events) ຫຼືບໍ່. ເຫດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອ minion ເຮັດການກວດສອບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບ master.\n"
"                         ມັນຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຈຳນວນເຫດການທີ່ຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ຜ່ານ Salt Master Event Publisher ແລະ ຫຼຸດພາລະວຽກຂອງຜູ້ຕິດຕາມເຫດການ (subscribers).\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ມີເຫດການ `salt/auth` ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໃນ Salt event bus, ເຊິ່ງສ່ວນຫຼາຍແລ້ວບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບຜູ້ຕິດຕາມ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | True\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | False\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບ             | [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `auth_events: False`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#auth-events\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:101
#, no-wrap
msgid "`minion_data_cache_events`"
msgstr "`minion_data_cache_events`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:102
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Determines whether the master will fire minion data "
"cache events (`minion/refresh/*`). Minion data cache events are fired when a "
"minion requests a minion data cache refresh.\n"
"                         It helps to reduce the number of events published "
"with the Salt Master Event Publisher and reduce the workload on Event "
"Publisher subscribers.\n"
"| Tune when            | Large amount of `minion/refresh/*` events published "
"in the Salt event bus, which in most cases are useless for the "
"subscribers.\n"
"| Value default        | True\n"
"| Value recommendation | False\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `minion_data_cache_events: False`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#minion-data-cache-events\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ກຳນົດວ່າ master ຈະສົ່ງເຫດການແຄຊຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ minion (`minion/refresh/*`) ຫຼືບໍ່. ເຫດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອ minion ຮ້ອງຂໍການຣີເຟຣຊແຄຊຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"                         ມັນຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຈຳນວນເຫດການທີ່ຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ຜ່ານ Salt Master Event Publisher ແລະ ຫຼຸດພາລະວຽກຂອງຜູ້ຕິດຕາມເຫດການ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ມີເຫດການ `minion/refresh/*` ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໃນ Salt event bus, ເຊິ່ງສ່ວນຫຼາຍແລ້ວບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບຜູ້ຕິດຕາມ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | True\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | False\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບ             | [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `minion_data_cache_events: False`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#minion-data-cache-events\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "`pub_hwm`"
msgstr "`pub_hwm`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:104
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of outstanding messages sent by "
"`salt-master`. If more than this number of messages need to be sent "
"concurrently, communication with clients slows down, potentially resulting "
"in timeout errors during load peaks.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly and ``Salt request timed out. The master is not responding.`` "
"errors appear when pinging minions during a load peak.\n"
"| Value default        | 1000\n"
"| Value recommendation | 10000-100000\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `pub_hwm: 10000`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#pub-hwm, "
"https://zeromq.org/socket-api/#high-water-mark\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:105
#, no-wrap
msgid "`zmq_backlog`"
msgstr "`zmq_backlog`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of allowed client connections "
"that have started but not concluded the opening process. If more than this "
"number of clients connects in a very short time frame, connections are "
"dropped and clients experience a delay re-connecting.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly and very many clients reconnect in a short time frame, TCP "
"connections to the `salt-master` process get dropped by the kernel.\n"
"| Value default        | 1000\n"
"| Value recommendation | 1000-5000\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `zmq_backlog: 2000`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#zmq-backlog, "
"http://api.zeromq.org/3-0:zmq-getsockopt (`ZMQ_BACKLOG`)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid "`swappiness`"
msgstr "`swappiness`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | How aggressively the kernel moves unused data from "
"memory to the swap partition.\n"
"                         Setting a lower parameter typically reduces swap "
"usage and results in better performance, especially when RAM memory is "
"abundant.\n"
"| Tune when            | RAM increases, or swap is used when RAM memory is "
"sufficient.\n"
"| Value default        | 60\n"
"| Value recommendation | 1-60. For 128{nbsp}GB of RAM, 10 is expected to "
"give good results.\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/sysctl.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `vm.swappiness = 20`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-tuning-memory.html#cha-tuning-memory-vm\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ລະດັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມງວດທີ່ kernel ຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຈາກໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໄປຍັງພື້ນທີ່ swap.\n"
"                         ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີໃຫ້ຕ່ຳລົງ ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດການນຳໃຊ້ swap ແລະ ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບດີຂຶ້ນ, ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອມີ RAM ພຽງພໍ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | RAM ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ຫຼື ມີການໃຊ້ swap ທັງທີ່ RAM ຍັງເຫຼືອພຽງພໍ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 60\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 1-60. ສຳລັບ RAM 128 GB, ຄ່າ 10 ມັກຈະໃຫ້ຜົນລັບທີ່ດີ.\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບ             | [path]``/etc/sysctl.conf``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `vm.swappiness = 20`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-tuning-memory.html#cha-tuning-memory-vm\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "`wait_for_backend`"
msgstr "`wait_for_backend`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:110
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Determines whether the `salt-broker` service should "
"wait for backend sockets to be connected before opening the sockets for "
"listening for connections from `salt-minions`.\n"
"                         When enabled, it helps to prevent collecting ZeroMQ "
"messages with the internal buffers of the sockets and pushing them to the "
"`salt-master` once connection is restored.\n"
"| Tune when            | Unstable connectivity between the {productname} "
"Proxy and the {productname} Server.\n"
"| Value default        | False\n"
"| Value recommendation | True\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/salt/broker``\n"
"| Example              | `wait_for_backend: True`\n"
"| More information     | "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-connectivity.adoc#proxies-connectivity[Proxies "
"Connectivity]\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ກຳນົດວ່າບໍລິການ `salt-broker` ຄວນລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ backend sockets ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເປີດ sockets ເພື່ອລໍຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກ `salt-minions` ຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"                         ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ມັນຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນການສະສົມຂໍ້ຄວາມ ZeroMQ ໃນ buffer ພາຍໃນຂອງ sockets ແລະ ການສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄປຍັງ `salt-master` ໃນທັນທີທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຄືນມາ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງ {productname} Proxy ແລະ {productname} Server ບໍ່ສະຖຽນ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | False\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | True\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບ             | [path]``/etc/salt/broker``\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `wait_for_backend: True`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-connectivity.adoc#proxies-connectivity[ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Proxies]\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "`tcp_keepalive`"
msgstr "`tcp_keepalive`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:112
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The tcp keepalive interval to set on TCP "
"ports. This setting can be used to tune Salt connectivity issues in messy "
"network environments with misbehaving firewalls.\n"
"| Tune when            | Unstable connectivity between managed clients and "
"the {productname} Proxy or the {productname} Server.\n"
"| Value default        | True\n"
"| Value recommendation | True\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/venv-salt-minon/minion.d/tuning.conf`` "
"or [path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/tuning.conf``, depending on the minion type.\n"
"| Example              | `tcp_keepalive: True`\n"
"| After changing       | Check "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-connectivity.adoc#minions-connectivity[Minions "
"Connectivity] for more details to fine tune extra keepalive parameters.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/minion.html#tcp-keepalive, "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-connectivity.adoc#minions-connectivity[Minions "
"Connectivity]\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງ tcp keepalive ທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນພອດ TCP. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງ Salt ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີບັນຫາ ຫຼື firewall ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຜິດປົກກະຕິ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງ clients ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ ແລະ {productname} Proxy ຫຼື {productname} Server ບໍ່ສະຖຽນ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | True\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | True\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບ             | [path]``/etc/venv-salt-minon/minion.d/tuning.conf`` ຫຼື [path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/tuning.conf``, ຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງ minion.\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `tcp_keepalive: True`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-connectivity.adoc#minions-connectivity[ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Minions] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີ keepalive ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/minion.html#tcp-keepalive, xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-connectivity.adoc#minions-connectivity[ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Minions]\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "Memory Usage"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:114
msgid ""
"Adjusting some of the parameters listed in this section can result in a "
"higher amount of RAM being used by various components.  It is important that "
"the amount of hardware RAM is adequate after any significant change."
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີບາງຕົວທີ່ລະບຸໃນສ່ວນນີ້ ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີການໃຊ້ RAM ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນສ່ວນປະກອບຕ່າງໆ. ສິ່ງສຳຄັນຄືຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າ RAM ຂອງຮາດແວມີພຽງພໍຫຼັງຈາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ສຳຄັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:115
msgid ""
"To determine how RAM is being used, you will need to check each process that "
"consumes it."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕວດສອບວ່າ RAM ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແນວໃດ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບແຕ່ລະໂປຣເຊສທີ່ໃຊ້ງານມັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operating system"
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:117
msgid ""
"Stop all {productname} services and inspect the output of [command]``free "
"-h``."
msgstr "ຢຸດບໍລິການ {productname} ທັງໝົດ ແລະ ກວດສອບຜົນລັອກຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``free -h``."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:118
#, no-wrap
msgid "Java-based components"
msgstr "ສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Java"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:119
msgid ""
"This includes Taskomatic, Tomcat, and `rhn-search`.  These services support "
"a configurable memory cap."
msgstr "ເຊິ່ງລວມມີ Taskomatic, Tomcat, ແລະ `rhn-search`. ບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຮອງຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂີດຈຳກັດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:120
#, no-wrap
msgid "The {productname} Server"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:121
msgid ""
"Depends on many factors and can only be estimated.  Measure PostgreSQL "
"reserved memory by checking xref:shared-buffers[`shared_buffers`], "
"permanently.  You can also multiply xref:work-mem[`work_mem`] and "
"xref:max-connections[`max_connections`], and multiply by three for a worst "
"case estimate of per-query RAM.  You will also need to check the operating "
"system buffers and caches, which are used by PostgreSQL to host copies of "
"database data.  These often automatically occupy any available RAM."
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນກັບຫຼາຍປັດໄຈ ແລະ ສາມາດຄາດຄະເນໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ວັດແທກໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ PostgreSQL ຈອງໄວ້ໂດຍກວດສອບ xref:shared-buffers[`shared_buffers`] ແບບຖາວອນ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຄູນ xref:work-mem[`work_mem`] ກັບ xref:max-connections[`max_connections`], ແລ້ວຄູນດ້ວຍສາມ ເພື່ອຄາດຄະເນການໃຊ້ RAM ຕໍ່ query ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຮ້າຍແຮງທີ່ສຸດ. ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງກວດສອບ buffers ແລະ caches ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ເຊິ່ງ PostgreSQL ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບສຳເນົາຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມັກຈະຈອງ RAM ທີ່ວ່າງຢູ່ທັງໝົດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:122
msgid ""
"It is important that the {productname} Server has sufficient RAM to "
"accommodate all of these processes, especially OS buffers and caches, to "
"have reasonable PostgreSQL performance.  We recommend you keep several "
"gigabytes available at all times, and add more as the database size on disk "
"increases."
msgstr "ເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ {productname} Server ຕ້ອງມີ RAM ພຽງພໍສຳລັບທຸກໂປຣເຊສເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ໂດຍສະເພາະ OS buffers ແລະ caches ເພື່ອໃຫ້ PostgreSQL ມີປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫຼືອພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໄວ້ຫຼາຍໆກິກາໄບຕ໌ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ, ແລະ ເພີ່ມ RAM ເມື່ອຂະໜາດຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນໃນດິສກ໌ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:123
msgid ""
"Whenever the expected amount of memory available for OS buffers and caches "
"changes, update the `effective_cache_size` parameter to have PostgreSQL use "
"it correctly.  You can calculate the total available by finding the total "
"RAM available, less the expected memory usage."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ປະລິມານໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ສຳລັບ OS buffers ແລະ caches ປ່ຽນແປງ, ໃຫ້ອັບເດດພາຣາມິເຕີ `effective_cache_size` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ PostgreSQL ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ທ່ານສາມາດຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າທັງໝົດໄດ້ໂດຍການເອົາ RAM ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ ລົບດ້ວຍປະລິມານການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:124
msgid ""
"To get a live breakdown of the memory used by services on the {productname} "
"Server, use this command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງບໍລິການຕ່າງໆໃນ {productname} Server ແບບສົດໆ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:125
#, no-wrap
msgid "pidstat -p ALL -r --human 1 60 | tee pidstat-memory.log\n"
msgstr "pidstat -p ALL -r --human 1 60 | tee pidstat-memory.log\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:126
msgid ""
"This command will save a copy of displayed data in the `pidstat-memory.log` "
"file for later analysis."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະບັນທຶກສຳເນົາຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສະແດງອອກມາໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ `pidstat-memory.log` ເພື່ອການວິເຄາະໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:127
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy"
msgstr "Proxy"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "`cache_dir`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:129
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The amount of storage space for the squid cache "
"directory.\n"
"| Tune when            | More than the default storage space is required.\n"
"| Value default        | 100\n"
"| Value recommendation | 60 % of available free space\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/squid/squid.conf``\n"
"| Example              | cache_dir aufs /var/cache/squid 15000 16 256\n"
"| After changing       | \n"
"| More information     | [path]``/etc/squid/squid.conf.documented''\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:130
msgid ""
"In general, {suse} recommends to adjust the value for the cache directory to "
"about 60 % of available free space.  Users can set the [option]``cache_dir`` "
"option in the [path]``squid.conf`` manually."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "BYOS Guide"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມື BYOS"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bring your own subscription (BYOS)"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ (BYOS)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Bring your own subscription (BYOS) images are useful if you already have a "
"support contract with SUSE and want to move your workloads to the public "
"cloud.  An instance launched from a BYOS image is equivalent to a physical "
"machine that just received a SUSE Linux Enterprise Server installation from "
"the {sles} installation image."
msgstr "ອິມເມຈ Bring your own subscription (BYOS) ມີປະໂຫຍດຫາກທ່ານມີສັນຍາການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອກັບ SUSE ຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍວຽກຂອງທ່ານໄປຍັງ public cloud. ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ທີ່ສ້າງຈາກ BYOS ຈະທຽບເທົ່າກັບເຄື່ອງຈິງ (physical machine) ທີ່ຫາກໍ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ SUSE Linux Enterprise Server ຈາກອິມເມຈຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:4
msgid "After creation:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"use ``registercloudguest`` to register the instance with the SUSE-operated "
"update infrastructure in the cloud framework, or"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ ``registercloudguest`` ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ກັບໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານການອັບເດດທີ່ດຳເນີນການໂດຍ SUSE ໃນ cloud framework, ຫຼື"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:6
msgid ""
"use the command ``SUSEConnect`` to register the system with {scc} using the "
"entitlements you already have."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ ``SUSEConnect`` ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລະບົບກັບ {scc} ໂດຍໃຊ້ສິດ (entitlements) ທີ່ທ່ານມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtaining a SUSE Manager Server Subscription for {byos}"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To obtain a SUSE Manager Server Lifecycle subscription, customers must send "
"an email to susemanagerkey@suse.com, including proof of running at least 10 "
"instances of SLES for SAP BYOS.  Proof can be a screenshot of the relevant "
"section of the cloud console.  The subscription key is valid for one year, "
"and customers can renew it by providing updated proof of their instances at "
"the end of the period."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Connect your system to your own running RMT or {productname} infrastructure "
"in the same way you connect systems in your data center."
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະບົບຂອງທ່ານກັບໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານ RMT ຫຼື {productname} ທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ ໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະບົບໃນ data center ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:10
msgid ""
"BYOS instances make it easier to manage extensions such as ``LTSS`` or "
"``kernel live-patching``.  Extensions for PAYG instances can only be used in "
"conjunction with {productname}."
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ BYOS ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຈັດການສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ (extensions) ເຊັ່ນ ``LTSS`` ຫຼື ``kernel live-patching`` ໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍສຳລັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ PAYG ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register clients"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ client"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When you have your {productname} Server set up, you are ready to start "
"registering clients."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານກໍພ້ອມທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມລົງທະບຽນ client ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For instructions on registering clients on a public cloud, see "
"xref:client-configuration:clients-pubcloud.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນການລົງທະບຽນ client ໃນ public cloud, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:clients-pubcloud.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For instructions on connecting {payg} instances, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:connect-payg.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {payg}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:connect-payg.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional Resources"
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information on using {suse} products in the public cloud see: "
"link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-public-cloud/all/html/public-cloud/cha-intro.html[SUSE "
"Linux Enterprise Public Cloud Guide]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ໃນ public cloud ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ: link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-public-cloud/all/html/public-cloud/cha-intro.html[SUSE Linux Enterprise Public Cloud Guide]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more {productname} product documentation, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/suma."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເອກະສານຜະລິດຕະພັນ {productname} ເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/suma."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To raise an issue or propose a change to the documentation, use the links "
"under the ``Resources`` menu on the documentation site."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແຈ້ງບັນຫາ ຫຼື ສະເໜີການປ່ຽນແປງເອກະສານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລີ້ງ (links) ພາຍໃຕ້ເມນູ ``Resources`` ໃນເວັບໄຊເອກະສານ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:1
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:1
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initial setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide shows you the fastest way to get {productname} up and running in "
"a public cloud using on-demand or BYOS services.  We have tested using "
"{productname} on Amazon EC2, Google Compute Engine, and Microsoft Azure, but "
"these procedures should work with other public cloud providers as well, with "
"some variation."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ຈະສະແດງວິທີທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ {productname} ໃນ public cloud ໂດຍໃຊ້ບໍລິການແບບ on-demand ຫຼື BYOS. ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ທົດສອບການໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນ Amazon EC2, Google Compute Engine, ແລະ Microsoft Azure ແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄວນຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ public cloud ອື່ນໆເຊັ່ນກັນ ໂດຍອາດມີການປ່ຽນແປງເລັກໜ້ອຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:3
msgid ""
"There are three main methods of using {productname} on a public cloud "
"service."
msgstr "ມີສາມວິທີຫຼັກໃນການໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນບໍລິການ public cloud."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bring your own subscription (BYOS)"
msgstr "Bring your own subscription (BYOS)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Most public cloud providers make a BYOS image of {productname} available.  "
"This means you do not need to install {productname}, just set up the "
"server.  You will need to have {suse} product entitlements before you begin, "
"and there are some additional setup steps required.  The public cloud "
"documentation in the {productname} documentation suite assumes you are using "
"this method."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ public cloud ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ມີອິມເມຈ BYOS ຂອງ {productname} ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}, ພຽງແຕ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີສິດ (entitlements) ຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ກ່ອນຈະເລີ່ມ, ແລະ ມີຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມບາງຢ່າງ. ເອກະສານ public cloud ໃນຊຸດເອກະສານ {productname} ແມ່ນສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual machine on public cloud"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງຈຳລອງ (Virtual machine) ໃນ public cloud"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In this method, you subscribe to a public cloud service, and install "
"{productname} in a virtual machine, using the {unifiedinstaller}.  You will "
"need to have {suse} product entitlements before you begin.  You can do this "
"by following all the same instructions as you would for any local "
"{productname} installation."
msgstr "ໃນວິທີນີ້, ທ່ານສະໝັກໃຊ້ບໍລິການ public cloud ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນ virtual machine ໂດຍໃຊ້ {unifiedinstaller}. ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີສິດຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດຽວກັນກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນເຄື່ອງທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local) ທົ່ວໄປ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "On-demand {sles} pay as you go (PAYG) image"
msgstr "ອິມເມຈ {sles} ແບບ On-demand ຈ່າຍຕາມການໃຊ້ຈິງ (PAYG)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Most public cloud providers make {sles} available as a BYOS image.  This "
"means that {sles} is pre-installed, and you can install {productname} on "
"top, using the {unifiedinstaller}.  You can do this by following all the "
"same instructions as you would for any local {productname} installation.  "
"You will need to have {suse} product entitlements before you begin.  Be "
"careful with this method, because you might end up requiring additional "
"product entitlements that could drive up your costs."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ public cloud ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ມີ {sles} ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໃນຮູບແບບອິມເມຈ BYOS. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ {sles} ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ເສີມເຂົ້າໄປໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {unifiedinstaller}. ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດຽວກັນກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ທົ່ວໄປ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີສິດຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຄວນລະມັດລະວັງກັບວິທີນີ້ ເພາະທ່ານອາດຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສິດຜະລິດຕະພັນເພີ່ມເຕີມເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍສູງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"If you are using the BYOS method, start by logging in to your chosen public "
"cloud provider, and launching a {productname} instance.  Depending on the "
"public cloud you are using, you can usually locate the {productname} Server "
"BYOS images by searching for ``suse manager``.  In EC2, you need to search "
"within the Community AMIs.  In GCE and Azure, search the marketplace."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ວິທີ BYOS, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມໂດຍການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ public cloud ທີ່ເລືອກ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ (launch) ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname}. ຂຶ້ນກັບ public cloud ທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາອິມເມຈ BYOS ຂອງ {productname} Server ໄດ້ໂດຍການພິມຄຳວ່າ ``suse manager``. ໃນ EC2 ທ່ານຕ້ອງຄົ້ນຫາໃນ Community AMIs. ສ່ວນໃນ GCE ແລະ Azure ໃຫ້ຄົ້ນຫາໃນ marketplace."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Select a public cloud instance type that meets the hardware and networking "
"requirements in xref:installation-and-upgrade:pubcloud-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເລືອກປະເພດອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ public cloud ທີ່ກົງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານຮາດແວ ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍໃນ xref:installation-and-upgrade:pubcloud-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:12
msgid ""
"When you have your virtual machine ready, and the BYOS image installed, you "
"need to set up {productname}.  This is done in the same way as a local "
"installation, using {yast}.  When you have completed {productname} setup, "
"you need to activate the public cloud module.  You can then complete setup "
"in the {productname} {webui}.  For more information about setting up, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:pubcloud-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ virtual machine ພ້ອມແລ້ວ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງອິມເມຈ BYOS ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}. ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເຄື່ອງທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ {yast}. ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ public cloud module. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ສຳເລັດໃນ {productname} {webui}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:pubcloud-setup.adoc[]."

