#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Follow these step-by-step instructions to locate the SUSE Manager "
"{productnumber} {payg} image on AWS.  You can also review the latest "
"available images for the public cloud using Pint (Public Cloud Information "
"Tracker)."
msgstr "ເຮັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເທື່ອລະຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາອິມເມຈ SUSE Manager {productnumber} {payg} ໃນ AWS. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກວດສອບອິມເມຈຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບ public cloud ໂດຍໃຊ້ Pint (Public Cloud Information Tracker)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:3
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:3
msgid "See: link:https://pint.suse.com/[pint.suse.com]"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ: link:https://pint.suse.com/[pint.suse.com]"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Obtaining the {productname} {payg} image on AWS"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຂໍຮັບອິມເມຈ {productname} {payg} ໃນ AWS"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In your browser navigate to the link:https://aws.amazon.com/console/[AWS "
"Management Console]."
msgstr "ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ link:https://aws.amazon.com/console/[AWS Management Console]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:6
msgid "Enter your AWS credentials and login."
msgstr "ກອກຂໍ້ມູນບັນຊີ AWS ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:7
msgid ""
"From the AWS Management Console dashboard, locate the menu:Services[] "
"dropdown."
msgstr "ຈາກ dashboard ຂອງ AWS Management Console, ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາເມນູເລືອກ menu:Services[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:8
msgid "From the menu select menu:EC2[] under the **Compute** section."
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:EC2[] ພາຍໃຕ້ສ່ວນ **Compute**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the EC2 dashboard, in the main content section, you'll find the "
"btn:[Launch Instance] button. Click it."
msgstr "ໃນ EC2 dashboard, ຢູ່ໃນສ່ວນເນື້ອຫາຫຼັກ, ທ່ານຈະພົບປຸ່ມ btn:[Launch Instance]. ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:10
msgid ""
"From the **Choose an Amazon Machine Image (AMI)** page.  Select **Browse "
"more AMIs**"
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ **Choose an Amazon Machine Image (AMI)**, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ **Browse more AMIs**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:11
msgid "Search for **SUSE Manager**"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາຄຳວ່າ **SUSE Manager**"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:12
msgid "Depending on your location select your AMI image."
msgstr "ເລືອກອິມເມຈ AMI ຂອງທ່ານ ຕາມສະຖານທີ່ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "**SUSE Manager Server Family (EU and UK only)**\n"
msgstr "**SUSE Manager Server Family (ສະເພາະ EU ແລະ UK)**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "**SUSE Manager Server Family (non-EU and non-UK-only)**.\n"
msgstr "**SUSE Manager Server Family (ສະເພາະນອກ EU ແລະ ນອກ UK)**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:15
msgid "Click btn:[Select]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Select]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:16
msgid "Proceed for image configuration."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອິມເມຈຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc:1
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "AWS System Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງລະບົບສຳລັບ AWS"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When setting up a SUSE Manager {payg} instance on AWS, it's essential to "
"consider system requirements for optimal performance and functionality. The "
"default requirements outlined below have been tailored for smooth deployment "
"and operation."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ SUSE Manager {payg} ໃນ AWS, ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງພິຈາລະນາຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງລະບົບ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ. ຄວາມຕ້ອງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ງານເປັນໄປຢ່າງຮາບລື່ນ."

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Requirement | Details\n"
"\n"
"| root storage\n"
"| 100 GB\n"
"\n"
"| spacewalk storage\n"
"| 500 GB\n"
"\n"
"| database storage\n"
"| 80 GB\n"
"\n"
"| CPU\n"
"| 4 cores; Use the **m5a**, **m5i**, **m6a**, **m6i** systems or newer \n"
"\n"
"| Memory\n"
"| 32 GB (minimum 16 GB)\n"
"\n"
"| Network Configuration\n"
"| Typically configured by your organization\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄວາມຕ້ອງການ | ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
"\n"
"| root storage\n"
"| 100 GB\n"
"\n"
"| spacewalk storage\n"
"| 500 GB\n"
"\n"
"| database storage\n"
"| 80 GB\n"
"\n"
"| CPU\n"
"| 4 cores; ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບ **m5a**, **m5i**, **m6a**, **m6i** ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ \n"
"\n"
"| ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (Memory)\n"
"| 32 GB (ຕ່ຳສຸດ 16 GB)\n"
"\n"
"| ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ\n"
"| ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ\n"
"\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:2
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Login and update the system"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ ແລະ ອັບເດດລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:3
msgid "SSH into your {AWS} instance."
msgstr "SSH ເຂົ້າໄປຍັງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {AWS} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:4
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:4
msgid "Switch to the root user and update the system."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ root ແລະ ອັບເດດລະບົບ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:5
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo -i\n"
"zypper refresh\n"
"zypper update\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo -i\n"
"zypper refresh\n"
"zypper update\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:6
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:20
msgid "Configure storage with the **suma-storage** tool."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື **suma-storage**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:7
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For help see: `suma-storage --help` This tool simplifies creating the "
"storage disk device and database device."
msgstr "ສຳລັບວິທີໃຊ້ ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ: `suma-storage --help` ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການສ້າງອຸປະກອນດິສກ໌ສຳລັບເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນເປັນເລື່ອງງ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Use `lsblk` to see the names of your disk devices.  You will see a list of "
"partitions that were created when we configured the AWS image."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `lsblk` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊື່ອຸປະກອນດິສກ໌ຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານຈະເຫັນລາຍຊື່ພາທິຊັນທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຕອນທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕັ້ງຄ່າ AWS image."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:9
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:23
msgid "Root partition 100 GB"
msgstr "Root partition 100 GB"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:10
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:24
msgid "Spacewalk storage 500 GB"
msgstr "Spacewalk storage 500 GB"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:11
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:25
msgid "Database storage 80 GB"
msgstr "Database storage 80 GB"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:12
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:26
msgid "Format the command in the following manner:"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຄຳສັ່ງແມ່ນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:13
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma-storage <storage-disk-device> [<database-disk-device>]\n"
msgstr "suma-storage <storage-disk-device> [<database-disk-device>]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:14
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "#For example: \n"
msgstr "#ຕົວຢ່າງ: \n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:15
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma-storage /dev/nvme1n1 /dev/nvme2n1\n"
msgstr "suma-storage /dev/nvme1n1 /dev/nvme2n1\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:16
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:30
msgid "This command will create the following storage locations:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງສະຖານທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:17
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:31
msgid "``` /pgsql_storage /pgsql_storage/pgsql ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:18
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:32
msgid "``` /manager_storage /manager_storage/spacewalk ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:19
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:33
msgid "``` /var/spacewalk /var/cache/rhn /var/lib/spacewalk ```"
msgstr ""

