#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSE Manager {payg} WebUI setup "
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ WebUI ຂອງ SUSE Manager {payg} "

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:2
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} must be setup and running on AWS. For more information on "
"finding and setting up {productname}, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc[Public "
"Cloud Images]."
msgstr "{productname} ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງ AWS. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc[Public Cloud Images]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:4
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "The instance-flavor-check tool and {payg} schedule check "
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື instance-flavor-check ແລະ ການກວດສອບກຳນົດເວລາ {payg} "

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:5
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "instance-flavor-check Tool"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື instance-flavor-check"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:6
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The **instance-flavor-check** tool is an essential component that comes "
"pre-installed by default. Its presence is crucial, as it determines the "
"status of PAYG instances. When invoked, this tool identifies and categorizes "
"the system as a PAYG instance. By default this tool is configured to run on "
"a schedule named **update-payg-default**."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື **instance-flavor-check** ແມ່ນສ່ວນປະກອບສຳຄັນທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ. ມັນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນຫຼາຍ ເພາະມັນໃຊ້ກຳນົດສະຖານະຂອງ instance ແບບ PAYG. ເມື່ອຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້, ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຈະລະບຸ ແລະ ຈັດປະເພດລະບົບເປັນ instance ແບບ PAYG. ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານແລ້ວ ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກຕາມກຳນົດເວລາທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ **update-payg-default**."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:7
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "update-payg-default schedule task"
msgstr "ງານຕາມກຳນົດເວລາ update-payg-default"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:8
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Admin[Task Schedules] to find the "
"**update-payg-default** task. By default, this task is set to run at "
"10-minute intervals. Its primary function is to monitor the presence of all "
"running PAYG instances by executing the **instance-flavor-check tool**."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[Task Schedules] ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາວຽກ **update-payg-default**. ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານແລ້ວ, ວຽກນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກທຸກໆ 10 ນາທີ. ໜ້າທີ່ຫຼັກຂອງມັນແມ່ນເພື່ອຕິດຕາມການມີຢູ່ຂອງ PAYG instance ທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ໂດຍການດຳເນີນການ **ເຄື່ອງມື instance-flavor-check**."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:9
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Login to the Webui"
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Webui"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:10
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Login"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Login to the SUSE Manager Server WebUI.  The username is **admin** the "
"password will be the **Instance ID** on AWS EC2."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ SUSE Manager Server WebUI. ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແມ່ນ **admin** ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານແມ່ນ **Instance ID** ຢູ່ເທິງ AWS EC2."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:12
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:12
msgid "Select menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."
msgstr "ເລືອກເມນູ: Admin[Setup Wizard]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:13
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the {payg} credentials and product list"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ {payg} ແລະ ລາຍການຜະລິດຕະພັນ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:14
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:14
msgid ""
"On a new server, the organization credentials table is listed at "
"menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials].  The Products table "
"listed under menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products] will be empty."
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີໃໝ່, ຕາຕະລາງຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງອົງກອນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທີ່ ເມນູ: Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials]. ຕາຕະລາງຜະລິດຕະພັນ ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ເມນູ: Admin[Setup Wizard > Products] ຈະວ່າງຢູ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:15
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Verify credentials for {payg} and refreshing the product list"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບ {payg} ແລະ ການໂຫຼດລາຍການຜະລິດຕະພັນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:16
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:16
msgid ""
"On your new server navigate to the menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Pay-as-you-go] "
"tab to view and manage {payg} credentials.  Localhost should provide the "
"description ``SUSE Manager Pay-as-you-go`` and the status should read "
"``Credentials successfully updated``."
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[Setup Wizard > Pay-as-you-go] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງ ແລະ ຄຸ້ມຄອງຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ {payg}. Localhost ຄວນສະແດງຄຳອະທິບາຍວ່າ ``SUSE Manager Pay-as-you-go`` ແລະ ສະຖານະຄວນຂຶ້ນວ່າ ``Credentials successfully updated``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:17
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:17
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Admin[Products] tab and click btn:[Refresh]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Admin[Products] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Refresh]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:18
