#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:23
msgid "Ubuntu and Debian are not currently supported by our RMT servers."
msgstr "ປະຈຸບັນ Ubuntu ແລະ Debian ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍເຊີເວີ RMT ຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:24
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
