#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initial Preparation and Configuration of the {azure} Image"
msgstr "ການກຽມເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບພາບ {azure}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section covers initial preparation and configuration of the image on "
"{azure}."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການກຽມເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບພາບຢູ່ເທິງ {azure}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:4
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:8
msgid "Start by logging into your Azure account at Azure Portal."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບບັນຊີ Azure ຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ທີ່ Azure Portal."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the Azure Portal, find the menu:[Virtual Machines] section. This can be "
"done either through the **dashboard** or by using the **search bar**."
msgstr "ໃນ Azure Portal, ຄົ້ນຫາພາກສ່ວນເມນູ: [Virtual Machines]. ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຜ່ານ **dashboard** ຫຼື ໃຊ້ **ຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາ**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:6
msgid "Select menu:[Create a resource] in the top left corner of the portal."
msgstr "ເລືອກເມນູ: [Create a resource] ຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງພໍທັລ (portal)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:7
msgid "Choose menu:[Compute] and then select menu:[Virtual Machine]."
msgstr "ເລືອກເມນູ: [Compute] ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກເມນູ: [Virtual Machine]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:8
msgid "You will be guided through the **Create a virtual machine** process."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະຖືກແນະນຳຜ່ານຂັ້ນຕອນ **ສ້າງເຄື່ອງສະເືອນ (Create a virtual machine)**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Fill in the required details such as subscription, resource group, and VM "
"name."
msgstr "ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ເຊັ່ນ: ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscription), ກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນ, ແລະ ຊື່ VM."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Choose a region for your VM. Ensure it complies with any geo-fencing "
"policies you might have."
msgstr "ເລືອກພາກພື້ນ (region) ສຳລັບ VM ຂອງທ່ານ. ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນສອດຄ່ອງກັບນະໂຍບາຍ geo-fencing ທີ່ທ່ານອາດຈະມີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the **Image** dropdown, select the **manager-server-4-3-ltd** or the "
"**manager-server-4-3-llc** image for your VM. If the image is not listed, "
"select **Browse all public and private images** to find the required image."
msgstr "ໃນລາຍການ **Image**, ເລືອກຮູບພາບ **manager-server-4-3-ltd** ຫຼື **manager-server-4-3-llc** ສຳລັບ VM ຂອງທ່ານ. ຫາກບໍ່ມີໃນລາຍການ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ **Browse all public and private images** ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາຮູບພາບທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Suggested sizes are selected by default for this VM. Configure optional "
"features such as virtual CPUs, memory as required."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດທີ່ແນະນຳຈະຖືກເລືອກໄວ້ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບ VM ນີ້. ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເຊັ່ນ: virtual CPUs, ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Set up an administrator account for the VM. For {sles}, this can be a "
"username and SSH public key."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບສຳລັບ VM. ສຳລັບ {sles}, ນີ້ອາດຈະເປັນ ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ SSH public key."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Ensure the VM is connected to the appropriate virtual network (VNet) and "
"subnet, especially if it needs to communicate with other specific services "
"like {productname}.  For network requirements, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc[Azure "
"Server Setup: Network Configuration]."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ VM ຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເືອນ (VNet) ແລະ subnet ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ, ໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕໍ່ສື່ສານກັບບໍລິການອື່ນ ເຊັ່ນ {productname}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc[Azure Server Setup: Network Configuration]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Configure additional settings such as storage, monitoring, or any extensions "
"you may need. The following partitions are created by default when "
"initializing the {azure} image:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເຊັ່ນ: ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ, ການຕິດຕາມ, ຫຼື ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍອື່ນໆທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ. ພາດີຊັນ (partition) ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍມາດຕະຖານເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຮູບພາບ {azure}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:19
msgid "Once all configurations are set, review the settings."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບຄືນອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:20
msgid "Click \"Create\" to deploy your VM."
msgstr "ຄລິກ \"Create\" ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ (deploy) VM ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:21
msgid "After the VM is deployed, you can access it via SSH."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກ VM ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າໃຊ້ງານຜ່ານ SSH."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that since this is a {payg} image, you will be billed according "
"to your actual usage, including the number of systems you **manage** and "
"**monitor** with this instance. It's essential to regularly track and review "
"your usage to prevent unexpected costs and ensure alignment with your needs."
msgstr "ຂໍໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ ເນື່ອງຈາກນີ້ເປັນຮູບພາບແບບ {payg}, ທ່ານຈະຖືກຮຽກເກັບເງິນຕາມການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຈິງ, ລວມເຖິງຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ທ່ານ **ຄຸ້ມຄອງ** ແລະ **ຕິດຕາມ** ດ້ວຍ instance ນີ້. ມັນສຳຄັນຫຼາຍທີ່ຕ້ອງຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ກວດສອບການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານເປັນປະຈຳ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ ແລະ ໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Starting up additional {payg} {suse} products in {azure}"
msgstr "ການເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ແບບ {payg} ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ {azure}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Once you have started up your {productname} {payg} instance and refreshed "
"products you can add **{payglongform} connections** via the menu:Admin[Setup "
"Wizard > Pay-as-you-go] btn:[+Add Pay-as-you-go] button. This action links "
"your {productname} {payg} instance with additional {payg} products on "
"{azure}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານ {productname} {payg} instance ແລະ ໂຫຼດຜະລິດຕະພັນໃໝ່ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ **ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payglongform}** ຜ່ານປຸ່ມ ເມນູ: Admin[Setup Wizard > Pay-as-you-go] btn:[+Add Pay-as-you-go]. ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງ {productname} {payg} instance ຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ {payg} ອື່ນໆຢູ່ເທິງ {azure}."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtaining the {productname} Server {payg} public cloud image on {azure}"
msgstr "ການຮັບຮູບພາບ public cloud ຂອງ {productname} Server {payg} ຢູ່ເທິງ {azure}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Follow these step-by-step instructions to locate the SUSE Manager "
"{productnumber} {payg} image on {azure}.  You can also review the latest "
"available images for the public cloud using Pint (Public Cloud Information "
"Tracker)."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເທື່ອລະຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາຮູບພາບ SUSE Manager {productnumber} {payg} ຢູ່ເທິງ {azure}. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກວດສອບຮູບພາບຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບ public cloud ໂດຍໃຊ້ Pint (Public Cloud Information Tracker)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:4
msgid "There are currently two offers for {productname} {payg} on {azure}:"
msgstr "ປະຈຸບັນມີສອງຂໍ້ສະເໜີສຳລັບ {productname} {payg} ຢູ່ເທິງ {azure}:"

#.  Check if these are the correct names for public consumption or if they are test servers
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "**manager-server-4-3-ltd**\n"
msgstr "**manager-server-4-3-ltd**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "**manager-server-4-3-llc**\n"
msgstr "**manager-server-4-3-llc**\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Obtaining the {productname} {payg} image on {azure}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຮັບຮູບພາບ {productname} {payg} ຢູ່ເທິງ {azure}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Once logged in, navigate to the **Virtual Machines** section. This can be "
"found in the dashboard or by using the search bar at the top of the Azure "
"Portal."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ **Virtual Machines**. ສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້ໃນ dashboard ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງ Azure Portal."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Click on **Create a Virtual Machine.** Here, you will be asked to fill in "
"details such as the subscription, resource group, and virtual machine name."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ **Create a Virtual Machine.** ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້, ທ່ານຈະຖືກຖາມໃຫ້ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດ ເຊັ່ນ: ການສະໝັກໃຊ້, ກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນ, ແລະ ຊື່ເຄື່ອງສະເືອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:11
msgid ""
"During the creation of a virtual machine there is an option for **Image.** "
"Select the correct cloud image for your VM."
msgstr "ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງເຄື່ອງສະເືອນ ຈະມີຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບ **Image.** ໃຫ້ເລືອກຮູບພາບຄລາວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບ VM ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you don't find the image you need, you can browse the Azure "
"Marketplace. Click on **See all images** or go to the **Marketplace** and "
"search for the image you need."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ພົບຮູບພາບທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາໃນ Azure Marketplace. ຄລິກທີ່ **See all images** ຫຼື ໄປທີ່ **Marketplace** ແລະ ຄົ້ນຫາຮູບພາບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:13
msgid ""
"After selecting your image, continue with the configuration of your virtual "
"machine. Review all settings, and then create your VM."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກຮູບພາບແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງສະເືອນຂອງທ່ານຕໍ່. ກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດ, ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນສ້າງ VM ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:1
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Azure System Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດລະບົບຂອງ Azure"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When setting up a SUSE Manager {payg} instance on {azure}, it's essential to "
"consider system requirements for optimal performance and functionality. The "
"default requirements outlined below have been tailored for smooth deployment "
"and operation."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ SUSE Manager {payg} instance ຢູ່ເທິງ {azure}, ມັນສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງພິຈາລະນາຂໍ້ກຳນົດລະບົບເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ. ຂໍ້ກຳນົດມາດຕະຖານທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຮາບລື່ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:3
msgid ""
"By default, certain disks are automatically generated when establishing a "
"{productname} {payg} instance on {azure}. To complete the setup of these "
"disks, use the **suma-storage** tool."
msgstr "ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ, ດິສ໌ (disk) ບາງອັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອສ້າງ {productname} {payg} instance ຢູ່ເທິງ {azure}. ເພື່ອສຳເລັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າດິສ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື **suma-storage**."

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Requirement | Details\n"
"\n"
"| root storage\n"
"| 100 GB\n"
"\n"
"| spacewalk storage\n"
"| 500 GB\n"
"\n"
"| database storage\n"
"| 80 GB\n"
"\n"
"| CPU\n"
"| 4 cores\n"
"\n"
"| Memory\n"
"| 32 GB (minimum 16 GB)\n"
"\n"
"| Network Configuration\n"
"| Typically configured by your organization\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ | ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
"\n"
"| root storage\n"
"| 100 GB\n"
"\n"
"| spacewalk storage\n"
"| 500 GB\n"
"\n"
"| database storage\n"
"| 80 GB\n"
"\n"
"| CPU\n"
"| 4 cores\n"
"\n"
"| ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ\n"
"| 32 GB (ຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ 16 GB)\n"
"\n"
"| ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ\n"
"| ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ\n"
"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:3
msgid "SSH into your {azure} instance."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ງານ {azure} instance ຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານ SSH."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network Configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Before initiating `yast2 susemanager_setup`, ensure the network is correctly "
"configured for {azure}."
msgstr "ກ່ອນຈະເລີ່ມ `yast2 susemanager_setup`, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບ {azure}."

#.  (Azure requirement, not ours).
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For {productname} {payg} setup it is required, that a new Virtual Network "
"and a new subnet is configured.  It is impossible to setup the instance in "
"an existing network.  When you setup new clients which should be managed, "
"take care that you put them into the private subnet which is configured with "
"{productname} {payg}."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} {payg}, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Virtual Network ໃໝ່ ແລະ subnet ໃໝ່. ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ instance ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໄດ້. ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ທີ່ຈະຖືກຄຸ້ມຄອງ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ນຳພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນ private subnet ທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ກັບ {productname} {payg}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If you want to manage systems in an already existing network, you must "
"configure **peering**."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄຸ້ມຄອງລະບົບໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ **peering**."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"link:https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-network/tutorial-connect-virtual-networks?tabs=portal#create-virtual-network-peer[Azure "
"tutorial]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Network Configuration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Ensure the network configuration aligns such that `hostname -f` yields the "
"identical name as the reverse DNS lookup of the private IP address. For "
"instance, when executing `nslookup 10.0.0.X`."
msgstr "ກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ `hostname -f` ສະແດງຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບ ການເຮັດ reverse DNS lookup ຂອງ private IP address. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອດຳເນີນການ `nslookup 10.0.0.X`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Insert the private IP with its Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN) into "
"`/etc/hosts`. For example: +\n"
"`10.0.0.4   instancename.internal.cloudapp.net`\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃສ່ private IP ພ້ອມກັບ Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN) ເຂົ້າໃນ `/etc/hosts`. ຕົວຢ່າງ: +\n"
"`10.0.0.4   instancename.internal.cloudapp.net`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Edit `/etc/sysconfig/network/config` and append `internal.cloudapp.net` to "
"`NETCONFIG_DNS_STATIC_SEARCHLIST`."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ `/etc/sysconfig/network/config` ແລະ ເພີ່ມ `internal.cloudapp.net` ຕໍ່ທ້າຍ `NETCONFIG_DNS_STATIC_SEARCHLIST`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:15
msgid "Execute `netconfig update`."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການ `netconfig update`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Subsequently, `hostname -f` should return the same FQDN as obtained from "
"`nslookup 10.0.0.X`."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, `hostname -f` ຄວນຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ FQDN ອັນດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກ `nslookup 10.0.0.X`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:17
msgid ""
"When adding new virtual machines (VMs), such as {sles} 15 SP5, it's crucial "
"to ensure that they are configured within the same subnet as the SUSE "
"Manager instance. This step is essential for successful network setup and "
"integration."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເພີ່ມເຄື່ອງສະເືອນ (VMs) ໃໝ່ ເຊັ່ນ {sles} 15 SP5, ມັນສຳຄັນຫຼາຍທີ່ຕ້ອງກວດສອບວ່າພວກມັນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຍໃນ subnet ດຽວກັນກັບ SUSE Manager instance. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງລະບົບສຳເລັດຜົນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Additionally, be mindful of the geographical restrictions associated with "
"your plans. Make sure to utilize the appropriate Azure accounts which "
"correspond to the specific geographic zones of your project."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ລະວັງເລື່ອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທາງພູມສາດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບແຜນງານຂອງທ່ານ. ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່ານຳໃຊ້ບັນຊີ Azure ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບເຂດພູມສາດສະເພາະ ຂອງໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Storage"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Use `lsblk` to see the names of your disk devices.  You will see a list of "
"partitions that were created when we configured the {azure} image."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `lsblk` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊື່ອຸປະກອນດິສ໌ຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານຈະເຫັນລາຍການ ພາດີຊັນທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອພວກເຮົາຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບພາບ {azure}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} must be setup and running on {azure}. For more information on "
"finding and setting up {productname}, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc[Azure "
"Public Cloud Images]."
msgstr "{productname} ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງ {azure}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc[Azure Public Cloud Images]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Login to the {productname} Server {webui}.  The username is "
"[literal]``admin`` while the password is the name of the instance with "
"[literal]``-suma`` appended.  When the name of the instance is "
"[literal]``suma-payg-mycompany``, the password is "
"``suma-payg-mycompany-suma``."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {productname} Server {webui}. ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແມ່ນ [literal]``admin`` ສ່ວນລະຫັດຜ່ານແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງ instance ທີ່ຕໍ່ທ້າຍດ້ວຍ [literal]``-suma``. ເມື່ອຊື່ຂອງ instance ແມ່ນ [literal]``suma-payg-mycompany``, ລະຫັດຜ່ານຈະແມ່ນ ``suma-payg-mycompany-suma``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview-redhat.adoc[Red Hat Client "
"Registration]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-overview-redhat.adoc[Red Hat Client Registration]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{payg} limitations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ {payg}"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Onboarded {byos} instances without SCC credentials"
msgstr "{byos} instance ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າລະບົບໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SCC"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Valid SCC credentials are needed to manage {byoslongform} ({byos}) instances "
"of SUSE products in {productname} {payg}.  This applies to all SUSE products "
"except {productname} Proxy {byos}.  Without any SCC credentials, "
"{productname} {payg} will not allow onboarding any of the mentioned {byos} "
"instances.  The user will get an error."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SCC ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເພື່ອຄຸ້ມຄອງ {byoslongform} ({byos}) instance ຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນ SUSE ໃນ {productname} {payg}. ອັນນີ້ໃຊ້ກັບທຸກຜະລິດຕະພັນ SUSE ຍົກເວັ້ນ {productname} Proxy {byos}. ຫາກບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SCC, {productname} {payg} ຈະບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ນຳເຂົ້າ {byos} instance ທີ່ກ່າວມາ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:4
msgid ""
"There is a possibility that the user has valid SCC credentials set with "
"already synced-up channels and the {byos} onboarded, but at some point "
"decides to delete those credentials."
msgstr "ມັນອາດມີກໍລະນີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SCC ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ພ້ອມກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຊິງຄ໌ (sync) ຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າ {byos} ແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ພາຍຫຼັງພັດຕັດສິນໃຈລຶບຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the scenario of having already onboarded {byos} instances but no SCC "
"credentials set, the following restrictions apply:"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າ {byos} instance ແລ້ວ ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SCC, ຈະມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:6
msgid ""
"A warning message will be shown to the user to let them know that they will "
"not be able to manage those instances."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕືອນຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຊາບວ່າ ເຂົາເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຄຸ້ມຄອງ instance ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Non-compliant {byos} instances will not be able to be managed neither "
"through {salt} or Salt-SSH.  This applies to individual server management, "
"SSM and action-chains.  When dealing with several servers at once, as long "
"as there is one non-compliant {byos} instance among them, the entire "
"action/action-chain will be aborted for all servers."
msgstr "{byos} instance ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກຄຸ້ມຄອງໄດ້ ທັງຜ່ານ {salt} ຫຼື Salt-SSH. ອັນນີ້ລວມເຖິງການຄຸ້ມຄອງເຊີເວີແບບດ່ຽວ, SSM ແລະ action-chains. ເມື່ອຈັດການກັບເຊີເວີຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງພ້ອມກັນ, ຫາກມີ {byos} instance ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງແມ້ແຕ່ເຄື່ອງດຽວ, ການດຳເນີນການ/action-chain ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກສຳລັບທຸກເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Non-compliant {byos} instances will not be able to access any repository "
"hosted in {productname} {payg} as long as SCC credentials are not set.  "
"{productname} {payg} will return ``HTTP 401 Unauthorized`` until the "
"situation is amended, that is trying to install or upgrade packages using "
"zypper from those machines directly will not work."
msgstr "{byos} instance ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ repository ໃດໆ ທີ່ໂຮສ (host) ຢູ່ໃນ {productname} {payg} ໄດ້ ຕາບໃດທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SCC. {productname} {payg} ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ ``HTTP 401 Unauthorized`` ຈົນກວ່າສະຖານະການຈະຖືກແກ້ໄຂ, ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການພະຍາຍາມຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເກຣດແພັກເກັດ (package) ໂດຍໃຊ້ zypper ຈາກເຄື່ອງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໂດຍກົງແມ່ນຈະໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of {payg}"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງ {payg}"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to {payg}"
msgstr "ແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບ {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} {payg} or {payglongform} is a flexible and cost-effective "
"solution that allows users to manage and monitor their systems from several "
"cloud services. Unlike traditional subscription models, {payg} does not "
"require a long-term subscription through the SUSE Customer Center. Users can "
"leverage images of {productname} on a {payglongform} basis, paying only for "
"the time of use, and the number of **managed** and **monitored** "
"systems. {payg} with {productname} is an optimal solution for those seeking "
"control, convenience, and cost savings when managing and monitoring their "
"infrastructure on AWS, Azure, and GCP."
msgstr "{productname} {payg} ຫຼື {payglongform} ແມ່ນໂຊລູຊັ່ນ (solution) ທີ່ປັບປ່ຽນໄດ້ ແລະ ຄຸ້ມຄ່າ ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດຄຸ້ມຄອງ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມລະບົບຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າຈາກບໍລິການຄລາວຫຼາຍແຫ່ງ. ຕ່າງຈາກຮູບແບບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ, {payg} ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄລຍະຍາວຜ່ານ SUSE Customer Center. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ຮູບພາບຂອງ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບ {payglongform}, ໂດຍຈ່າຍເງິນຕາມເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ ແລະ ຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກ **ຄຸ້ມຄອງ** ແລະ **ຕິດຕາມ**. {payg} ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname} ເປັນໂຊລູຊັ່ນທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການການຄວບຄຸມ, ຄວາມສະດວກ, ແລະ ການປະຢັດຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍໃນການຄຸ້ມຄອງ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າຢູ່ເທິງ AWS, Azure, ແລະ GCP."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:4
msgid "Obtaining a SUSE Manager Server Subscription (optional)"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For customers running 10 or more PAYG SLES for SAP Applications instances "
"who also wish to access the SUSE Manager (SUMA) BYOS Lifecycle subscription, "
"an email must be sent to susemanagerkey@suse.com.  The email should include "
"proof of at least 10 active SLES for SAP PAYG instances, such as a "
"screenshot of the relevant section of their cloud console.  The subscription "
"key is valid for one year and can be renewed by providing updated proof of "
"the instances at the end of the subscription period."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benefits for using {payg}"
msgstr "ປະໂຫຍດຂອງການນຳໃຊ້ {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The SUSE Manager {payg} instance offers a flexible solution tailored to the "
"modern business landscape. Key benefits include:"
msgstr "SUSE Manager {payg} instance ນຳສະເໜີໂຊລູຊັ່ນທີ່ປັບປ່ຽນໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທຸລະກິດສະໄໝໃໝ່. ປະໂຫຍດຫຼັກປະກອບມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Cost Efficiency:* Pay only for what you use, aligning costs with actual "
"system management needs.\n"
msgstr "*ປະສິດທິພາບດ້ານຕົ້ນທຶນ:* ຈ່າຍສະເພາະສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້, ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍສອດຄ່ອງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການໃນການຄຸ້ມຄອງລະບົບຕົວຈິງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*No Subscription Required:* Eliminate the need for ongoing commitments or "
"long-term subscriptions, allowing for budget flexibility.\n"
msgstr "*ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສະໝັກໃຊ້:* ຕັດຄວາມຈຳເປັນໃນການຜູກມັດຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ ຫຼື ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄລຍະຍາວ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ງົບປະມານມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Ease of Use:* Utilize SUSE Manager's powerful features on a **{payg}** or "
"**{payglongform}** basis, streamlining initial setup and ongoing systems "
"management.\n"
msgstr "*ໃຊ້ງານງ່າຍ:* ນຳໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຊົງພະລັງຂອງ SUSE Manager ໃນຮູບແບບ **{payg}** ຫຼື **{payglongform}**, ເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການຄຸ້ມຄອງລະບົບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງມີຄວາມຄ່ອງຕົວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Scalability:* Easily scale the number of systems managed according to your "
"requirements, without worrying about subscription limitations.\n"
msgstr "*ການຂະຫຍາຍຕົວ:* ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ຄຸ້ມຄອງໄດ້ງ່າຍຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ, ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງກັງວົນເລື່ອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Rapid Deployment:* Quickly run the image of your choice and begin managing "
"your systems, enhancing responsiveness to your needs.\n"
msgstr "*ການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ວ່ອງໄວ:* ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານຮູບພາບທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຄຸ້ມຄອງລະບົບຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ທັນທີ, ເພີ່ມຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ຄວາມຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Integration with Cloud Services:* Leverage SUSE Manager {payg} on {aws}, "
"Azure, or GCP taking advantage of cloud infrastructure for an agile systems "
"management experience.\n"
msgstr "*ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບບໍລິການຄລາວ:* ນຳໃຊ້ SUSE Manager {payg} ຢູ່ເທິງ {aws}, Azure, ຫຼື GCP ໂດຍໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຄລາວ ເພື່ອປະສົບການການຄຸ້ມຄອງລະບົບທີ່ຄ່ອງຕົວ.\n"

