msgid ""
"To support customers that prefer a cloud centric billing model, SUSE has "
"recently published a new listing to the {availability} Marketplaces, "
"{productname}"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສະໜັບສະໜູນລູກຄ້າທີ່ມັກຮູບແບບການຮຽກເກັບເງິນແບບເນັ້ນຄລາວ, ບໍ່ດົນມານີ້ SUSE ໄດ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ລາຍການໃໝ່ໃນ {availability} Marketplaces, {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/public-cloud-faq.adoc:5
