#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:45
msgid "Default"
msgstr "ມາດຕະຖານ (Default)"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Universal Default"
msgstr "ມາດຕະຖານທົ່ວໄປ (Universal Default)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:47
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:114
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:116
msgid "Leave unchecked."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງໝາຍຕິກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:48
msgid "Click btn:[Create Activation Key]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create Activation Key]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Liberate formula and assign it to activation keys"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສູດ Liberate ແລະ ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ activation keys"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:50
msgid ""
"When installed, the formula can be assigned to an Activation Key by creating "
"a System Group:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ, ສູດສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ Activation Key ໄດ້ໂດຍການສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບ (System Group):"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning system group and assigning liberate formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດກຸ່ມລະບົບ ແລະ ກຳນົດສູດ liberate"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:52
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System Groups], and "
"click the btn:[Create Group] button in top right corner."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System Groups], ແລະ ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Group] ທີ່ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:53
msgid "In the dialog, fill in the following data:"
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ, ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Name"
msgstr "ຊື່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:55
msgid "liberate"
msgstr "liberate"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:57
msgid "Systems to be converted to SUSE Liberty Linux"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ SUSE Liberty Linux"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:58
msgid ""
"From the `liberate` System Group page, navigate go to the "
"[guimenu]``Formulas`` tab."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າກຸ່ມລະບົບ `liberate`, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Formulas``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Select the [guimenu]``Liberate`` formula, and click btn:[Save].  A new tab "
"called `Liberate` will appear."
msgstr "ເລືອກສູດ [guimenu]``Liberate``, ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Save]. ແທັບໃໝ່ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ `Liberate` ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:60
msgid ""
"On the [guimenu]``Liberate`` tab, you see the [option]``Reinstall all "
"packages after conversion`` option.  Keep it checked if you want to "
"reinstall all the packages during the migration.  This way you ensure all "
"the packages will have {suse} signatures and no previous package will be "
"kept.  If you do not want to change the state of your system during the "
"migration, uncheck this option and click the btn:[Save Formula] button.  In "
"this case, you can re-install the packages later."
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ [guimenu]``Liberate``, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນໂຕເລືອກ [option]``Reinstall all packages after conversion``. ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກໄວ້ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກແພັກເກັດໃໝ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍລະບົບ. ວິທີນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທຸກແພັກເກັດຈະມີລາຍເຊັນຂອງ {suse} ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ມີແພັກເກັດເກົ່າຫຼົງເຫຼືອຢູ່. ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນສະຖານະຂອງລະບົບໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ຍົກເລີກການໝາຍຕິກໂຕເລືອກນີ້ ແລະ ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Save Formula]. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດໃໝ່ໄດ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Now a system group exists that has assigned the [guimenu]``Liberate`` "
"formula.  This formula will be applied only once to migrate the system to "
"{sll}, even if you run it multiple times.  With the next procedure, assign "
"the system group to the Activation Key."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ມີກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດສູດ [guimenu]``Liberate`` ແລ້ວ. ສູດນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຄັ້ງດຽວເພື່ອຍ້າຍລະບົບໄປເປັນ {sll}, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າທ່ານຈະສັ່ງໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກຫຼາຍຄັ້ງກໍຕາມ. ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດກຸ່ມລະບົບໃຫ້ກັບ Activation Key."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning the system group to the Activation Key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດກຸ່ມລະບົບໃຫ້ກັບ Activation Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:63
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Select the Activation Key, for example [literal]``sll9-default`` for the "
"EL 9 systems."
msgstr "ເລືອກ Activation Key, ຕົວຢ່າງ [literal]``sll9-default`` ສຳລັບລະບົບ EL 9."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:65
msgid ""
"From the Activation Key page navigate to the menu:Groups[Join] tab, select "
"the [literal]``liberate`` group, and click the btn:[Join Selected Groups] "
"button.  The group will be assigned to the Activation Key"
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ Activation Key ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Groups[Join], ເລືອກກຸ່ມ [literal]``liberate``, ແລະ ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Join Selected Groups]. ກຸ່ມດັ່ງກ່າວຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ Activation Key."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying migrate directly during registration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ການຍ້າຍລະບົບໂດຍກົງໃນລະຫວ່າງການລົງທະບຽນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:67
msgid "From the Activation Key page, navigate to the [guimenu]``Details`` tab."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ Activation Key, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Details``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:68
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Configuration File Deployment`` section, and "
"checkb the [option]``Deploy configuration files to systems on "
"registration``option."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Configuration File Deployment``, ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກໂຕເລືອກ [option]``Deploy configuration files to systems on registration``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:69
msgid "Click btn:[Update Activation Key]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Update Activation Key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:70
msgid ""
"When you register a system with this key it will perform the migration "
"automatically."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານລົງທະບຽນລະບົບດ້ວຍ key ນີ້, ມັນຈະເຮັດການຍ້າຍລະບົບໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register a new system and proceed to the migration"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນລະບົບໃໝ່ ແລະ ດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:72
msgid ""
"There are two ways to onboard (or register) a new client with the Activation "
"Key:"
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ Activation Key:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the {webui} and selecting the activation key"
msgstr "ຜ່ານ {webui} ແລະ ເລືອກ activation key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:74
msgid "This is intended for a one-off registration or for testing purposes."
msgstr "ວິທີນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນຄັ້ງດຽວ ຫຼື ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການທົດສອບ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "With a bootstrap script with an assigned activation key"
msgstr "ຜ່ານ bootstrap script ທີ່ມີການກຳນົດ activation key ໄວ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:76
msgid "This is intended to be used for mass registration."
msgstr "ວິທີນີ້ແມ່ນມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register with the {webui}"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນຜ່ານ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:78
msgid ""
"Technically, this will start an SSH connection to the client and run the "
"bootstrap script to register it."
msgstr "ໃນທາງເຕັກນິກ, ວິທີນີ້ຈະເລີ່ມການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ໄປຫາໄຄເອັນ ແລະ ຣັນ bootstrap script ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນມັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering with the {webui} and selecting the activation key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນຜ່ານ {webui} ແລະ ການເລືອກ activation key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:80
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Bootstraping]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Bootstraping]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:81
msgid "In the `Bootstrap Minions` dialog, fill the entries:"
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ `Bootstrap Minions`, ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Host"
msgstr "Host"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:83
msgid "Hostname of the client to register"
msgstr "ຊື່ໂຮສຂອງໄຄເອັນທີ່ຈະລົງທະບຽນ"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSH Port"
msgstr "SSH Port"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:85
msgid "Leave blank to use default, which is [literal]``22``"
msgstr "ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນ [literal]``22``"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "User"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:87
msgid "Enter user or leave blank for {rootuser}"
msgstr "ປ້ອນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ສຳລັບ {rootuser}"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "ວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:89
msgid ""
"Select if you want to use [guimenu]``password`` or provide a [guimenu]``SSH "
"Private Key``"
msgstr "ເລືອກວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ [guimenu]``password`` ຫຼື ສະໜອງ [guimenu]``SSH Private Key``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:90
msgid "[guimenu]``Password``: password to access the system"
msgstr "[guimenu]``Password``: ລະຫັດຜ່ານເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:91
msgid "[guimenu]``SSH Private Key``: file with the private key"
msgstr "[guimenu]``SSH Private Key``: ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີ private key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:92
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase``: In case a private key was provided "
"that requires a passphrase to unlock, provide it here"
msgstr "[guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase``: ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີການສະໜອງ private key ທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ passphrase ເພື່ອປົດລັອກ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນມັນທີ່ນີ້"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activation Key"
msgstr "Activation Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:94
msgid ""
"Select from the menu the activation key to be used, for example "
"[literal]``sll9-default``"
msgstr "ເລືອກ activation key ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຈາກເມນູ, ຕົວຢ່າງ [literal]``sll9-default``"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reactivation Key"
msgstr "Reactivation Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:96
msgid "Leave blank, it will not be used here"
msgstr "ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້, ມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນບ່ອນນີ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:98
msgid "Leave as [literal]``None`` if you are not using a proxy"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ປະເປັນ [literal]``None`` ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:99
msgid "Click the btn:[Bootstrap] button to start the registration."
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Bootstrap] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:100
msgid ""
"A notification will show on top of the page stating that the client is being "
"registered."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໜ້າໂດຍລະບຸວ່າໄຄເອັນກຳລັງຖືກລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:101
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register with a bootstrap script"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນດ້ວຍ bootstrap script"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:102
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating bootstrap script"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ bootstrap script"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:103
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > "
"Bootstrap Script]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Bootstrap Script]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:104
msgid "Fill the fields of the bootstrap script configuration dialog:"
msgstr "ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງຕ່າງໆຂອງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ bootstrap script:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:105
#, no-wrap
msgid "Uyuni/SUSE Manager server hostname"
msgstr "ຊື່ໂຮສຂອງເຊີເວີ Uyuni/SUSE Manager"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:106
msgid ""
"This should be set to the hostname that the client will use to reach the "
"server, as well as the hostname Note: a Certificate will be used associated "
"to this name for the client systems, as it was configured in the initial "
"setup. If it's changed, a new certificate shall be created"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຊື່ໂຮສທີ່ໄຄເອັນຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ. ໝາຍເຫດ: ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (Certificate) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊື່ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບລະບົບໄຄເອັນ ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຫາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງ, ຈະຕ້ອງສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSL cert location"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:108
msgid ""
"Path, in the server, to the filename provided as a certificate to register "
"it. Keep it as it is."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໃນເຊີເວີໄປຫາຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ. ໃຫ້ປະໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap using Salt"
msgstr "Bootstrap ໂດຍໃຊ້ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:110
msgid ""
"Select this checkbox to apply salt states, like the one we added via "
"configuration channel. It is required to perform the migration."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງນີ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ salt states, ເຊັ່ນອັນທີ່ພວກເຮົາເພີ່ມຜ່ານຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການຍ້າຍລະບົບ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable Client GPG checking"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການກວດສອບ GPG ຂອງໄຄເອັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:112
msgid ""
"Select this checkbox to ensure all packages installed come from the proper "
"sources, in this case, {sll} signed packages."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທຸກແພັກເກັດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ແມ່ນແພັກເກັດທີ່ເຊັນໂດຍ {sll}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable Remote Configuration"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະໄກ"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:115
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable Remote Commands"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງໄລຍະໄກ"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:117
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client HTTP Proxy"
msgstr "Client HTTP Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:118
msgid ""
"Leave blank. This is in case the client requires a proxy to access the "
"server."
msgstr "ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີໄວ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໄຄເອັນຕ້ອງການ proxy ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client HTTP Proxy username"
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ Client HTTP Proxy"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:121
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client HTTP Proxy password"
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານ Client HTTP Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:123
msgid "Click the btn:[Update] button to refresh the [path]``bootstrap.sh`` script."
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Update] ເພື່ອຣີເຟຣຊ (refresh) ສະຄຣິບ [path]``bootstrap.sh``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:124
msgid ""
"The bootstrap script generated is reachable via HTTP.  For example, for a "
"server named [literal]``example.org`` it will be at "
"**+https://example.org/pub/bootstrap/+**.  Accessing the server via SSH, the "
"bootstrap script is available in [path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:125
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Modifying and running the bootstrap script"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ການຣັນ bootstrap script"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:126
msgid ""
"Make a copy of the bootstrap script generated on the server in "
"[path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/``.  For example:"
msgstr "ສຳເນົາ bootstrap script ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນເຊີເວີໄວ້ທີ່ [path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/``. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:127
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd /srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/\n"
"cp bootstrap.sh bootstrap-sll9.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"cd /srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/\n"
"cp bootstrap.sh bootstrap-sll9.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:128
msgid ""
"Edit [path]``bootstrap-sll9.sh``, and add the activation key created "
"earlier.  For example, [literal]``sll9-default``:"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``bootstrap-sll9.sh``, ແລະ ເພີ່ມ activation key ທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ, [literal]``sll9-default``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:129
#, no-wrap
msgid "ACTIVATION_KEYS=sll9-default\n"
msgstr "ACTIVATION_KEYS=sll9-default\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:130
msgid ""
"Run the modified [path]``bootstrap-sll9.sh`` script.  On the client, as "
"root, run:"
msgstr "ຣັນສະຄຣິບ [path]``bootstrap-sll9.sh`` ທີ່ແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ. ໃນເຄື່ອງໄຄເອັນ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ຣັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:131
#, no-wrap
msgid "curl -Sks https://example.org/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-sll9.sh | /bin/bash\n"
msgstr "curl -Sks https://example.org/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-sll9.sh | /bin/bash\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:132
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  For more information about running bootstrap scripts, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc#registering.clients.bootstrap.register[].\n"
msgstr "  ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຣັນ bootstrap scripts, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc#registering.clients.bootstrap.register[].\n"

#.  Configuration channel and software channels will be assigned automatically by the Activation Key
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:133
msgid "Apply highstate to migrate the client to {sll}."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ highstate ເພື່ອຍ້າຍໄຄເອັນໄປເປັນ {sll}."

#.  The high state apply will both apply the configuration channel and migrate the machine to Liberty Linux
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:134
#, no-wrap
msgid "For already registered clients"
msgstr "ສຳລັບໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:135
msgid ""
"Software channels, system group membership, and formulas can be assigned to "
"any already registered client.  This method makes use of the bootstrap "
"script created above for onboarding new systems."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ການເປັນສະມາຊິກກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ແລະ ສູດຕ່າງໆ ສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບໄຄເອັນໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ. ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ bootstrap script ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຂ້າງເທິງສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນລະບົບໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:136
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the System Details page of any registered "
"client you want to migrate to {sll}."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ເປີດໜ້າ System Details ຂອງໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍໄປເປັນ {sll}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:137
msgid ""
"Click the [guimenu]``Reactivation`` tab.  If there is already a key listed, "
"you can use it.  If not, click btn:[Generate New Key], and copy the entire "
"key.  The key will start with [literal]``re-``."
msgstr "ກົດແທັບ [guimenu]``Reactivation``. ຫາກມີ key ປາກົດຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນໄດ້. ຫາກບໍ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[Generate New Key], ແລະ ກັອບປີ້ key ທັງໝົດ. key ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [literal]``re-``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:138
msgid ""
"SSH into this client and set the environment variable to be the key that you "
"copied:"
msgstr "SSH ເຂົ້າໄປໃນໄຄເອັນນີ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment variable) ໃຫ້ເປັນ key ທີ່ທ່ານກັອບປີ້ມາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "export REACTIVATION_KEY=re-xxxxxxxxxxxxxx\n"
msgstr "export REACTIVATION_KEY=re-xxxxxxxxxxxxxx\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:140
msgid ""
"Run the bootstrap script you created above, and the system will re-register "
"using the same profile as before, but with the newly assigned {sll} context."
msgstr "ຣັນ bootstrap script ທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງຂຶ້ນຂ້າງເທິງ, ແລະ ລະບົບຈະລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເດີມ, ແຕ່ຈະຢູ່ໃນບໍລິບົດ (context) ຂອງ {sll} ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃໝ່."

