#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring Formula"
msgstr "ສູດການຕິດຕາມ (Monitoring Formula)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The monitoring services in {productname} are configured using formulas with "
"forms.  The package is installed by default, and contains these formulas:"
msgstr "ການບໍລິການຕິດຕາມໃນ {productname} ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດ (formulas) ພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມ (forms). ແພັກເກັດຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ, ແລະ ປະກອບມີສູດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:3
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Grafana"
msgstr "Grafana"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:4
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prometheus"
msgstr "Prometheus"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:5
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prometheus Exporters"
msgstr "Prometheus Exporters"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:6
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:92
msgid ""
"For more information about using monitoring, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ການຕິດຕາມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Grafana Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ Grafana"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Grafana] tab, and set these parameters in the "
"[guimenu]``Grafana`` section:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Grafana], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Grafana``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:10
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Enabled`` box to enable Grafana visualizations."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Enabled`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການສະແດງຜົນດ້ວຍພາບ (visualizations) ຂອງ Grafana."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:11
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Initial admin password`` is used on the first run only, and "
"Grafana UI prompts to change it.  This field cannot be used to change the "
"Grafana password.  For more information on how to change the password, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Initial admin password`` ແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຣັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ Grafana UI ຈະແຈ້ງໃຫ້ປ່ຽນມັນ. ຊ່ອງນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ Grafana ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For each Prometheus data source you want to use, in the "
"menu:Datasources[Prometheus] section, click btn:[+], and set these "
"parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (data source) ຂອງ Prometheus ແຕ່ລະອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Datasources[Prometheus], ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Datasource name`` field, type a name to identify the data "
"source."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Datasource name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ເພື່ອລະບຸແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Prometheus URL`` field, type the used protocol, the "
"location of the Prometheus server, and append port ``9090``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Prometheus URL``, ໃຫ້ພິມໂປຣໂຕຄໍທີ່ໃຊ້, ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເຊີເວີ Prometheus, ແລະ ຕາມດ້ວຍພອດ ``9090``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For example, ``http://example.com:9090``. In case TLS encryption is enabled "
"in Prometheus formula make sure to use `https` protocol and FQDN."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``http://example.com:9090``. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ TLS ໃນສູດ Prometheus, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ `https` ແລະ FQDN."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the fields [guimenu]``Prometheus server username`` and "
"[guimenu]``Prometheus server password``,"
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Prometheus server username`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Prometheus server password``,"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:17
msgid ""
"enter basic authentication credentials for Prometheus server matching the "
"ones in Prometheus formula."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນພື້ນຖານ (basic authentication) ສຳລັບເຊີເວີ Prometheus ໃຫ້ກົງກັບທີ່ຢູ່ໃນສູດ Prometheus."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Dashboards`` section, check the dashboards you want to "
"use:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Dashboards``, ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກແດຊບອດ (dashboards) ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:19
msgid "[guimenu]``Uyuni server dashboard``"
msgstr "[guimenu]``Uyuni server dashboard``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:20
msgid "[guimenu]``Uyuni clients dashboard``"
msgstr "[guimenu]``Uyuni clients dashboard``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:21
msgid "[guimenu]``PostgreSQL dashboard``"
msgstr "[guimenu]``PostgreSQL dashboard``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:22
msgid "[guimenu]``Apache HTTPD dashboard``"
msgstr "[guimenu]``Apache HTTPD dashboard``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:23
msgid "[guimenu]``Kubernetes cluster dashboard``"
msgstr "[guimenu]``Kubernetes cluster dashboard``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:24
msgid "[guimenu]``Kubernetes etcd dashboard``"
msgstr "[guimenu]``Kubernetes etcd dashboard``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:25
msgid "[guimenu]``Kubernetes namespaces dashboard``"
msgstr "[guimenu]``Kubernetes namespaces dashboard``"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Prometheus Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ Prometheus"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Prometheus] tab, and set these parameters in "
"the [guimenu]``Prometheus`` section:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Prometheus], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Prometheus``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:30
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Enabled`` box to enable Prometheus monitoring."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Enabled`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕິດຕາມຂອງ Prometheus."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:31
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Scrape interval`` field, type the frequency of data "
"scraping, in seconds."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Scrape interval``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງການຂູດຂໍ້ມູນ (data scraping), ເປັນວິນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:32
msgid "For example, ``15`` will scrape data every fifteen seconds."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``15`` ຈະໝາຍເຖິງການຂູດຂໍ້ມູນທຸກໆ 15 ວິນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Evaluation interval`` field, type the frequency of rules "
"evaluation, in seconds."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Evaluation interval``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງການປະເມີນກົດເກນ (rules evaluation), ເປັນວິນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:34
msgid ""
"For example, ``15`` will evaluate alerting and aggregation rules every "
"fifteen seconds."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``15`` ຈະໝາຍເຖິງການປະເມີນກົດເກນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ ແລະ ການລວມຂໍ້ມູນທຸກໆ 15 ວິນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:35
msgid "In the [guimenu]``TLS`` section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``TLS``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Enabled`` box to enable the secure configuration on "
"Prometheus server."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Enabled`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບປອດໄພໃນເຊີເວີ Prometheus."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:37
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:81
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Server Certificate`` field, type the path to the TLS "
"server certificate."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Server Certificate``, ໃຫ້ພິມເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ຂອງເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:38
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:82
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Server Key`` field, type the path to the TLS server key."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Server Key``, ໃຫ້ພິມເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາຄີ (key) TLS ຂອງເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:39
msgid "In the [guimenu]``User`` field, type the user name for Prometheus server."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``User``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເຊີເວີ Prometheus."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:40
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Password Hash`` field, type the password for Prometheus "
"server hashed with bcrypt."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Password Hash``, ໃຫ້ພິມລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບເຊີເວີ Prometheus ທີ່ຜ່ານການແຮຊ (hash) ດ້ວຍ bcrypt."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:41
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Uyuni Server`` section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Uyuni Server``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:42
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Enabled`` box to enable monitoring on this server."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Enabled`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕິດຕາມໃນເຊີເວີນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Autodiscover clients`` box to enable Prometheus to "
"automatically find and monitor new clients when they are added to the "
"server."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Autodiscover clients`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Prometheus ຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມໄຄເອັນໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:44
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Username`` field, type the user name of the Prometheus "
"account on the server."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Username``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງບັນຊີ Prometheus ໃນເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:45
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Password`` field, type the password of the Prometheus "
"account on the server."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Password``, ໃຫ້ພິມລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງບັນຊີ Prometheus ໃນເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:46
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Targets TLS`` section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Targets TLS``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Enabled`` box to enable the secure configuration for "
"auto-discovered targets."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Enabled`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບປອດໄພສຳລັບເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຖືກຄົ້ນຫາໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:48
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``CA Certificate`` field, type the path to the Certificate "
"Authority certificate."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``CA Certificate``, ໃຫ້ພິມເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງ Certificate Authority (CA)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:49
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Client Certificate`` field, type the path to the TLS "
"client certificate for authentication."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Client Certificate``, ໃຫ້ພິມເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ຂອງໄຄເອັນສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Client Key`` field, type the path to the TLS client key "
"for authentication."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Client Key``, ໃຫ້ພິມເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາຄີ TLS ຂອງໄຄເອັນສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:51
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Alerting`` section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Alerting``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:52
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Enable local Alertmanager service`` box to enable the "
"alert manager service."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Enable local Alertmanager service`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການບໍລິການຕົວຈັດການການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (alert manager) ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Use local Alertmanager`` box to use the local alert "
"manager service."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Use local Alertmanager`` ເພື່ອໃຊ້ການບໍລິການຕົວຈັດການການແຈ້ງເຕືອນພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:54
msgid ""
"For each alert manager you want to use, in the menu:Alerting[Alertmanagers] "
"section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຈັດການການແຈ້ງເຕືອນແຕ່ລະອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Alerting[Alertmanagers], ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. For example, ``FIXME``.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:55
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``IP Address:Port`` field, type the location of the alert "
"manager target, including the port number."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``IP Address:Port``, ໃຫ້ພິມຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເປົ້າໝາຍຕົວຈັດການການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ລວມທັງໝາຍເລກພອດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:56
msgid ""
"To use a rule file, in the menu:Alerting[Rule Files] section, click btn:[+], "
"and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ກົດເກນ (rule file), ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Alerting[Rule Files], ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. For example, ``FIXME``.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:57
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Rule Files`` field, type the location of the rule file you "
"want to use."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Rule Files``, ໃຫ້ພິມຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ກົດເກນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:58
msgid ""
"To add a custom scrape configuration, in the [guimenu]``User defined scrape "
"configurations`` section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຂູດຂໍ້ມູນແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``User defined scrape configurations``, ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:59
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Job name`` field, type a unique job name for your "
"configuration."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Job name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ວຽກ (job name) ທີ່ບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັນສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:60
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Files`` field, type the location pattern of file service "
"discovery files you want to use.  For more information, see the upstream "
"documentation "
"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/configuration/#file_sd_config."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Files``, ໃຫ້ພິມຮູບແບບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ຄົ້ນຫາການບໍລິການ (file service discovery) ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຕົ້ນສະບັບ https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/configuration/#file_sd_config."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:62
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:89
msgid ""
"The formula does not generate and deploy the TLS certificates and keys.  "
"Ensure the files are present on the Salt client and readable for the user "
"``prometheus`` before applying the highstate.  For more information about "
"generating client and server certificates, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສູດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ສ້າງ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ແລະ ຄີ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນມີຢູ່ໃນ Salt client ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``prometheus`` ສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ highstate. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໄຄເອັນ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Prometheus Exporters Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ Prometheus Exporters"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:65
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Prometheus Exporters] tab, and set these "
"parameters in the [guimenu]``Node Exporter`` section:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Prometheus Exporters], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Node Exporter``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:66
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Enabled`` box to enable the node exporter."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Enabled`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ node exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:67
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:71
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:76
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Arguments`` field, type any customized arguments for this "
"exporter."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Arguments``, ໃຫ້ພິມອາກິວເມນ (arguments) ໃດໆ ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບ exporter ນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:68
msgid "For example, ``--web.listen-address=\":9100\"``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``--web.listen-address=\":9100\"``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:69
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Apache Exporter`` section:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Apache Exporter``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:70
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Enabled`` box to enable the Apache exporter."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Enabled`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ Apache exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:72
msgid "For example, ``--telemetry.address=\":9117\"``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``--telemetry.address=\":9117\"``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:73
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Postgres Exporter`` section:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Postgres Exporter``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:74
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Enabled`` box to enable the PostreSQL exporter."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Enabled`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ PostreSQL exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:75
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Data source Name`` field, type the name of the data source "
"to use."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Data source Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຂອງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:77
msgid "For example, ``--web.listen-address=\":9187\"``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``--web.listen-address=\":9187\"``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:78
msgid "In the [guimenu]``TLS`` section:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``TLS``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:79
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Enabled`` box to enable the secure configuration."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Enabled`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບປອດໄພ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid "File-based service discovery"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາການບໍລິການແບບໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ (File-based service discovery)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:85
msgid ""
"It is possible to define monitored targets using file-based service "
"discovery provided in the Prometheus formula.  This is a basic example "
"demonstrating the usage:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຈະຕິດຕາມໂດຍໃຊ້ການຄົ້ນຫາການບໍລິການແບບໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນສູດ Prometheus. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງພື້ນຖານທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງການນຳໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[\n"
"  {\n"
"    \"targets\": [ \"<client1>:9100\", \"<client2>:9100\" ],\n"
"    \"labels\": {\n"
"      \"role\": \"<suma-client>\",\n"
"      \"job\": \"<suma-refclient>\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  },\n"
"  {\n"
"    \"targets\": [ \"<server>:80\" ],\n"
"    \"labels\": {\n"
"      \"role\": \"<suma-server>\",\n"
"      \"job\": \"<suma-refhost>\",\n"
"      \"__metrics_path__\": \"/rhn/metrics\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"]\n"
msgstr ""
"[\n"
"  {\n"
"    \"targets\": [ \"<client1>:9100\", \"<client2>:9100\" ],\n"
"    \"labels\": {\n"
"      \"role\": \"<suma-client>\",\n"
"      \"job\": \"<suma-refclient>\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  },\n"
"  {\n"
"    \"targets\": [ \"<server>:80\" ],\n"
"    \"labels\": {\n"
"      \"role\": \"<suma-server>\",\n"
"      \"job\": \"<suma-refhost>\",\n"
"      \"__metrics_path__\": \"/rhn/metrics\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:87
msgid "For more information, see https://prometheus.io/docs/guides/file-sd/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://prometheus.io/docs/guides/file-sd/."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "TLS certificates and keys"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ແລະ ຄີ"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate Forms"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ແບບຟອມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:91
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:114
msgid "When you have completed and saved all the forms, apply the highstate."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ບັນທຶກແບບຟອມທັງໝົດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "PXE Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ PXE"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:2
msgid "The PXE formula is used to configure PXE booting on the branch server."
msgstr "ສູດ PXE ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການບູດ PXE ໃນເຊີເວີສາຂາ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring PXE Booting"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການບູດ PXE"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:5
msgid "Select the [systemitem]``Pxe`` formula, and click [btn]``Save``."
msgstr "ເລືອກສູດ [systemitem]``Pxe``, ແລະ ກົດ [btn]``Save``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:6
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Pxe] tab, and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Pxe], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:7
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Kernel Filename`` field, keep the default value."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel Filename``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:8
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Initrd Filename`` field, keep the default value."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Initrd Filename``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If the terminals connecting to this branch server are running {arm64} "
"architecture, check the [guimenu]``Enable ARM64 UEFI boot`` box.  Leave "
"unchecked for {x86_64}."
msgstr "ຫາກເທີມິນໍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີສາຂານີ້ໃຊ້ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {arm64}, ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Enable ARM64 UEFI boot``. ຫາກເປັນ {x86_64} ໃຫ້ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:10
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Kernel Filename for ARM64`` field, keep the default value."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel Filename for ARM64``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:11
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Initrd Filename for ARM64`` field, keep the default value."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Initrd Filename for ARM64``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Kernel Command Line Parameters`` field, keep the default "
"value.  For more information about possible values, see "
"<<retail.sect.formulas.pxe.kernelparams>>."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel Command Line Parameters``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ <<retail.sect.formulas.pxe.kernelparams>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``PXE root directory`` field, enter the path to the "
"{saltboot} directory (for example, [systemitem]``/srv/saltboot``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``PXE root directory``, ປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ {saltboot} (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``/srv/saltboot``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:14
msgid "Click [btn]``Save Formula`` to save your configuration."
msgstr "ກົດ [btn]``Save Formula`` ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "{saltboot} Kernel Command Line Parameters"
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ Kernel ຂອງ {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:17
msgid ""
"{saltboot} supports common kernel parameters and {saltboot}-specific kernel "
"parameters.  All the parameters can be entered in the [guimenu]``Kernel "
"Command Line Parameters`` field of the PXE formula."
msgstr "{saltboot} ຮອງຮັບພາລາມິເຕີ kernel ທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ພາລາມິເຕີ kernel ສະເພາະຂອງ {saltboot}. ພາລາມິເຕີທັງໝົດສາມາດປ້ອນເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel Command Line Parameters`` ຂອງສູດ PXE ໄດ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "[systemitem]``kiwidebug=1``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``kiwidebug=1``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:19
msgid "Starts a shell on tty2 during boot and enables debug logging in Salt."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ shell ໃນ tty2 ໃນລະຫວ່າງການບູດ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ການບັນທຶກ debug ໃນ Salt."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Do not use this parameter in a production environment as it creates a major "
"security hole.  This parameter should be used only in a development "
"environment for debug purposes."
msgstr "ຫ້າມໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການຜະລິດ (production) ເພາະມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ຮ້າຍແຮງ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການພັດທະນາເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການ debug ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "[systemitem]``MASTER``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``MASTER``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:22
msgid "Overrides auto-detection of the Salt master. For example:"
msgstr "ຂ້າມການກວດຫາອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງ Salt master. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "MASTER=myproxy.domain.com\n"
msgstr "MASTER=myproxy.domain.com\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "[systemitem]``SALT_TIMEOUT``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``SALT_TIMEOUT``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Overrides the local boot fallback timeout if the Salt master does not apply "
"the {saltboot} state within this timeout (default: 60 seconds).  For "
"example:"
msgstr "ຂ້າມເວລາໝົດກຳນົດ (timeout) ຂອງການບູດເຄື່ອງພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ (local boot fallback) ຫາກ Salt master ບໍ່ນຳໃຊ້ສະຖານະ {saltboot} ພາຍໃນເວລານີ້ (ມາດຕະຖານ: 60 ວິນາທີ). ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "SALT_TIMEOUT=300\n"
msgstr "SALT_TIMEOUT=300\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "[systemitem]``DISABLE_HOSTNAME_ID``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``DISABLE_HOSTNAME_ID``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:28
msgid ""
"If the terminal has a hostname assigned by DHCP, it is by default used as a "
"minion ID.  Setting this option to `1` disables this mechanism, and SMBios "
"information will be used as a minion ID."
msgstr "ຫາກເທີມິນໍມີຊື່ໂຮສທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ DHCP, ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ minion ID. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຕເລືອກນີ້ເປັນ `1` ຈະປິດການເຮັດວຽກນີ້, ແລະ ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນ SMBios ເປັນ minion ID ແທນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "[systemitem]``DISABLE_UNIQUE_SUFFIX``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``DISABLE_UNIQUE_SUFFIX``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Setting this option to `1` disables adding random generated suffix to "
"terminal minion ID."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຕເລືອກນີ້ເປັນ `1` ຈະປິດການເພີ່ມຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍ (suffix) ທີ່ສຸ່ມສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃຫ້ກັບ minion ID ຂອງເທີມິນໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:31
msgid ""
"If you set this parameter make sure your terminal has either a unique "
"hostname provided by DHCP and DNS, or the terminal hardware comes with a "
"unique serial number stored in its SMBios memory.  Otherwise there is a risk "
"of terminal minion ID duplicity, and bootstrapping the minion will fail."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີນີ້, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເທີມິນໍຂອງທ່ານມີຊື່ໂຮສທີ່ບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັນເຊິ່ງສະໜອງໂດຍ DHCP ແລະ DNS, ຫຼື ອຸປະກອນເທີມິນໍມາກັບໝາຍເລກຊີຣຽວ (serial number) ທີ່ບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັນເຊິ່ງເກັບໄວ້ໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ SMBios. ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ອາດມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ minion ID ຂອງເທີມິນໍຈະຊໍ້າກັນ, ແລະ ການ bootstrap minion ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:32
msgid ""
"The following parameters (`MINION_ID_PREFIX`, `salt_device`, `root`) are "
"usually autoconfigured and should be used only in specific conditions such "
"as debugging or development:"
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ (`MINION_ID_PREFIX`, `salt_device`, `root`) ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນເງື່ອນໄຂສະເພາະເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ ການ debugging ຫຼື ການພັດທະນາ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "[systemitem]``MINION_ID_PREFIX``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``MINION_ID_PREFIX``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:34
msgid "Branch ID set in the Branch Network formula form."
msgstr "ID ຂອງສາຂາທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນແບບຟອມສູດເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "[systemitem]``salt_device``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``salt_device``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:36
msgid "Device that contains the Salt configuration."
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນທີ່ປະກອບມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Salt."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "[systemitem]``root``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``root``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Device that contains the already deployed root file system.  Used for "
"falling back to local boot."
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນທີ່ປະກອບມີລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຮາກ (root file system) ທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການບູດເຄື່ອງພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ (local boot)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{saltboot} Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The {saltboot} formula is used to configure disk images and partitioning for "
"the selected hardware type."
msgstr "ສູດ {saltboot} ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບພາບດິດ (disk images) ແລະ ການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ (partitioning) ສຳລັບປະເພດຮາດແວທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The {saltboot} formula is meant to be used as a group formula.  Enable and "
"configure {saltboot} formula for hardware type groups."
msgstr "ສູດ {saltboot} ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນສູດກຸ່ມ. ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ {saltboot} ສຳລັບກຸ່ມປະເພດຮາດແວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To apply changes to a terminal, terminal needs to be restarted.  Applying "
"highstate does not have any effect on running terminals."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງກັບເທີມິນໍ, ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຣີສະຕາດເທີມິນໍໃໝ່. ການນຳໃຊ້ highstate ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ ຕໍ່ເທີມິນໍທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Hardware Type Group with {saltboot}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າກຸ່ມປະເພດຮາດແວດ້ວຍ {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Open the details page for your new hardware type group, and navigate to the "
"[guimenu]``Formulas`` tab."
msgstr "ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບກຸ່ມປະເພດຮາດແວໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Formulas``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:7
msgid "Select the {saltboot} formula and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ເລືອກສູດ {saltboot} ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:8
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Saltboot] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Saltboot]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:9
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Disk 1`` section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Disk 1``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Disk symbolic ID`` field, enter a custom name for the disk "
"(for example, [systemitem]``disk1``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Disk symbolic ID``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບດິດ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``disk1``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:11
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Device type`` field, select [systemitem]``DISK``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Device type``, ເລືອກ [systemitem]``DISK``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Disk device`` field, select the device that corresponds to "
"the device name on the target machine or asterisk [systemitem]``*``, see "
"xref:saltboot-formula-disk-selection[]."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Disk device``, ເລືອກອຸປະກອນທີ່ກົງກັບຊື່ອຸປະກອນໃນເຄື່ອງເປົ້າໝາຍ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍດອກຈັນ [systemitem]``*``, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:saltboot-formula-disk-selection[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:13
msgid "In the [guimenu]``RAID level`` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``RAID level``, ໃຫ້ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:14
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Disk Label`` field, select [systemitem]``gpt``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Disk Label``, ເລືອກ [systemitem]``gpt``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition`` section, set these parameters for "
"[guimenu]``Partition 1``:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Partition``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ [guimenu]``Partition 1``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition symbolic ID`` field, enter a custom name for the "
"partition (for example, [systemitem]``p1``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Partition symbolic ID``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບພາກສ່ວນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``p1``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:17
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Partition size`` use value 500."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Partition size`` ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າ 500."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:18
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Device mount point`` use [path]``/boot/efi``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Device mount point`` ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [path]``/boot/efi``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:19
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filesystem format`` use [systemitem]``vfat``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filesystem format`` ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``vfat``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:20
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:28
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:36
msgid "In the [guimenu]``OS Image to deploy`` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``OS Image to deploy``, ໃຫ້ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:21
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Partition encryption password`` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Partition encryption password``, ໃຫ້ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:22
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Partition flags`` use [systemitem]``boot``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Partition flags`` ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``boot``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition`` section, set these parameters for "
"[guimenu]``Partition 2``:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Partition``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ [guimenu]``Partition 2``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition symbolic ID`` field, enter a custom name for the "
"partition (for example, [systemitem]``p2``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Partition symbolic ID``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບພາກສ່ວນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``p2``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:25
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition size`` field, specify a size for the partition "
"in Mebibytes (MiB)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Partition size``, ໃຫ້ລະບຸຂະໜາດສຳລັບພາກສ່ວນເປັນ ເມບີໄບຕ໌ (MiB)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:26
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Device mount point`` field, select a location to mount the "
"partition (for example, [path]``/data``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Device mount point``, ເລືອກຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຈະເມົາທ໌ (mount) ພາກສ່ວນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [path]``/data``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filesystem format`` field, select your preferred format "
"(for example, [systemitem]``xfs``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filesystem format``, ເລືອກຮູບແບບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``xfs``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:29
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:37
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:48
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition encryption password`` field, enter a password if "
"you want to encrypt the partition."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Partition encryption password``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າລະຫັດພາກສ່ວນນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:30
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:49
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Partition flags`` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Partition flags``, ໃຫ້ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:31
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition`` section, set these parameters for "
"[guimenu]``Partition 3``:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Partition``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ [guimenu]``Partition 3``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:32
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition symbolic ID`` field, enter a custom name for the "
"partition (for example, [systemitem]``p3``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Partition symbolic ID``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບພາກສ່ວນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``p3``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:34
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Device mount point`` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Device mount point``, ໃຫ້ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:35
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filesystem format`` field, select [systemitem]``swap``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filesystem format``, ເເລືອກ [systemitem]``swap``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:38
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Partition flags`` field, select [systemitem]``swap``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Partition flags``, ເລືອກ [systemitem]``swap``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:39
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition`` section, set these parameters for "
"[guimenu]``Partition 4``:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Partition``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ [guimenu]``Partition 4``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:40
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition symbolic ID`` field, enter a custom name for the "
"partition (for example, [systemitem]``p4``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Partition symbolic ID``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບພາກສ່ວນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``p4``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:41
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Partition size`` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Partition size``, ໃຫ້ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:42
msgid "This will ensure the partition uses up all remaining space."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພາກສ່ວນນັ້ນໃຊ້ເນື້ອທີ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ຍັງເຫຼືອຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:43
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Device mount point`` field, select [systemitem]``/``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Device mount point``, ເລືອກ [systemitem]``/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:44
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filesystem format`` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filesystem format``, ໃຫ້ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:45
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``OS Image to deploy`` field, enter the name of the image to "
"deploy."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``OS Image to deploy``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:46
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Image version`` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Image version``, ໃຫ້ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:47
msgid "This will ensure you use the latest available version."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໃຊ້ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Special Partition Types"
msgstr "ປະເພດພາກສ່ວນ (Partition) ພິເສດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:52
msgid "The {saltboot} formula helps you with setting up special partition types."
msgstr "ສູດ {saltboot} ຊ່ວຍທ່ານໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າປະເພດພາກສ່ວນພິເສດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:53
msgid ""
"For terminal to be able to boot locally, either [systemitem]``BIOS grub`` or "
"[systemitem]``EFI`` partition must be configured."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເທີມິນໍສາມາດບູດຈາກພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງໄດ້, ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາກສ່ວນ [systemitem]``BIOS grub`` ຫຼື [systemitem]``EFI`` ຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "BIOS grub Partition"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ BIOS grub"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:55
msgid ""
"A BIOS grub partition is needed for local booting from a `GPT` disk on "
"non-EFI machines.  For more information, see "
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BIOS_boot_partition."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ BIOS grub ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການບູດຈາກພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງຈາກດິດແບບ `GPT` ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ EFI. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BIOS_boot_partition."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:56
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:61
msgid "In the formula, enter the following options:"
msgstr "ໃນສູດ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນໂຕເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Partition Symbolic ID: p1\n"
"Partition Size (MiB): 50\n"
"Partition Flags: bios_grub\n"
msgstr ""
"Partition Symbolic ID: p1\n"
"Partition Size (MiB): 50\n"
"Partition Flags: bios_grub\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:58
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:63
msgid "Leave the other fields empty."
msgstr "ປະຊ່ອງອື່ນໆ ໃຫ້ຫວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "EFI Partition"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ EFI"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:60
msgid ""
"An EFI partition is needed for local booting on EFI machines, "
"[guimenu]``Partition Table Type`` must be `GPT`.  For more information, see "
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EFI_system_partition."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ EFI ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການບູດຈາກພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງໃນເຄື່ອງ EFI, [guimenu]``Partition Table Type`` ຕ້ອງເປັນ `GPT`. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EFI_system_partition."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Partition Symbolic ID: p1\n"
"Partition Size (MiB): 500\n"
"Device Mount Point: /boot/efi\n"
"Filesystem Format: vfat\n"
"Partition Flags: boot\n"
msgstr ""
"Partition Symbolic ID: p1\n"
"Partition Size (MiB): 500\n"
"Device Mount Point: /boot/efi\n"
"Filesystem Format: vfat\n"
"Partition Flags: boot\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disk Selection in {saltboot} Formula"
msgstr "ການເລືອກດິດໃນສູດ {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When there is only one disk present on target hardware (including USB "
"drives), use an asterisk [systemitem]``*`` to automatically select the disk "
"device."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີດິດພຽງໜຶ່ງອັນໃນຮາດແວເປົ້າໝາຍ (ລວມທັງ USB drive), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍດອກຈັນ [systemitem]``*`` ເພື່ອເລືອກອຸປະກອນດິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:66
msgid ""
"When there are multiple disks, use an asterisk [systemitem]``*`` in the "
"device path.  In this example, SATA disks are differentiated from USB disks:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີດິດຫຼາຍອັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍດອກຈັນ [systemitem]``*`` ໃນເສັ້ນທາງອຸປະກອນ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ດິດ SATA ຈະຖືກແຍກອອກຈາກດິດ USB:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/dev/disk/by-path/*-ata-1\n"
"/dev/disk/by-path/*usb*\n"
msgstr ""
"/dev/disk/by-path/*-ata-1\n"
"/dev/disk/by-path/*usb*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:68
msgid ""
"If the entered value does not contain [systemitem]``/``, the entered value "
"is automatically prepended by [path]``/dev/disk/by-path/``.  For example, "
"[systemitem]``\\*usb*`` is the same as [path]``/dev/disk/by-path/\\*usb*``."
msgstr "ຫາກຄ່າທີ່ປ້ອນບໍ່ມີ [systemitem]``/``, ຄ່າທີ່ປ້ອນນັ້ນຈະຖືກຕື່ມ [path]``/dev/disk/by-path/`` ໃສ່ທາງໜ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``\\*usb*`` ຈະມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [path]``/dev/disk/by-path/\\*usb*``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:69
msgid ""
"If you prefer to select specific devices, you can this format in the disk "
"device field:"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເລືອກອຸປະກອນສະເພາະ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຮູບແບບນີ້ໃນຊ່ອງອຸປະກອນດິດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:70
msgid "symbolic names (for example: [path]``/dev/sda``)"
msgstr "ຊື່ສັນຍະລັກ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [path]``/dev/sda``)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:71
msgid "by-path (for example: [path]``/dev/disk/by-path/..``)"
msgstr "ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [path]``/dev/disk/by-path/..``)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:72
msgid "by-id (for example: [path]``/dev/disk/by-id/...``)"
msgstr "ຕາມໄອດີ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [path]``/dev/disk/by-id/...``)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:73
msgid ""
"To see a list of available devices from the command prompt, press kbd:[Esc] "
"while waiting for key approval."
msgstr "ຫາກຕ້ອງການເບິ່ງລາຍການອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈາກພອມພ໌ຄຳສັ່ງ (command prompt), ໃຫ້ກົດ kbd:[Esc] ໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ລໍຖ້າການອະນຸມັດຄີ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting the {saltboot} Formula"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາສູດ {saltboot}"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "``msdos`` Disklabel Limitations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ Disklabel ແບບ ``msdos``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:76
msgid ""
"On the ``msdos`` disk label, you can create a maximum of four primary "
"partitions.  Extended partitions are not supported.  If you need more than "
"four partitions, use the ``GPT`` disk label instead."
msgstr "ໃນ disk label ແບບ ``msdos``, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງພາກສ່ວນຫຼັກ (primary partitions) ໄດ້ສູງສຸດພຽງສີ່ອັນ. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບພາກສ່ວນເສີມ (extended partitions). ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຫຼາຍກວ່າສີ່ພາກສ່ວນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ disk label ແບບ ``GPT`` ແທນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:77
msgid ""
"For more information on troubleshooting problems with the {saltboot} "
"formula, see xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-saltboot.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຂອງສູດ {saltboot}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-saltboot.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "TFTPd Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ TFTPd"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The TFTPd formula is used to configure the TFTP service on the {productname} "
"{smr} branch server."
msgstr "ສູດ TFTPd ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການບໍລິການ TFTP ໃນເຊີເວີສາຂາ {productname} {smr}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring TFTP"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ TFTP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:5
msgid "Select the [systemitem]``Tftpd`` formula, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ເລືອກສູດ [systemitem]``Tftpd``, ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:6
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Tftpd] tab, and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Tftpd], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Internal Network Address`` field, enter the IP address of "
"the branch server (for example: [systemitem]``192.168.1.5``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Internal Network Address``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``192.168.1.5``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``TFTP Base Directory`` field, enter the path to the "
"{saltboot} directory (for example, [systemitem]``/srv/saltboot``)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``TFTP Base Directory``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ {saltboot} (ຕົວຢ່າງ, [systemitem]``/srv/saltboot``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Run TFTP Under User`` field, enter "
"[systemitem]``saltboot``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Run TFTP Under User``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ [systemitem]``saltboot``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtualization Guest Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ Virtualization Guest"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Virtualization Guest formula is used to configure settings for virtual "
"machine."
msgstr "ສູດ Virtualization Guest ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (virtual machine)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Open the [guimenu]``Tuning`` pull-down checklist and select from the "
"following virtual machine performance tuning settings:"
msgstr "ເປີດລາຍການກວດສອບ [guimenu]``Tuning`` ແລະ ເລືອກຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າປັບແຕ່ງປະສິດທິພາບຂອງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:4
msgid "[guimenu]``Disable IRQ balancing``."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Disable IRQ balancing``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:5
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Disable Kernel Samepage Merging (KSM)``.  Reduces performance "
"overhead by not sharing memory across virtual machines."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Disable Kernel Samepage Merging (KSM)``. ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດພາລະການເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການບໍ່ແບ່ງປັນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳລະຫວ່າງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:6
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Optimizations for KVM passed through host CPU``.  Requires the "
"KVM hint-dedicated option to be set on the VM definition."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Optimizations for KVM passed through host CPU``. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຕເລືອກ KVM hint-dedicated ໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າ VM."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:7
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:11
msgid ""
"When configured, click btn:[Save Formula] to save your configuration, and "
"apply the highstate."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Save Formula] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtualization Host Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ Virtualization Host"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Virtualization Host formula is used to configure settings for a "
"virtualization host."
msgstr "ສູດ Virtualization Host ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບເຄື່ອງທີ່ເປັນໂຮສຂອງລະບົບສະເໝືອນ (virtualization host)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hypervisor"
msgstr "Hypervisor"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:4
msgid "Select KVM or Xen as the hypervisor."
msgstr "ເລືອກ KVM ຫຼື Xen ເປັນ hypervisor."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create default storage pool"
msgstr "ສ້າງ storage pool ມາດຕະຖານ"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create default virtual network"
msgstr "ສ້າງເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນມາດຕະຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Default pool: Open the pull-down list and enter the directory name of the "
"default storage pool."
msgstr "Default pool: ເປີດລາຍການລົງມາ ແລະ ປ້ອນຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂອງ storage pool ມາດຕະຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Default net: Open the pull-down list and configure the default virtual "
"network by setting the [guimenu]``Mode`` ([literal]``NAT`` or "
"[literal]``Bridge``) and the [guimenu]``Bridge name``."
msgstr "Default net: ເປີດລາຍການລົງມາ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນມາດຕະຖານໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [guimenu]``Mode`` ([literal]``NAT`` ຫຼື [literal]``Bridge``) ແລະ [guimenu]``Bridge name``."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງ (Tuning)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:10
msgid "Enable IOMMU support (x86_64)."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບ IOMMU (x86_64)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ Yomi"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Yomi (yet one more installer) installer for {suse} and openSUSE "
"operating systems is configured using formulas with forms."
msgstr "ຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງ Yomi (yet one more installer) ສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {suse} ແລະ openSUSE ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:3
msgid "The ``yomi-formula`` package provides these formulas:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ ``yomi-formula`` ປະກອບມີສູດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
