#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When the pillar is assigned to a system with [path]``top.sls``, the GPG "
"encrypted pillar data is available in a decrypted format. \n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ pillar ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບດ້ວຍ [path]``top.sls``, ຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດດ້ວຍ GPG ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ຖອດລະຫັດແລ້ວ. \n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[NOTE]\n"
"====\n"
"The client's in-memory cache is only updated on startup or when running "
"execution module functions that trigger a cache refresh such as "
"[literal]``saltutil.refresh_pillar``, [litaral]``pillar.items``, or "
"[literal]``state.apply``.\n"
"====\n"
msgstr ""
"[ໝາຍເຫດ]\n"
"====\n"
"ແຄຊໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (in-memory cache) ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະຖືກອັບເດດເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບໃໝ່ ຫຼື ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກຂອງຟັງຊັນ execution module ທີ່ກະຕຸ້ນການຣີເຟຣຊແຄຊ ເຊັ່ນ: [literal]``saltutil.refresh_pillar``, [literal]``pillar.items``, ຫຼື [literal]``state.apply``.\n"
"====\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"suma-sles15sp1.tf.local:\n"
"    ----------\n"
"    my-secret:\n"
"        t0p s3cr3t!\n"
msgstr ""
"suma-sles15sp1.tf.local:\n"
"    ----------\n"
"    my-secret:\n"
"        t0p s3cr3t!\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Export the GPG key"
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກ (Export) ລະຫັດ GPG"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:32
msgid "To export the GPG key, use the command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກລະຫັດ GPG, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:33
msgid ""
"gpg --export 'SUMA Salt Master' --homedir /etc/salt/gpgkeys --output "
"suma-salt-master.gpg"
msgstr "gpg --export 'SUMA Salt Master' --homedir /etc/salt/gpgkeys --output suma-salt-master.gpg"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here 'SUMA Salt Master' is the name used during key generation.\n"
msgstr "ໃນນີ້ 'SUMA Salt Master' ແມ່ນຊື່ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງຄູ່ລະຫັດ.\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [literal]```suma-salt-master.gpg``` public key can be freely shared.\n"
msgstr "Public key [literal]```suma-salt-master.gpg``` ສາມາດແບ່ງປັນໄດ້ຢ່າງເສລີ.\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"//For more information about GPG, see "
"https://www.gnupg.org/documentation/.\n"
msgstr "//ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ GPG, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://www.gnupg.org/documentation/.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-large-scale-tuning.adoc:3
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-scaling-minions.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information on managing large scale deployments, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Guide Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງຄູ່ມື Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Salt is a remote execution engine, configuration management and "
"orchestration system used by {productname} to manage clients."
msgstr "Salt ແມ່ນລະບົບສັ່ງການທາງໄກ (remote execution engine), ລະບົບຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (configuration management) ແລະ ລະບົບປະສານງານ (orchestration) ທີ່ {productname} ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In {productname}, the Salt master runs on the {productname} Server, allowing "
"you to register and manage Salt clients."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, Salt master ຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ຈັດການ Salt clients ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:5
msgid "This book is designed to be a primer for using Salt with {productname}."
msgstr "ປຶ້ມຫົວນີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເປັນບົດຮຽນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການໃຊ້ Salt ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt, see the Salt documentation at "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/contents.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ Salt ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/contents.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:7
msgid "The current version of Salt in {productname} is {saltversion}."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ Salt ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ {saltversion}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Throughout the {productname} documentation, we use the term `Salt clients` "
"to refer to Salt machines that are connected to and controlled by the Salt "
"master on the {productname} Server.  This is to clearly differentiate them "
"from traditional clients.  In other documentation, and in some internal "
"references, Salt clients are sometimes referred to as Salt `minions` "
"instead.  This is a difference in terminology only."
msgstr "ຕະຫຼອດທົ່ວເອກະສານຂອງ {productname}, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ຄຳວ່າ `Salt clients` ເພື່ອອ້າງເຖິງເຄື່ອງ Salt ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ Salt master ໃນ {productname} Server. ນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອສ້າງຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຢ່າງຊັດເຈນຈາກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມ. ໃນເອກະສານອື່ນໆ, ແລະ ໃນບາງບ່ອນອ້າງອີງພາຍໃນ, Salt clients ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ Salt `minions` ແທນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄວາມແຕກແຕ່ງທາງດ້ານຄຳສັບເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Rate Limiting"
msgstr "ການຈຳກັດອັດຕາການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Salt (Rate Limiting)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt is able to run commands in parallel on a large number of clients.  This "
"can potentially create large amounts of load on your infrastructure.  You "
"can use these rate-limiting parameters to control the load in your "
"environment."
msgstr "Salt ສາມາດສັ່ງການໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍເຮັດວຽກພ້ອມໆກັນໄດ້. ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະສ້າງພາລະ (load) ມະຫາສານໃຫ້ກັບໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຂອງເຈົ້າ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີຈຳກັດອັດຕາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມພາລະໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:3
msgid ""
"These parameters are all configured in the [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"configuration file."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ທັງໝົດແມ່ນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Salt commands that are executed from the command line are not subject to "
"these parameters."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ທີ່ຖືກສັ່ງການຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ (command line) ໂດຍກົງ ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Batching"
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກແບບເປັນຊຸດ (Batching)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:6
msgid ""
"There are two parameters that control how actions are sent to clients, one "
"for the batch size, and one for the delay."
msgstr "ມີສອງພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໜຶ່ງຄືຂະໜາດຂອງຊຸດ (batch size) ແລະ ອີກໜຶ່ງຄືໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າ (delay)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:7
msgid ""
"When the {productname} Server sends a batch of actions to the target "
"clients, it will send it to the number of clients determined in the batch "
"size parameter.  After the specified delay period, commands will be sent to "
"the next batch of clients.  The number of clients in each subsequent batch "
"is equal to the number of clients that have completed in the previous batch."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ {productname} Server ສົ່ງຊຸດຂອງຄຳສັ່ງໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເປົ້າໝາຍ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງໃຫ້ຕາມຈຳນວນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນພາລາມິເຕີ batch size. ຫຼັງຈາກໝົດໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າທີ່ລະບຸ, ຄຳສັ່ງຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຊຸດຖັດໄປ. ຈຳນວນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃນແຕ່ລະຊຸດຖັດມາຈະເທົ່າກັບຈຳນວນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຮັດວຽກສຳເລັດແລ້ວໃນຊຸດກ່ອນໜ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Choosing a lower batch size will reduce system load and parallelism, but "
"might reduce overall performance for processing actions."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຂະໜາດ batch size ທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດພາລະຂອງລະບົບ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກແບບຂະໜານ, ແຕ່ອາດຈະຫຼຸດປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍລວມໃນການປະມວນຜົນຄຳສັ່ງ."

#.  Defaulte is 200 according to salt-large-scale-tuning.adoc
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The batch size parameter sets the maximum number of clients that can execute "
"a single action at the same time.  Adjust the "
"[systemitem]``java.salt_batch_size`` parameter."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີ batch size ຈະກຳນົດຈຳນວນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກດຽວກັນພ້ອມໆກັນໄດ້. ປັບຄ່າໄດ້ທີ່ພາລາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``java.salt_batch_size``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:10
msgid "Defaults to 200."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 200."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Increasing the delay increases the chance that multiple clients will have "
"completed before the next action is issued (more clients are grouped "
"together in subsequent batches), resulting in fewer overall commands, and "
"reducing load."
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມໂອກາດທີ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງຈະເຮັດວຽກສຳເລັດກ່ອນທີ່ຄຳສັ່ງຖັດໄປຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກ (ມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍລວມກຸ່ມກັນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນຊຸດຖັດໄປ), ເຮັດໃຫ້ມີຈຳນວນຄຳສັ່ງໂດຍລວມໜ້ອຍລົງ ແລະ ຫຼຸດພາລະຂອງລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The batch delay parameter sets the amount of time, in seconds, to wait after "
"a command from the previous batch is processed before beginning to process "
"the command on the next client.  Adjust the "
"[systemitem]``java.salt_batch_delay`` parameter.  Defaults to 1.0 seconds."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີ batch delay ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາເປັນວິນາທີທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າຫຼັງຈາກຄຳສັ່ງຈາກຊຸດກ່ອນໜ້າຖືກປະມວນຜົນ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງເລີ່ມປະມວນຜົນຄຳສັ່ງໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຖັດໄປ. ປັບຄ່າໄດ້ທີ່ພາລາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``java.salt_batch_delay``. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1.0 ວິນາທີ."

