#. Old content starts here. Leaving this breadcrumb here for now, but these pages will need to be removed from the Salt Guide entirely at some point. --LKB 2020-07-17
#. There is no hard maximum number of supported systems.
#. Many factors can affect how many clients can reliably be used in a particular installation.
#. Factors can include which features are used, and how the hardware and systems are configured.
#. [WARNING]
#. ====
#. Large installations require standard Salt clients.
#. These instructions cannot be used in environments using traditional clients or Salt SSH minions.
#. ====
#. == Hardware and Infrastructure
#. Not all problems can be solved with better hardware, but choosing the right hardware is an absolute necessity for large scale deployments.
#. The minimum requirements for the {productname} Server are:
#. * Eight or more recent {x86_64} CPU cores.
#. * 32{nbsp}GiB RAM.
#. For installations with thousands of clients, use 64{nbsp}GB or more.
#. * Fast I/O storage devices, such as locally attached SSDs.
#. For PostgreSQL data directories, we recommend locally attached RAID-0 SSDs.
#. If the {productname} Server is virtualized, enable the `elevator=none` kernel command line option, for the best input/output performance.
#. You can check the current status with [command]``cat /sys/block/<DEVICE>/queue/scheduler``.
#. This command will display a list of available schedulers with the currently active one in brackets.
#. To change the scheduler before a reboot, use [command]``echo none > /sys/block/<DEVICE>/queue/scheduler``.
#. The minimum requirements for the {productname} Proxy are:
#. * One {productname} Proxy per 500-1000 clients, depending on available network bandwidth.
#. * Two or more recent {x86_64} CPU cores.
#. * 16{nbsp}GB RAM, and sufficient storage for caching.
#. Clients should never be directly attached to the {productname} Server in production systems.
#. In large scale installations, the {productname} Proxy is used primarily as a local cache for content between the server and clients.
#. Using proxies in this way can substantially reduce download time for clients, and decrease Server egress bandwidth use.
#. The number of clients per proxy will affect the download time.
#. Always take network structure and available bandwidth into account.
#. We recommend you estimate the download time of typical usage to determine how many clients to connnect to each proxy.
#. To do this, you will need to estimate the number of package upgrades required in every patch cycle.
#. You can use this formula to calculate the download time:
#. ----
#. Size of updates * Number of clients / Theoretical download speed / 60
#. ----
#. For example, the total time needed to transfer 400{nbsp}MB of upgrades through a physical link speed of 1{nbsp}GB/s to 3000 clients:
#. ----
#. 400 MB  * 3000 / 119 MB/s / 60 = 169 min
#. ----
#. == Operation Recommendations
#. This section contains a range of recommendations for large scale deployments.
#. [NOTE]
#. ====
#. Always start small and scale up gradually.
#. Monitor the server as you scale to identify problems early.
#. ====
#. // Might be worth alphabetising these. LKB 2018-08-09
#. === Salt Client Onboarding Rate
#. The rate at which {productname} can onboard clients is limited and depends on hardware resources.
#. Onboarding clients at a faster rate than {productname} is configured for will build up a backlog of unprocessed keys.
#. This slows down the process and can potentially exhaust resources.
#. We recommend that you limit the acceptance key rate programmatically.
#. A safe starting point would be to onboard a client every 15 seconds.
#. You can do that with this command:
#. ----
#. for k in $(salt-key -l un|grep -v Unaccepted); do salt-key -y -a $k; sleep 15; done
#. ----
#. === Salt Clients and the RNG
#. All communication to and from Salt clients is encrypted.
#. During client onboarding, Salt uses asymmetric cryptography, which requires available entropy from the Random Number Generator (RNG) facility in the kernel.
#. If sufficient entropy is not available from the RNG, it will significantly slow down communications.
#. This is especially true in virtualized environments.
#. Ensure enough entropy is present, or change the virtualization host options.
#. You can check the amount of available entropy with the [command]``cat /proc/sys/kernel/random/entropy_avail``.
#. It should never be below 100-200.
#. === Clients Running with Unaccepted Salt Keys
#. Clients which have not been onboarded, that is clients running with unaccepted Salt keys, consume more resources than clients that have been onboarded.
#. Generally, this consumes about an extra 2.5 Kb/s of inbound network bandwidth per client.
#. For example, 1000 idle clients will consume about 2.5 Mb/s extra.
#. This consumption will reduce almost to zero when onboarding has been completed for all clients.
#. Limit the number of non-onboarded clients for optimal performance.
#. === Disabling the Salt Mine
#. In older versions, {productname} used a tool called Salt mine to check client availability.
#. The Salt mine would cause clients to contact the server every hour, which created significant load.
#. With the introduction of a more efficient mechanism in {productname}{nbsp}3.2, the Salt mine is no longer required.
#. Instead, the {productname} Server uses Taskomatic to ping only the clients that appear to have been offline for twelve hours or more, with all clients being contacted at least once in every twenty four hour period by default.
#. You can adjust this by changing the [systemitem]``web.system_checkin_threshold`` parameter in [path]``rhn.conf``.
#. The value is expressed in days, and the default value is [literal]``1``.
#. Newly registered Salt clients will have the Salt mine disabled by default.
#. If the Salt mine is running on your system, you can reduce load by disabling it.
#. This is especially effective if you have a large number of clients.
#. Disable the Salt mine by running this command on the server:
#. ----
#. salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_mine_config_clean_up
#. ----
#. This will restart the clients and generate some Salt events to be processed by the server.
#. If you have a large number of clients, handling these events could create excessive load.
#. To avoid this, you can execute the command in batch mode with this command:
#. ----
#. salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_mine_config_clean_up
#. ----
#. You will need to wait for this command to finish executing.
#. Do not end the process with kbd:[Ctrl+C].
#. === Disable Unnecessary Taskomatic jobs
#. To minimize wasted resources, you can disable non-essential or unused Taskomatic jobs.
#. You can see the list of Taskomatic jobs in the {productname} {webui}, at menu:Admin[Task Schedules].
#. To disable a job, click the name of the job you want to disable, select [guimenu]``Disable Schedule``, and click  btn:[Update Schedule].
#. To delete a job, click the name of the job you want to delete, and click  btn:[Delete Schedule].
#. We recommend disabling these jobs:
#. * Daily comparison of configuration files: [systemitem]``compare-configs-default``
#. * Hourly synchronization of {cobbler} files: [systemitem]``cobbler-sync-default``
#. * Daily gatherer and subscription matcher: [systemitem]``gatherer-matcher-default``
#. Do not attempt to disable any other jobs, as it could prevent {productname} from functioning correctly.
#. === Swap and Monitoring
#. It is especially important in large scale deployments that you keep your {productname} Server constantly monitored and backed up.
#. Swap space use can have significant impacts on performance.
#. If significant non-transient swap usage is detected, you can increase the available hardware RAM.
#. You can also consider tuning the Server to consume less memory.
#. For more information on tuning, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-large-scale-tuning.adoc[].
#. === AES Key Rotation
#. Communications from the Salt Master to clients is encrypted with a single AES key.
#. The key is rotated when:
#.  * The ``salt-master`` process is restarted, or
#.  * Any minion key is deleted (for example, when a client is deleted from {productname})
#. After the AES key has been rotated, all clients must re-authenticate to the master.
#. By default, this happens next time a client receives a message.
#. If you have a large number of clients (several thousands), this can cause a high CPU load on the {productname} Server.
#. If the CPU load is excessive, we recommend that you delete keys in batches, and in off-peak hours if possible, to avoid overloading the server.
#. For more information, see:
#. * https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/intro_scale.html#too-many-minions-re-authing
#. * https://docs.saltproject.io/en/getstarted/system/communication.html
#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt SSH"
msgstr "Salt SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt SSH allows Salt commands and states to be issued directly over SSH.  "
"SSH connections are created on demand, when the server executes an action on "
"a client."
msgstr "Salt SSH ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ states ຂອງ Salt ຜ່ານ SSH ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ, ເມື່ອເຊີເວີສັ່ງໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt SSH, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/ssh/[https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/ssh/]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSH Connection Methods"
msgstr "ວິທີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In {productname} there are two SSH connection methods, `ssh-push` and "
"`ssh-push-tunnel`.  In both methods the server initiates an SSH connection "
"to the client to execute a Salt call."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} ມີສອງວິທີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຄື: `ssh-push` ແລະ `ssh-push-tunnel`. ໃນທັງສອງວິທີ, ເຊີເວີຈະເປັນຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເພື່ອຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the `ssh-push` method, the package manager works as normal, and the HTTP "
"or HTTPS connection is directly created."
msgstr "ໃນວິທີ `ssh-push`, ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດຈະເຮັດວຽກຕາມປົກກະຕິ, ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the `ssh-push-tunnel` method, the server creates an HTTP or HTTPS "
"connection through an SSH tunnel.  The HTTP connection initiated by the "
"package manager is redirected through the tunnel using `/etc/hosts` "
"aliasing.  Use this method for in-place firewall environments that block "
"HTTP or HTTPS connections between server and client."
msgstr "ໃນວິທີ `ssh-push-tunnel`, ເຊີເວີຈະສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS ຜ່ານທໍ່ SSH (SSH tunnel). ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຜ່ານທໍ່ SSH ໂດຍໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຊື່ແຝງ (aliasing) ໃນ `/etc/hosts`. ໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີໄຟວໍ (firewall) ປິດກັ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt SSH Integration"
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນຂອງ Salt SSH (Salt SSH Integration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:9
msgid "As with all Salt calls, {productname} invokes `salt-ssh` via the `salt-api`."
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບການຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt ທັງໝົດ, {productname} ຈະຮຽກໃຊ້ `salt-ssh` ຜ່ານ `salt-api`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Salt SSH relies on a roster to obtain details such as hostname, ports, and "
"the SSH parameters of a client.  {productname} keeps these details in the "
"database and makes them available to Salt SSH by using the "
"[literal]``uyuni`` roster module, or by generating a temporary roster file "
"on bootstrapping new clients with the {webui}.  The location of the "
"temporary roster file is supplied to Salt SSH using the "
"[option]``roster-file`` option.  For the registered clients "
"[option]``roster`` set to `uyuni` is used instead to get the roster from the "
"database with `uyuni` salt roster module."
msgstr "Salt SSH ອາໄສ roster ເພື່ອຂໍຂໍ້ມູນລາຍລະອຽດ ເຊັ່ນ: ຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname), ພອດ (ports), ແລະ ພາລາມິເຕີ SSH ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. {productname} ຈະຈັດເກັບລາຍລະອຽດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ Salt SSH ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍຜ່ານ roster module [literal]``uyuni``, ຫຼື ໂດຍການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ roster ຊົ່ວຄາວໃນລະຫວ່າງການ bootstrap ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ຜ່ານ {webui}. ທີ່ຕັ້ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ roster ຊົ່ວຄາວຈະຖືກສົ່ງໃຫ້ Salt SSH ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ [option]``roster-file``. ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ, ຕົວເລືອກ [option]``roster`` ທີ່ຕັ້ງເປັນ `uyuni` ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ roster ຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍ `uyuni` salt roster module."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:11
msgid ""
"It is not recommended to run [command]``salt-ssh`` as [literal]``root`` "
"user. This can cause permission issues the next time {productname} tries to "
"use Salt SSH.  Use [command]``mgr-salt-ssh``, which changes the effective "
"user to [literal]``salt`` and avoids file permission issues.  If you want to "
"use [command]``mgr-salt-ssh`` with a user other than [literal]``root``, the "
"user should have the permission to change effective user to "
"[literal]``salt``."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``salt-ssh`` ໃນນາມຜູ້ໃຊ້ [literal]``root``. ເພາະອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາເລື່ອງສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງໃນຄັ້ງຖັດໄປທີ່ {productname} ພະຍາຍາມໃຊ້ Salt SSH. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [command]``mgr-salt-ssh`` ແທນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະປ່ຽນຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງເປັນ [literal]``salt`` ແລະ ຊ່ວຍຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາເລື່ອງສິດຂອງໄຟລ໌. ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ [command]``mgr-salt-ssh`` ດ້ວຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [literal]``root``, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນັ້ນຕ້ອງມີສິດໃນການປ່ຽນຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງເປັນ [literal]``salt``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:12
msgid ""
"[command]``mgr-salt-ssh`` uses [option]``roster`` set to [literal]``uyuni`` "
"by default, if neither [option]``roster`` nor [option]``roster-file`` "
"specified in the command line.  It helps to call Salt commands to the "
"registered Salt SSH clients with no roster file generation."
msgstr "[command]``mgr-salt-ssh`` ໃຊ້ [option]``roster`` ທີ່ຕັ້ງເປັນ [literal]``uyuni`` ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຫາກບໍ່ມີການລະບຸ [option]``roster`` ຫຼື [option]``roster-file`` ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃນການຮຽກໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ roster ໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "ການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນ (Authentication)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Salt SSH supports both password and key authentication.  {productname} uses "
"both methods:"
msgstr "Salt SSH ຮອງຮັບທັງການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ ແລະ ດ້ວຍຄູ່ລະຫັດ (key). {productname} ໃຊ້ທັງສອງວິທີຄື:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Password authentication is used only when bootstrapping.  During the "
"bootstrap step the key of the server is not authorized on the client and "
"therefore a password must be used for a connection to be made.  The password "
"is used transiently in a temporary roster file used for bootstrapping and "
"the roster file is removed on finishing processing the event.  This password "
"is not stored."
msgstr "ການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນລະຫວ່າງການ bootstrapping ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນ bootstrap, ຄູ່ລະຫັດຂອງເຊີເວີຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານເພື່ອສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. ລະຫັດຜ່ານນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ພຽງຊົ່ວຄາວໃນໄຟລ໌ roster ຊົ່ວຄາວສຳລັບການ bootstrap ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ roster ຈະຖືກລົບອອກເມື່ອຂະບວນການສຳເລັດ. ລະຫັດຜ່ານນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຈັດເກັບໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:16
msgid ""
"All other common Salt calls use key authentication.  During the bootstrap "
"step the SSH key of the server is authorized on the client and added to the "
"client [path]``/.ssh/authorized_keys`` file.  Subsequent calls no longer "
"require a password."
msgstr "ການຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt ທົ່ວໄປອື່ນໆທັງໝົດຈະໃຊ້ການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍຄູ່ລະຫັດ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນ bootstrap, ລະຫັດ SSH ຂອງເຊີເວີຈະໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``/.ssh/authorized_keys`` ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ການຮຽກໃຊ້ໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໆໄປກໍຈະບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານອີກ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Account"
msgstr "ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:18
msgid ""
"The user for Salt SSH calls made by {productname} is taken from the "
"`ssh_push_sudo_user` setting.  By default, the user is root."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt SSH ໂດຍ {productname} ແມ່ນເອົາມາຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `ssh_push_sudo_user`. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແມ່ນ root."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If bootstrapping with default settings fail, check whether the client allows "
"root login with ssh."
msgstr "ຫາກການ bootstrap ດ້ວຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ root ລັອກອິນຜ່ານ ssh ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:20
msgid ""
"If the value of `ssh_push_sudo_user` is not root, then the `--sudo` options "
"of `salt-ssh` are used.  For this user you must configure the `NOPASSWD` "
"option in the [path]``sudoers`` file.  At least, set the python binary with "
"the version number; for example:"
msgstr "ຫາກຄ່າຂອງ `ssh_push_sudo_user` ບໍ່ແມ່ນ root, ຕົວເລືອກ `--sudo` ຂອງ `salt-ssh` ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້. ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກ `NOPASSWD` ໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``sudoers``. ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີຂອງ python ພ້ອມໝາຍເລກເວີຊັນ; ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "<USER> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:/usr/bin/python3.6\n"
msgstr "<USER> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:/usr/bin/python3.6\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "HTTP Redirection"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງ HTTP (HTTP Redirection)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The `ssh-push-tunnel` method requires traffic to be redirected through an "
"SSH tunnel.  This allows traffic to bypass firewalls blocking a direct "
"connection between the client and the server."
msgstr "ວິທີ `ssh-push-tunnel` ຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ມີການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຂໍ້ມູນຜ່ານທໍ່ SSH. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນສາມາດຜ່ານໄຟວໍທີ່ປິດກັ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງລະຫວ່າງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ເຊີເວີໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:24
msgid "This is achieved by using port 1233 in the repository URL:"
msgstr "ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ພອດ 1233 ໃນ URL ຂອງຄັງຊອບແວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://suma-server:1233/repourl...\n"
msgstr "https://suma-server:1233/repourl...\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:26
msgid ""
"You can alias the suma-server hostname to [literal]``localhost`` in "
"[path]``/etc/hosts``:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຊື່ແຝງ (alias) ໃຫ້ກັບໂຮສ suma-server ເປັນ [literal]``localhost`` ໃນ [path]``/etc/hosts``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "127.0.0.1       localhost    suma-server\n"
msgstr "127.0.0.1       localhost    suma-server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The server creates a reverse SSH tunnel that connects `localhost:1233` on "
"the client to `suma-server:443`:"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີຈະສ້າງ reverse SSH tunnel ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ `localhost:1233` ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ໄປຫາ `suma-server:443`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh ... -R 1233:suma-server:443\n"
msgstr "ssh ... -R 1233:suma-server:443\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:30
msgid ""
"This means that the package manager will actually connect to "
"`localhost:1233`, which is then forwarded to `suma-server:443` by the SSH "
"tunnel."
msgstr "ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄປຫາ `localhost:1233` ແທ້ໆ, ເຊິ່ງຈາກນັ້ນຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາ `suma-server:443` ໂດຍທໍ່ SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The package manager can contact the server only if the tunnel is open, which "
"occurs only when the server executes an action on the client."
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດຈະສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທໍ່ SSH ເປີດຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເຊີເວີສັ່ງໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Manual package manager operations that require server connectivity are not "
"possible in this case."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ການຈັດການແພັກເກັດດ້ວຍມືທີ່ຕ້ອງມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Call Sequence"
msgstr "ລຳດັບການຮຽກໃຊ້ (Call Sequence)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:34
msgid "Salt SSH calls run in this sequence:"
msgstr "ການຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt SSH ຈະເຮັດວຽກຕາມລຳດັບດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Set `roster` parameter to `uyuni` for registered clients or prepare the Salt "
"roster on bootstrapping for the call"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີ `roster` ເປັນ `uyuni` ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ ຫຼື ກຽມ Salt roster ໃນລະຫວ່າງການ bootstrap ສຳລັບການຮຽກໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Create remote port forwarding option if the contact method is "
"`ssh-push-tunnel`"
msgstr "ສ້າງຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງຕໍ່ພອດທາງໄກ (remote port forwarding) ຫາກວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແມ່ນ `ssh-push-tunnel`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:37
msgid "Compute the `ProxyCommand` if the client is connected through a proxy"
msgstr "ຄຳນວນ `ProxyCommand` ຫາກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ (proxy)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:38
msgid "Create Roster content"
msgstr "ສ້າງເນື້ອໃນຂອງ Roster"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:39
msgid "Create a temporary roster file (only in case of bootstrapping new client)"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ roster ຊົ່ວຄາວ (ສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີ bootstrap ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:40
msgid "Execute a synchronous `salt-ssh` call using the API"
msgstr "ສັ່ງໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກ `salt-ssh` ແບບຊິງໂຄຣນັດ (synchronous) ໂດຍໃຊ້ API"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:41
msgid "Remove the temporary roster file (only in case of bootstrapping new client)"
msgstr "ລົບໄຟລ໌ roster ຊົ່ວຄາວອອກ (ສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີ bootstrap ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:42
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:80
msgid "The roster content contains:"
msgstr "ເນື້ອໃນຂອງ roster ປະກອບດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:43
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:81
msgid "`hostname`"
msgstr "`hostname`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:44
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:82
msgid "`user`"
msgstr "`user`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:45
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:84
msgid "`port`"
msgstr "`port`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:46
msgid "`remote_port_forwards`: The remote port forwarding SSH option"
msgstr "`remote_port_forwards`: ຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງຕໍ່ພອດ SSH ທາງໄກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:47
msgid "`ssh_options`: Other ssh options:"
msgstr "`ssh_options`: ຕົວເລືອກ ssh ອື່ນໆ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:48
msgid "`ProxyCommand`: If the client connects through a proxy"
msgstr "`ProxyCommand`: ຫາກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:49
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:88
msgid "`timeout`: defaults to 180 seconds"
msgstr "`timeout`: ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 180 ວິນາທີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:50
msgid "`minion_opts`:"
msgstr "`minion_opts`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:51
msgid "`master`: Set to the minion ID if the contact method is `ssh-push-tunnel`"
msgstr "`master`: ຕັ້ງເປັນ minion ID ຫາກວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແມ່ນ `ssh-push-tunnel`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:52
msgid ""
"`ssh_pre_flight`: The path to the shell script executed on the client before "
"running any Salt command"
msgstr "`ssh_pre_flight`: ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາສະຄຣິບທ໌ເຊວ (shell script) ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍ ກ່ອນການລັນຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ໃດໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:53
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:90
msgid ""
"`ssh_pre_flight_args`: The list of arguments to call the pre flight script "
"on the client"
msgstr "`ssh_pre_flight_args`: ລາຍການພາຣາມິເຕີ (arguments) ເພື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບທ໌ pre-flight ຢູ່ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap Sequence"
msgstr "ລຳດັບການບູດສະແຕຣັບ (Bootstrap Sequence)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:55
msgid ""
"This section describes the sequence of events when clients are registered to "
"a Salt master.  While bootstrapping is a type of Salt SSH call, the sequence "
"differs slightly from regular SSH calls."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບລຳດັບເຫດການ ເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍຖືກລົງທະບຽນເຂົ້າກັບ Salt master. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການບູດສະແຕຣັບແມ່ນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Salt SSH ຮູບແບບໜຶ່ງ, ແຕ່ລຳດັບຂັ້ນຕອນຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ SSH ປົກກະຕິເລັກນ້ອຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:56
msgid ""
"Bootstrapping uses Salt SSH for communication between the master and the "
"client.  This happens for both regular and SSH clients."
msgstr "ການບູດສະແຕຣັບໃຊ້ Salt SSH ສຳລັບການສື່ສານລະຫວ່າງ master ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນທັງກັບລູກຂ່າຍແບບປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:57
msgid ""
"For a regular Salt client, generate and pre-authorize the Salt key of the "
"client."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ປົກກະຕິ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ ແລະ ອະນຸມັດຄີ Salt ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:58
msgid ""
"For an SSH client, if a proxy was selected, retrieve the SSH public key of "
"the proxy using the ``mgrutil.chain_ssh_cmd`` runner."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ SSH, ຖ້າຫາກມີການເລືອກພຣັອກຊີ (proxy), ໃຫ້ດຶງເອົາຄີສາທາລະນະ SSH ຂອງພຣັອກຊີ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວລັນ ``mgrutil.chain_ssh_cmd``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:59
msgid ""
"The runner copies the public key of the proxy to the server using SSH.  If "
"needed, it can chain multiple SSH commands to reach the proxy across "
"multiple hops."
msgstr "ຕົວລັນຈະກັອບປີ້ຄີສາທາລະນະຂອງພຣັອກຊີໄປຫາເຊີເວີໂດຍໃຊ້ SSH. ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, ມັນສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄຳສັ່ງ SSH ຫຼາຍຄຳສັ່ງ ເພື່ອເຂົ້າຫາພຣັອກຊີຜ່ານຫຼາຍຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (multiple hops)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:60
msgid "Generate pillar data for bootstrap."
msgstr "ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ສຳລັບການບູດສະແຕຣັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:61
msgid ""
"The pillar data is compiled and stored on the Salt master, and retrieved by "
"the client."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນ ແລະ ເກັບໄວ້ຢູ່ເທິງ Salt master, ແລະ ຖືກດຶງໄປໃຊ້ໂດຍລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:62
msgid "Generate the roster for bootstrapping into a temporary file on the client."
msgstr "ສ້າງບັນຊີລາຍຊື່ (roster) ສຳລັບການບູດສະແຕຣັບ ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວຢູ່ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:63
msgid "You can use the roster by passing it to the Salt API, with this command:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ roster ໄດ້ໂດຍການສົ່ງມັນໄປຫາ Salt API ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-salt-ssh --roster-file=<temporary_bootstrap_roster> minion state.apply "
"certs,<bootstrap_state>`\n"
msgstr "mgr-salt-ssh --roster-file=<temporary_bootstrap_roster> minion state.apply certs,<bootstrap_state>`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:65
msgid ""
"For `bootstrap_state`, use `bootstrap` for regular clients or "
"`ssh_bootstrap` for SSH clients."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ `bootstrap_state`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `bootstrap` ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍປົກກະຕິ ຫຼື `ssh_bootstrap` ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:66
msgid ""
"The way the client retrieves the pillar data depends on the contact method "
"you have chosen for your client:"
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ (contact method) ທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກໄວ້ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:67
msgid ""
"If you are using the `ssh-push-tunnel` contact method, ensure you have "
"completed the remote port forwarding option."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ `ssh-push-tunnel`, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງຕໍ່ພອດທາງໄກ (remote port forwarding) ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:68
msgid ""
"If the client connects through a proxy, ensure you have completed the "
"`ProxyCommand` option."
msgstr "ຖ້າລູກຂ່າຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກ `ProxyCommand` ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:69
msgid ""
"This depends on your proxy configuration, including how many proxies you "
"need to connect through."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມທັງຈຳນວນພຣັອກຊີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:70
msgid "Pillar data contains:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ Pillar ປະກອບມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:71
msgid "mgr_server: The hostname of the Salt master"
msgstr "mgr_server: ຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname) ຂອງ Salt master"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:72
msgid "mgr_origin_server: The hostname of the {productname} Server"
msgstr "mgr_origin_server: ຊື່ໂຮສ ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:73
msgid "minion_id: The hostname of the client to bootstrap"
msgstr "minion_id: ຊື່ໂຮສ ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະບູດສະແຕຣັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:74
msgid "contact_method: The connection type"
msgstr "contact_method: ຮູບແບບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:75
msgid "mgr_sudo_user: The user for `salt-ssh`"
msgstr "mgr_sudo_user: ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ `salt-ssh`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:76
msgid "activation_key: If selected"
msgstr "activation_key: ຖ້າມີການເລືອກໄວ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:77
msgid "minion_pub: The pre-authorized public client key"
msgstr "minion_pub: ຄີສາທາລະນະຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸມັດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:78
msgid "minion_pem: The pre-authorized private client key"
msgstr "minion_pem: ຄີສ່ວນຕົວຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸມັດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:79
msgid ""
"proxy_pub_key: The public SSH key that was retrieved from the proxy if the "
"target is an SSH client and a proxy was selected"
msgstr "proxy_pub_key: ຄີສາທາລະນະ SSH ທີ່ດຶງມາຈາກພຣັອກຊີ ຖ້າຫາກເປົ້າໝາຍແມ່ນລູກຂ່າຍ SSH ແລະ ມີການເລືອກພຣັອກຊີໄວ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:85
msgid "`remote_port_forwards`: the remote port forwarding SSH option"
msgstr "`remote_port_forwards`: ຕົວເລືອກ SSH ສຳລັບການສົ່ງຕໍ່ພອດທາງໄກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:86
msgid "`ssh_options`: other SSH options:"
msgstr "`ssh_options`: ຕົວເລືອກ SSH ອື່ນໆ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:87
msgid "`ProxyCommand` if the client connects through a proxy"
msgstr "`ProxyCommand` ຖ້າລູກຂ່າຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:89
msgid ""
"`ssh_pre_flight`: The path to the pre flight shell script (default: "
"[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/salt-ssh/preflight.sh``)"
msgstr "`ssh_pre_flight`: ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາສະຄຣິບທ໌ pre-flight shell (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: [path]``/usr/share/susemanager/salt-ssh/preflight.sh``)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:91
msgid "This image provides an overview of the Salt SSH bootstrap process."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນພາບລວມຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນການບູດສະແຕຣັບ Salt SSH."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt SSH Bootstrap Process"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການບູດສະແຕຣັບ Salt SSH"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-bootstrap-process.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-bootstrap-process.png"

#.  This image needs some exposition, at the very least. --LKB 2020-06-16
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy Support"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:95
msgid ""
"Salt SSH works with {productname} Proxy by chaining the SSH connection from "
"one server or proxy to the next.  This is also known as a multi-hop or "
"multi-gateway SSH connection."
msgstr "Salt SSH ເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ {productname} Proxy ໂດຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຈາກເຊີເວີ ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີໜຶ່ງໄປຫາອີກບ່ອນໜຶ່ງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ແບບຫຼາຍຈຸດ (multi-hop) ຫຼື ຫຼາຍເກດເວ (multi-gateway)."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-proxy-multi-hop.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-proxy-multi-hop.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:97
msgid ""
"{productname} uses `ProxyCommand` to redirect SSH connections through "
"proxies.  This options invokes an arbitrary command that is expected to "
"connect to the SSH port on the target host.  The SSH process uses standard "
"input and output of the command to communicate with the remote SSH daemon."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ `ProxyCommand` ເພື່ອປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງໃດໜຶ່ງເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາພອດ SSH ຢູ່ເທິງໂຮສເປົ້າໝາຍ. ຂະບວນການ SSH ຈະໃຊ້ standard input ແລະ output ຂອງຄຳສັ່ງເພື່ອສື່ສານກັບ SSH daemon ທາງໄກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:98
msgid ""
"`ProxyCommand` replaces a TCP/IP connection.  It does not perform any "
"authorization or encryption.  Its role is simply to create a byte stream to "
"the remote SSH daemon port."
msgstr "`ProxyCommand` ຈະເຂົ້າມາແທນທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP/IP. ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ກວດສອບສິດ ຫຼື ເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃດໆ. ບົດບາດຂອງມັນແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ສ້າງ byte stream ໄປຫາພອດ SSH daemon ທາງໄກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:99
msgid ""
"This image depicts a client connecting to a server that is behind a "
"gateway.  In this example `netcat` is used to pipe port 22 of the target "
"host into the SSH standard input/output:"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບນີ້ສະແດງເຖິງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີທີ່ຢູ່ທາງຫຼັງເກດເວ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ `netcat` ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພອດ 22 ຂອງໂຮສເປົ້າໝາຍເຂົ້າກັບ standard input/output ຂອງ SSH:"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-proxycommand.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-proxycommand.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:101
msgid "The Salt SSH calls run in this sequence when a proxy is in use:"
msgstr "ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Salt SSH ຈະເຮັດວຽກຕາມລຳດັບນີ້ ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ພຣັອກຊີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:102
msgid "{productname} initiates the SSH connection."
msgstr "{productname} ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:103
msgid ""
"`ProxyCommand` uses SSH to create a connection from the server to the client "
"through the proxies."
msgstr "`ProxyCommand` ໃຊ້ SSH ເພື່ອສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກເຊີເວີໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:104
msgid "This example uses `ProxyCommand` with two proxies and the `ssh-push` method:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ໃຊ້ `ProxyCommand` ກັບພຣັອກຊີສອງໂຕ ແລະ ວິທີການແບບ `ssh-push`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:105
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Connect the server to the first proxy:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id -o "
"StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o User=mgrsshtunnel  proxy1\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຊີເວີຫາພຣັອກຊີໂຕທຳອິດ:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o User=mgrsshtunnel  proxy1\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Connect the first proxy to the second, and forward standard input/output "
"on the client to client:22 using the `-W` option:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /var/lib/spacewalk/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push "
"-o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o User=mgrsshtunnel -W client:22  proxy2\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພຣັອກຊີໂຕທຳອິດຫາໂຕທີສອງ, ແລະ ສົ່ງຕໍ່ standard input/output ຢູ່ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍໄປຫາ client:22 ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ `-W`:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /var/lib/spacewalk/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o User=mgrsshtunnel -W client:22  proxy2\n"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-push-push-plain-sequence.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-push-push-plain-sequence.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:108
msgid ""
"This example uses `ProxyCommand` with two proxies and the `ssh-push-tunnel` "
"method:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ໃຊ້ `ProxyCommand` ກັບພຣັອກຊີສອງໂຕ ແລະ ວິທີການແບບ `ssh-push-tunnel`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:109
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Connect the server to the first proxy:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id -o "
"User=mgrsshtunnel  proxy1\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຊີເວີຫາພຣັອກຊີໂຕທຳອິດ:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id -o User=mgrsshtunnel  proxy1\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:110
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Connect the first proxy to the second:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /home/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push -o "
"User=mgrsshtunnel  proxy2\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພຣັອກຊີໂຕທຳອິດຫາໂຕທີສອງ:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /home/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push -o User=mgrsshtunnel  proxy2\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Connect the second proxy to the client and open an reverse tunnel (-R "
"1233:proxy2:443) from the client to the HTTPS port on the second proxy:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /home/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push -o User=root "
"-R 1233:proxy2:443 client\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພຣັອກຊີໂຕທີສອງຫາລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ເປີດ reverse tunnel (-R 1233:proxy2:443) ຈາກລູກຂ່າຍໄປຫາພອດ HTTPS ຢູ່ເທິງພຣັອກຊີໂຕທີສອງ:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /home/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push -o User=root -R 1233:proxy2:443 client\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:112
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Connect the client to itself and forward the standard input/output of the "
"server to the SSH port of the client (-W client:22).\n"
"This is equivalent to `ssh ... proxy2 netcat client 22`` and is needed "
"because SSH does not allow both the reverse tunnel (-R 1233:proxy2:443) and "
"the standard input/output forward (-W client:22) in the same command.\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /root/.ssh/mgr_own_id -W client:22 -o User=root client\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າຫາຕົວມັນເອງ ແລະ ສົ່ງຕໍ່ standard input/output ຂອງເຊີເວີໄປຫາພອດ SSH ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ (-W client:22).\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເທົ່າກັບ `ssh ... proxy2 netcat client 22` ແລະ ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດຍ້ອນວ່າ SSH ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ທັງ reverse tunnel (-R 1233:proxy2:443) ແລະ standard input/output forward (-W client:22) ໃນຄຳສັ່ງດຽວກັນ.\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /root/.ssh/mgr_own_id -W client:22 -o User=root client\n"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-push-push-tunnel-sequence.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-push-push-tunnel-sequence.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users and SSH Key Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ SSH Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:115
msgid ""
"To connect to a proxy, the parent server or proxy uses a specific user "
"called `mgrsshtunnel`.  When `mgrsshtunnel` connects, the SSH configuration "
"of the proxy will force the execution of "
"``/usr/sbin/mgr-proxy-ssh-force-cmd``.  This is a simple shell script that "
"allows only the execution of `scp`, `ssh`, or `cat` commands."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາພຣັອກຊີ, ເຊີເວີແມ່ ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີແມ່ຈະໃຊ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ `mgrsshtunnel`. ເມື່ອ `mgrsshtunnel` ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH ຂອງພຣັອກຊີຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ລັນ ``/usr/sbin/mgr-proxy-ssh-force-cmd``. ນີ້ແມ່ນສະຄຣິບທ໌ເຊວແບບງ່າຍໆ ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລັນສະເພາະຄຳສັ່ງ `scp`, `ssh`, ຫຼື `cat` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:116
msgid ""
"The connection to the proxy or client is authorized using SSH keys in this "
"sequence:"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາພຣັອກຊີ ຫຼື ລູກຂ່າຍ ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ SSH keys ຕາມລຳດັບນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:117
msgid ""
"The server connects to the client and to the first proxy using the key in "
"``/srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id`."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຫາພຣັອກຊີໂຕທຳອິດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄີທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ ``/srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:118
msgid ""
"Each proxy has its own key pair in "
"``/home/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push`."
msgstr "ພຣັອກຊີແຕ່ລະໂຕຈະມີຄູ່ຄີ (key pair) ຂອງຕົນເອງໃນ ``/home/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:119
msgid "Each proxy authorizes the key of the parent proxy or server."
msgstr "ພຣັອກຊີແຕ່ລະໂຕຈະອະນຸມັດຄີຂອງພຣັອກຊີແມ່ ຫຼື ເຊີເວີແມ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:120
msgid "The client authorizes its own key."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍອະນຸມັດຄີຂອງມັນເອງ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:121
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-push-ssh-keys.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-push-ssh-keys.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:122
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repository Access with a Proxy"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງຊອບແວ (Repository) ດ້ວຍພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:123
msgid ""
"When {productname} connects to a repository using a proxy, it can use either "
"`ssh-push` or `ssh-push-tunnel`."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ {productname} ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາຄັງຊອບແວໂດຍໃຊ້ພຣັອກຊີ, ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງແບບ `ssh-push` ຫຼື `ssh-push-tunnel`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:124
msgid ""
"In both methods the client connects to the proxy to retrieve package and "
"repository information."
msgstr "ໃນທັງສອງວິທີ, ລູກຂ່າຍຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາພຣັອກຊີເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນແພັກເກດ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:125
msgid ""
"In the `ssh-push` method, the package manager connects directly to the proxy "
"using HTTP or HTTPS.  This works in cases where there is no firewall between "
"the client and the proxy that blocks HTTP connections initiated by the "
"client."
msgstr "ໃນວິທີແບບ `ssh-push`, ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກດຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງຫາພຣັອກຊີ ໂດຍໃຊ້ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ມີຟາຍວໍ (firewall) ລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ ທີ່ບລັອກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-push-repo-access.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-push-repo-access.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:127
msgid ""
"In the `ssh-push-tunnel` method, the HTTP connection to the proxy is "
"redirected through a reverse SSH tunnel."
msgstr "ໃນວິທີແບບ `ssh-push-tunnel`, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ໄປຫາພຣັອກຊີ ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຜ່ານ reverse SSH tunnel."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-push-tunnel-repo-access.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-push-tunnel-repo-access.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:129
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:130
msgid ""
"When the `spacewalk-proxy` package is installed on the proxy, the "
"`mgrsshtunnel` user is created."
msgstr "ເມື່ອແພັກເກດ `spacewalk-proxy` ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນພຣັອກຊີ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ `mgrsshtunnel` ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:131
msgid ""
"The initial configuration with ``configure-proxy.sh`` occurs using this "
"sequence:"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ ``configure-proxy.sh`` ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຕາມລຳດັບນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:132
msgid "An SSH key pair is generated, or an existing keypair is imported."
msgstr "ຄູ່ຄີ SSH ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ຫຼື ນຳເຂົ້າຄູ່ຄີທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:133
msgid ""
"The SSH key of the parent server or proxy is retrieved to authorize it on "
"the proxy."
msgstr "ຄີ SSH ຂອງເຊີເວີແມ່ ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີແມ່ ຈະຖືກດຶງມາເພື່ອອະນຸມັດມັນຢູ່ເທິງພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:134
msgid ""
"The ``ssh`` daemon on the proxy is configured to restrict the "
"``mgrsshtunnel`` user."
msgstr "SSH daemon ຢູ່ເທິງພຣັອກຊີ ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອຈຳກັດສິດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``mgrsshtunnel``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:135
msgid ""
"This is done by the ``mgr-proxy-ssh-push-init`` script, which is called from "
"``configure-proxy.sh``.  It does not have to be manually invoked."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກເຮັດໂດຍສະຄຣິບທ໌ ``mgr-proxy-ssh-push-init``, ຊຶ່ງຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈາກ ``configure-proxy.sh``. ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:136
msgid ""
"The parent key is retrieved by calling an HTTPS endpoint on the parent "
"server or proxy.  The first endpoint tried is "
"**+https://$PARENT/pub/id_susemanager_ssh_push.pub+**.  If the parent is a "
"proxy then this will return the public SSH key of the proxy."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:137
msgid ""
"If a 404 error is received from that endpoint, then the parent is assumed to "
"be a server not a proxy, and "
"**+https://$PARENT/rhn/manager/download/saltssh/pubkey+** is tried instead."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:138
msgid ""
"If an SSH key exists at ``/srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id.pub`` on "
"the server it is returned."
msgstr "ຖ້າມີຄີ SSH ຢູ່ທີ່ ``/srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id.pub`` ເທິງເຊີເວີ, ມັນຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:139
msgid ""
"If the public key does not exist because ``salt-ssh`` has not been invoked "
"yet, a key will be generates by calling the ``mgrutil.ssh_keygen`` runner."
msgstr "ຖ້າຄີສາທາລະນະຍັງບໍ່ມີ ຍ້ອນວ່າ ``salt-ssh`` ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້, ຄີຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຕົວລັນ ``mgrutil.ssh_keygen``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:140
msgid ""
"Salt SSH generates a keypair the first time it is invoked with "
"``/srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id``.  The sequence in this section "
"is needed if a proxy is configured before Salt SSH was invoked for the first "
"time."
msgstr "Salt SSH ຈະສ້າງຄູ່ຄີໃນຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ມັນຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ ``/srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id``. ຂັ້ນຕອນໃນພາກສ່ວນນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນ ຖ້າຫາກພຣັອກຊີຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ ກ່ອນທີ່ Salt SSH ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:141
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rotate SSH keys"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນ (Rotate) SSH keys"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:142
msgid ""
"The SSH key is used on [literal]``salt-ssh`` managed systems.  Additionally, "
"it is used on {productname} Proxies for the user "
"[systemitem]``mgrsshtunnel``.  Normal systems managed with the {salt} "
"[literal]``default`` method are not affected and do not have this key "
"configured."
msgstr "ຄີ SSH ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນລະບົບທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍ [literal]``salt-ssh``. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ມັນຍັງຖືກໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} Proxies ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``mgrsshtunnel``. ລະບົບປົກກະຕິທີ່ຈັດການດ້ວຍວິທີ [literal]``default`` ຂອງ {salt} ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄີນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:143
msgid ""
"Environments without SSH managed systems may not have the key at all.  "
"Traditionally managed systems with SSH push are not affected and the key "
"cannot be rotated by this mechanism."
msgstr "ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ບໍ່ມີລະບົບຈັດການຜ່ານ SSH ອາດຈະບໍ່ມີຄີນີ້ເລີຍ. ລະບົບທີ່ຈັດການແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (traditionally managed) ດ້ວຍ SSH push ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ແລະ ຄີບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກປ່ຽນໄດ້ດ້ວຍກົນໄກນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Rotating SSH keys"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນ (Rotating) SSH keys"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:145
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, as user [systemitem]``root``, change to user "
"[systemitem]``salt``:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃນນາມຜູ້ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``root``, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``salt``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:146
#, no-wrap
msgid "su -s /bin/bash - salt\n"
msgstr "su -s /bin/bash - salt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:147
msgid "Create a new SSH key:"
msgstr "ສ້າງ SSH key ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:148
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh-keygen -N \"\" -t rsa -q -f /var/lib/salt/.ssh/new_mgr_ssh_id\n"
msgstr "ssh-keygen -N \"\" -t rsa -q -f /var/lib/salt/.ssh/new_mgr_ssh_id\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:149
msgid ""
"Copy the public key into the {salt} filesystem to make it usable in a {salt} "
"state:"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ຄີສາທາລະນະເຂົ້າໄປໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງ {salt} ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນ {salt} state ໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:150
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp /var/lib/salt/.ssh/new_mgr_ssh_id.pub /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/\n"
msgstr "cp /var/lib/salt/.ssh/new_mgr_ssh_id.pub /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:151
msgid "Change back to user [systemitem]``root`` again:"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນກັບໄປເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``root`` ອີກຄັ້ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:152
#, no-wrap
msgid "exit\n"
msgstr "exit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:153
msgid ""
"Rollout the new key to all systems that need it.  Applying the "
"[literal]``util.mgr_rotate_saltssh_key`` state will limit the changes to "
"[literal]``salt-ssh`` managed systems and proxies:"
msgstr "ກະຈາຍຄີໃໝ່ໄປຫາທຸກລະບົບທີ່ຈຳເປັນ. ການໃຊ້ state [literal]``util.mgr_rotate_saltssh_key`` ຈະຈຳກັດການປ່ຽນແປງສະເພາະລະບົບທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍ [literal]``salt-ssh`` ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:154
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:159
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"salt '*' state.apply util.mgr_rotate_saltssh_key\n"
"mgr-salt-ssh '*' state.apply util.mgr_rotate_saltssh_key\n"
msgstr ""
"salt '*' state.apply util.mgr_rotate_saltssh_key\n"
"mgr-salt-ssh '*' state.apply util.mgr_rotate_saltssh_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:155
msgid ""
"Move the old key away and make the new key the standard key.  Rename "
"[literal]``mgr_ssh_id`` key to [literal]``disabled_mgr_ssh_id`` and "
"[literal]``new_mgr_ssh_id`` key to [literal]``mgr_ssh_id`` in the SSH "
"keystore of the user [systemitem]``salt`` as well as in the {salt} "
"filesystem for the public keys:"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍຄີເກົ່າອອກ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄີໃໝ່ເປັນຄີມາດຕະຖານ. ປ່ຽນຊື່ຄີ [literal]``mgr_ssh_id`` ເປັນ [literal]``disabled_mgr_ssh_id`` ແລະ ປ່ຽນຊື່ຄີ [literal]``new_mgr_ssh_id`` ເປັນ [literal]``mgr_ssh_id`` ໃນ SSH keystore ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``salt`` ລວມທັງໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ {salt} ສຳລັບຄີສາທາລະນະ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:156
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"su -s /bin/bash - salt\n"
"cd .ssh\n"
"mv mgr_ssh_id disabled_mgr_ssh_id\n"
"mv mgr_ssh_id.pub disabled_mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"
"mv new_mgr_ssh_id mgr_ssh_id\n"
"mv new_mgr_ssh_id.pub mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"
"cd /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/\n"
"mv mgr_ssh_id.pub disabled_mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"
"mv new_mgr_ssh_id.pub mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"
msgstr ""
"su -s /bin/bash - salt\n"
"cd .ssh\n"
"mv mgr_ssh_id disabled_mgr_ssh_id\n"
"mv mgr_ssh_id.pub disabled_mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"
"mv new_mgr_ssh_id mgr_ssh_id\n"
"mv new_mgr_ssh_id.pub mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"
"cd /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/\n"
"mv mgr_ssh_id.pub disabled_mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"
"mv new_mgr_ssh_id.pub mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:157
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: When containerized proxies exist, re-create the configuration to "
"get the new SSH key into the proxy configuration.  Restart the containers "
"with the new configuration.  It is also possible to change the existing "
"configuration on the podman host ([literal]``ssh.yaml``).  Change the value "
"of [literal]``server_ssh_key_pub`` with the content of the current "
"[literal]``mgr_ssh_id.pub``."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເມື່ອມີ containerized proxies, ໃຫ້ສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ເພື່ອເອົາ SSH key ໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໄປໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີ. ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ container ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່. ນອກນັ້ນຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຢູ່ເທິງ podman host ([literal]``ssh.yaml``). ປ່ຽນຄ່າຂອງ [literal]``server_ssh_key_pub`` ດ້ວຍເນື້ອໃນຂອງ [literal]``mgr_ssh_id.pub`` ປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:158
msgid ""
"To remove the disabled keys from the [path]``authorized_keys` files of the "
"[literal]``salt-ssh`` managed systems and the proxies, apply the state a "
"second time:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອລຶບຄີທີ່ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ [path]``authorized_keys`` ຂອງລະບົບທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍ [literal]``salt-ssh`` ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ state ເປັນຄັ້ງທີສອງ:"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt States and Pillars"
msgstr "Salt States ແລະ Pillars"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:2
msgid ""
"States are configuration templates.  They allow you to describe what each of "
"your systems should look like, including the applications and services that "
"are installed and running.  Salt state files are referred to as SLS (SaLt "
"State) files."
msgstr "States ແມ່ນແມ່ແບບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (configuration templates). ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານອະທິບາຍວ່າແຕ່ລະລະບົບຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະເປັນແນວໃດ, ລວມທັງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ແລະ ບໍລິການຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ໄຟລ໌ Salt state ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າໄຟລ໌ SLS (SaLt State)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:3
msgid ""
"States are applied to the target systems by matching relevant state data to "
"clients.  The state data comes from {productname} in the form of package and "
"custom states."
msgstr "States ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບລະບົບເປົ້າໝາຍໂດຍການຈັບຄູ່ຂໍ້ມູນ state ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບລູກຂ່າຍ. ຂໍ້ມູນ state ມາຈາກ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງແພັກເກດ ແລະ custom states."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can target clients at three specific levels of hierarchy and priority: "
"individual clients, system groups, and organization.  Individual clients "
"have priority over groups, and groups have priority over the organization."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ໃນສາມລະດັບ ແລະ ບຸລິມະສິດ: ລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະໂຕ, ກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ແລະ ອົງກອນ. ລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະໂຕຈະມີບຸລິມະສິດສູງກວ່າກຸ່ມ, ແລະ ກຸ່ມຈະມີບຸລິມະສິດສູງກວ່າອົງກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:6
msgid "The Organization requires that version 1 is installed."
msgstr "ອົງກອນຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງເວີຊັນ 1."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:7
msgid "All clients are part of the same Organization."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນອົງກອນດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:8
msgid "Group A requires that version 2 is installed."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມ A ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງເວີຊັນ 2."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:9
msgid "Client1, Client2, and Client3 are part of Group A."
msgstr "Client1, Client2, ແລະ Client3 ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມ A."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:10
msgid "Group B requires any version installed."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມ B ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງເວີຊັນໃດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:11
msgid "Client4 is part of Group B."
msgstr "Client4 ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມ B."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:12
msgid "Leading to these possible scenarios:"
msgstr "ນຳໄປສູ່ສະຖານະການເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:13
msgid "Client1 wants package removed, package is removed (Client Level)"
msgstr "Client1 ຕ້ອງການລຶບແພັກເກດ, ແພັກເກດຈະຖືກລຶບ (ລະດັບລູກຂ່າຍ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:14
msgid "Client2 wants version 2, gets version 2 (Client Level)"
msgstr "Client2 ຕ້ອງການເວີຊັນ 2, ກໍຈະໄດ້ເວີຊັນ 2 (ລະດັບລູກຂ່າຍ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:15
msgid "Client3 wants any version, gets version 2 (Group Level)"
msgstr "Client3 ຕ້ອງການເວີຊັນໃດກໍໄດ້, ກໍຈະໄດ້ເວີຊັນ 2 (ລະດັບກຸ່ມ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:16
msgid "Client4 wants any version, gets version 1 (Organization Level)"
msgstr "Client4 ຕ້ອງການເວີຊັນໃດກໍໄດ້, ກໍຈະໄດ້ເວີຊັນ 1 (ລະດັບອົງກອນ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information on Salt states, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/states/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt states, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/states/."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:18
msgid ""
"You can create custom Salt states with {productname}.  For more information, "
"see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-custom-states.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ custom Salt states ດ້ວຍ {productname}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-custom-states.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Group States"
msgstr "Group States"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Pillar data can be used to perform bulk actions, like applying all assigned "
"states to clients within the group.  This section contains some examples of "
"bulk actions that you can take using group states."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ Pillar ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກແບບກຸ່ມ (bulk actions) ໄດ້, ເຊັ່ນ: ການໃຊ້ທຸກ states ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍພາຍໃນກຸ່ມ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ມີຕົວຢ່າງບາງຢ່າງຂອງການເຮັດວຽກແບບກຸ່ມ ໂດຍໃຊ້ group states."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To perform these actions, you will need to determine the ID of the group "
"that you want to manipulate.  You can determine the Group ID by using the "
"[command]``spacecmd`` command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຮູ້ ID ຂອງກຸ່ມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການ. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງ Group ID ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacecmd``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd group_details\n"
msgstr "spacecmd group_details\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:23
msgid "These examples use an example Group ID of [systemitem]``GID``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ Group ID ສົມມຸດແມ່ນ [systemitem]``GID``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:24
msgid "To apply all states assigned to the group:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ທຸກ states ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -I 'group_ids:GID' state.apply custom.group_GID\n"
msgstr "salt -I 'group_ids:GID' state.apply custom.group_GID\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:26
msgid "To apply any state (whether or not it is assigned to the group):"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ state ໃດໜຶ່ງ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກຸ່ມຫຼືບໍ່):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -I 'group_ids:GID' state.apply ``state``\n"
msgstr "salt -I 'group_ids:GID' state.apply ``state``\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:28
msgid "To apply a custom state:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ custom state:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -I 'group_ids:2130' state.apply manager_org_1.``customstate``\n"
msgstr "salt -I 'group_ids:2130' state.apply manager_org_1.``customstate``\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:30
msgid "Apply the highstate to all clients in the group:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ highstate ກັບລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດໃນກຸ່ມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -I 'group_ids:GID' state.apply\n"
msgstr "salt -I 'group_ids:GID' state.apply\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Pillars"
msgstr "Salt Pillars"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:33
msgid ""
"{productname} exposes a small amount of internal data as pillars which can "
"be used with custom states.  Pillars are created on the {productname} "
"Server, and contain information about a client or group of clients.  For "
"custom information in pillars, see "
"xref:client-configuration:custom-info.adoc[].  Pillars are useful for "
"sensitive data, configuration of clients, variables, and any arbitrary data."
msgstr "{productname} ເປີດເຜີຍຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງເປັນ pillars ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ custom states. Pillars ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ແລະ ມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ pillars, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:custom-info.adoc[]. Pillars ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຄັນ (sensitive data), ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ, ຕົວປ່ຽນ (variables), ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Pillars are managed either automatically by {productname}, or manually by "
"the user."
msgstr "Pillars ຖືກຈັດການທັງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍ {productname}, ຫຼື ຈັດການດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:35
msgid ""
"If you change pillar data on the server ({salt} master) the actual pillar "
"data on the client (minion) is updated only after calling "
"[literal]``saltutil.refresh_pillar`` for the client."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ ({salt} master), ຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ຕົວຈິງຢູ່ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍ (minion) ຈະຖືກອັບເດດກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [literal]``saltutil.refresh_pillar`` ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Otherwise it could happen that [literal]``pillar.items`` and "
"[literal]``pillar.get`` calls would produce different results with different "
"values of pillars that were not refreshed."
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ອາດຈະເກີດກໍລະນີທີ່ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [literal]``pillar.items`` ແລະ [literal]``pillar.get`` ໃຫ້ຜົນລັບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ຍ້ອນວ່າຄ່າຂອງ pillars ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກຣີເຟຣຊ (refreshed)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:37
msgid ""
"To avoid hard-coding organization IDs within {sles} files, a pillar entry is "
"added for each organization:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຂຽນ organization IDs ລົງໄປໂດຍກົງ (hard-coding) ໃນໄຟລ໌ {sles}, pillar entry ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະອົງກອນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "org-files-dir: relative_path_to_files\n"
msgstr "org-files-dir: relative_path_to_files\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:39
msgid ""
"The specified file is available for all clients which belong to the "
"organization."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນອົງກອນນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:40
msgid "This is an example of a pillar located at [path]``/etc/motd``:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ pillar ທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ [path]``/etc/motd``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"file.managed:\n"
"    - source: salt://{{ pillar['org-files-dir']}}/motd\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: 644\n"
msgstr ""
"file.managed:\n"
"    - source: salt://{{ pillar['org-files-dir']}}/motd\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: 644\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:42
msgid ""
"For more information on Salt pillars, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/pillar/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt pillars, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/pillar/."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download Endpoint"
msgstr "ຈຸດດາວໂຫຼດ (Download Endpoint)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:44
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} assumes that the download endpoint to use is the "
"FQDN of the {productname} Server or Proxy.  However, there are some cases "
"where you might like to use a different FQDN as the download endpoint.  The "
"most common example is if you need to use load balancing, caching proxies, "
"or in environments with complicated networking requirements."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະຖືວ່າຈຸດດາວໂຫຼດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ແມ່ນ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ມີບາງກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ FQDN ອື່ນເປັນຈຸດດາວໂຫຼດ. ຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍແມ່ນເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ load balancing, caching proxies, ຫຼື ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຄວາມຕ້ອງການເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:45
msgid ""
"To change the package download endpoint, you can manually adjust three Salt "
"pillars:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຈຸດດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດ, ທ່ານສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນສາມ Salt pillars ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:46
msgid ""
"[systemitem]``pkg_download_point_protocol``, defaults to "
"[systemitem]``https``."
msgstr "[systemitem]``pkg_download_point_protocol``, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [systemitem]``https``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:47
msgid ""
"[systemitem]``pkg_download_point_host``, defaults to the FQDN of the "
"{productname} Server (or Proxy, if in use)."
msgstr "[systemitem]``pkg_download_point_host``, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} (ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີ ຖ້າມີການໃຊ້)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:48
msgid "[systemitem]``pkg_download_point_port``, defaults to [systemitem]``443``."
msgstr "[systemitem]``pkg_download_point_port``, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [systemitem]``443``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:49
msgid ""
"If you do not adjust these pillars directly, {productname} will fall back to "
"the default values."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ປັບປ່ຽນ pillars ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໂດຍກົງ, {productname} ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Changing the Package Download Endpoint Pillar"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນ Pillar ສຳລັບຈຸດດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Navigate to [path]``/srv/pillar/`` and create a file called "
"[filename]``top.sls`` with these contents:"
msgstr "ເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ [path]``/srv/pillar/`` ແລະ ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຊື່ [filename]``top.sls`` ທີ່ມີເນື້ອໃນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"base:\n"
"  '*':\n"
"    - pkg_download_points\n"
msgstr ""
"base:\n"
"  '*':\n"
"    - pkg_download_points\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:53
msgid ""
"This example directs Salt to look at the "
"[filename]``pkg_download_points.sls`` file to determine the base URL to "
"use.  You can adjust this file to target different clients or groups, "
"depending on your environment."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ກຳນົດໃຫ້ Salt ໄປເບິ່ງທີ່ໄຟລ໌ [filename]``pkg_download_points.sls`` ເພື່ອກຳນົດ base URL ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນໄຟລ໌ນີ້ເພື່ອເນັ້ນໃສ່ລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Remain in [path]``/srv/pillar/`` and create a file called "
"[filename]``pkg_download_points.sls`` with the base URLs you want to use."
msgstr "ຍັງຄົງຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/srv/pillar/`` ແລະ ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຊື່ [filename]``pkg_download_points.sls`` ພ້ອມກັບ base URLs ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"pkg_download_point_protocol: http\n"
"pkg_download_point_host: example.com\n"
"pkg_download_point_port: 444\n"
msgstr ""
"pkg_download_point_protocol: http\n"
"pkg_download_point_host: example.com\n"
"pkg_download_point_port: 444\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:57
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: If you want to use external pillars, for example Group IDs, open "
"the master configuration file and set the [systemitem]``ext_pillar_first`` "
"parameter to [systemitem]``true``."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ external pillars, ເຊັ່ນ Group IDs, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ master ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``ext_pillar_first`` ເປັນ [systemitem]``true``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:58
msgid "You can then use Group IDs to set conditional values, for example:"
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Group IDs ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂ, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% if pillar['group_ids'] is defined and 8 in pillar['group_ids'] %}\n"
"  pkg_download_point_protocol: http\n"
"  pkg_download_point_host: example.com\n"
"  pkg_download_point_port: 444\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"  pkg_download_point_protocol: ftp\n"
"  pkg_download_point_host: example.com\n"
"  pkg_download_point_port: 445\n"
"{%- endif %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% if pillar['group_ids'] is defined and 8 in pillar['group_ids'] %}\n"
"  pkg_download_point_protocol: http\n"
"  pkg_download_point_host: example.com\n"
"  pkg_download_point_port: 444\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"  pkg_download_point_protocol: ftp\n"
"  pkg_download_point_host: example.com\n"
"  pkg_download_point_port: 445\n"
"{%- endif %}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:60
msgid "OPTIONAL: You can also use grains to set conditional values, for example:"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ grains ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂ, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% if grains['fqdn'] == 'client1.example.com' %}\n"
"    pkg_download_point: example1.com\n"
"{% elif grains['fqdn'] == 'client2.example.com'' %}\n"
"    pkg_download_point: example2.com\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"    pkg_download_point: example.com\n"
"{% endif %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% if grains['fqdn'] == 'client1.example.com' %}\n"
"    pkg_download_point: example1.com\n"
"{% elif grains['fqdn'] == 'client2.example.com'' %}\n"
"    pkg_download_point: example2.com\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"    pkg_download_point: example.com\n"
"{% endif %}\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Terminology"
msgstr "ຄຳສັບສະເພາະ (Terminology)"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Beacon"
msgstr "ບີຄອນ (Beacon)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Beacons allow you to use the Salt event system to monitor non-Salt "
"processes.  Clients can use beacons to connect to various system processes "
"for constant monitoring.  When a monitored activity occurs, an event is sent "
"on the Salt event bus that can then trigger a reactor."
msgstr "Beacons ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ລະບົບເຫດການ (event system) ຂອງ Salt ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມຂະບວນການທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂອງ Salt. ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດໃຊ້ beacons ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຂະບວນການຕ່າງໆ ຂອງລະບົບເພື່ອຕິດຕາມຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ. ເມື່ອກິດຈະກຳທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ເຫດການຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ Salt event bus ຊຶ່ງສາມາດໄປກະຕຸ້ນ reactor ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To use beacons on {sles} Salt clients, install the "
"[package]``python-pyinotify`` package.  For {rhel} systems, install the "
"[package]``python-inotify`` package."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ beacons ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຂອງ {sles}, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``python-pyinotify``. ສຳລັບລະບົບ {rhel}, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``python-inotify``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information on beacons, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/beacons/"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ beacons, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/beacons/"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Broker"
msgstr "ໂບຣກເກີ (Broker)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The Salt broker allows clients to pass commands to each other.  The broker "
"acts like a switch, therefore peer communication will only work for clients "
"on the same network, or connected to the same proxy."
msgstr "Salt broker ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງຫາາກັນໄດ້. Broker ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ຄືກັບສະວິດຊ໌, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການສື່ສານລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍ (peer communication) ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍດຽວກັນ ຫຼື ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາພຣັອກຊີໂຕດຽວກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For more information on Salt and peer communication, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/peer.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt ແລະ ການສື່ສານລະຫວ່າງກຸ່ມ, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/peer.html."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (Environment)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:10
msgid ""
"{productname} implements Salt with a single environment.  Multiple Salt "
"environments are not supported."
msgstr "{productname} ນຳໃຊ້ Salt ດ້ວຍສະພາບແວດລ້ອມດຽວ. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ Salt ຫຼາຍອັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Formulas"
msgstr "ຟໍມູລາ (Formulas)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Formulas are collections of Salt States that contain generic parameter "
"fields.  Formulas are used within {productname} to assist with configuring "
"Salt clients.  Some formulas have extensive configuration options, and use "
"forms to help organize them in the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Formulas ແມ່ນການລວບລວມ Salt States ທີ່ປະກອບມີຊ່ອງໃສ່ພາຣາມິເຕີທົ່ວໄປ. Formulas ຖືກໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ {productname} ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ Salt. ບາງ formulas ມີຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ ແລະ ໃຊ້ forms ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຈັດລະບຽບພວກມັນໃນ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For more information about formulas, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ formulas, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Grains"
msgstr "ເກຣນ (Grains)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Grains provide information about the hardware of a client.  This includes "
"the operating system, IP addresses, network interfaces, and memory.  When "
"you run a Salt command any modules and functions are run locally from the "
"system being called."
msgstr "Grains ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຮາດແວຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ລວມມີລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ທີ່ຢູ່ IP, ອິນເຕີເຟສເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ. ເມື່ອທ່ານລັນຄຳສັ່ງ Salt, ໂມດູນ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆ ຈະຖືກລັນຢູ່ໃນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information on grains, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/grains/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ grains, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/grains/."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Highstate"
msgstr "ໄຮສະເຕດ (Highstate)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:18
msgid ""
"This term is used when you apply all outstanding states to all targeted "
"clients at the same time.  The highstate must be applied when doing changes "
"to systems, including enabling and disabling formulas."
msgstr "ຄຳສັບນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອທ່ານນຳໃຊ້ states ທັງໝົດທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍເປົ້າໝາຍທັງໝົດໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ highstate ເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງລະບົບ, ລວມທັງການເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານ formulas."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key Fingerprints"
msgstr "ຄີຟິງເກີພຣິນ (Key Fingerprints)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Key fingerprints are exchanged between the {productname} Server and Salt "
"clients to verify the identity of the server and the client.  This prevents "
"Salt clients from connecting to the wrong server.  You can see the "
"fingerprints of your Salt clients by navigating to menu:Salt[Keys]."
msgstr "Key fingerprints ຈະຖືກແລກປ່ຽນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ {productname} ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີທີ່ຜິດ. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງ fingerprints ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ໂດຍການເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Salt[Keys]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Master"
msgstr "ມາສເຕີ (Master)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:22
msgid ""
"The Salt master issues commands to its attached clients.  In {productname}, "
"the Salt master must be the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Salt master ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່. ໃນ {productname}, Salt master ຈະຕ້ອງແມ່ນເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minions"
msgstr "ມິນນຽນ (Minions)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Salt clients that are connected to and controlled by the Salt master on the "
"{productname} Server.  In {productname}, these are referred to as Salt "
"clients, in order to clearly differentiate them from traditional clients.  "
"This is a difference in terminology only."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ Salt master ຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}. ໃນ {productname}, ພວກມັນຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທາງດ້ານຄຳສັບເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Modules"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ (Modules)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Functions within Salt are stored in modules.  Salt modules are stored on "
"clients and the {productname} Server within the "
"[path]``/usr/lib/python*/site-packages/salt/`` directory.  There are many "
"types of Salt modules, including state and execution modules.  You can write "
"your own Salt modules using Python."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆ ພາຍໃນ Salt ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໂມດູນ. ໂມດູນ Salt ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ {productname} ພາຍໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/usr/lib/python*/site-packages/salt/``. ມີໂມດູນ Salt ຫຼາຍປະເພດ, ລວມທັງໂມດູນ state ແລະ execution. ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນໂມດູນ Salt ຂອງທ່ານເອງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ Python."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For a complete list of available Salt modules, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/index.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ທັງໝົດຂອງໂມດູນ Salt ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/index.html."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pillars"
msgstr "ພິລລາ (Pillars)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Pillars are created on the {productname} Server.  They contain information "
"about a client or group of clients.  Pillars allow you to send confidential "
"information to a targeted client or group of clients.  Pillars are useful "
"for sensitive data, configuration of clients, variables, and any arbitrary "
"data."
msgstr "Pillars ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}. ພວກມັນມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. Pillars ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເປັນຄວາມລັບໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມເປົ້າໝາຍໄດ້. Pillars ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຄັນ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ, ຕົວປ່ຽນ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For more information on pillars, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/pillar.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ pillars, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/pillar.html."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "States"
msgstr "ສະເຕດ (States)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:32
msgid ""
"States are configuration templates.  They allow you to describe what each of "
"your systems should look like, including the applications and services that "
"are installed and running.  States are applied to the target client.  This "
"automates the process of bringing a large number of systems into a known "
"state, and then maintaining them."
msgstr "States ແມ່ນແມ່ແບບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານອະທິບາຍວ່າແຕ່ລະລະບົບຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະເປັນແນວໃດ, ລວມທັງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ແລະ ບໍລິການທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. States ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍເປົ້າໝາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບຈຳນວນຫຼາຍຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ເປັນໄປແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ບຳລຸງຮັກສາພວກມັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Do not update the [package]``salt`` package using states.  Update all other "
"system packages using states.  You can then update the [package]``salt`` "
"package from the {productname} {webui} as a separate step."
msgstr "ຫ້າມອັບເດດແພັກເກດ [package]``salt`` ໂດຍໃຊ້ states. ໃຫ້ອັບເດດແພັກເກດລະບົບອື່ນໆ ທັງໝົດໂດຍໃຊ້ states. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດອັບເດດແພັກເກດ [package]``salt`` ຈາກ {productname} {webui} ເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:34
msgid ""
"For more information on states, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/starting_states.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ states, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/starting_states.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:35
msgid ""
"For more Salt terminology, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/glossary.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳສັບອື່ນໆຂອງ Salt, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/glossary.html."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt timeouts"
msgstr "ການໝົດເວລາຂອງ Salt (Salt timeouts)"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "General Salt timeouts"
msgstr "ການໝົດເວລາທົ່ວໄປຂອງ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Salt features two timeout parameters called `timeout` and "
"`gather_job_timeout` that are relevant during the execution of Salt commands "
"and jobs--it does not matter whether they are triggered using the command "
"line interface or API.  These two parameters are explained in the following "
"article."
msgstr "Salt ມີພາຣາມິເຕີການໝົດເວລາສອງໂຕຄື `timeout` ແລະ `gather_job_timeout` ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນລະຫວ່າງການລັນຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ ວຽກ (jobs) ຂອງ Salt—ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຜ່ານ command line ຫຼື API ກໍຕາມ. ພາຣາມິເຕີທັງສອງນີ້ຈະຖືກອະທິບາຍໃນບົດຄວາມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:4
msgid "This is a normal workflow when all clients are well reachable:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກປົກກະຕິເມື່ອສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດໄດ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:5
msgid "A salt command or job is executed:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ ຫຼື ວຽກ Salt ຖືກລັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt '*' test.ping\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Salt master publishes the job with the targeted clients into the Salt PUB "
"channel."
msgstr "Salt master ເຜີຍແຜ່ວຽກໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍເປົ້າໝາຍຜ່ານຊ່ອງທາງ Salt PUB."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:8
msgid "Clients take that job and start working on it."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຮັບວຽກນັ້ນໄປ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Salt master is looking at the Salt RET channel to gather responses from the "
"clients."
msgstr "Salt master ຈະກວດເບິ່ງຊ່ອງທາງ Salt RET ເພື່ອລວບລວມການຕອບກັບຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:10
msgid ""
"If Salt master gets all responses from targeted clients, then everything is "
"completed and Salt master will return a response containing all the client "
"responses."
msgstr "ຖ້າ Salt master ໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບກັບທັງໝົດຈາກລູກຂ່າຍເປົ້າໝາຍ, ຖືວ່າທຸກຢ່າງສຳເລັດ ແລະ Salt master ຈະສົ່ງຄືນການຕອບກັບທີ່ລວມເອົາຜົນຈາກລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:11
msgid ""
"If some of the clients are down during this process, the workflow continues "
"as follows:"
msgstr "ຖ້າມີບາງລູກຂ່າຍປິດຢູ່ (down) ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການນີ້, ຂັ້ນຕອນຈະດຳເນີນຕໍ່ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If `timeout` is reached before getting all expected responses from the "
"clients, then Salt master would trigger an aditional job (a Salt "
"[command]``find_job`` job) targeting only pending clients to check whether "
"the job is already running on the client."
msgstr "ຖ້າຮອດເວລາ `timeout` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບກັບທັງໝົດຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ, Salt master ຈະສ້າງວຽກເພີ່ມເຕີມ (ວຽກ [command]``find_job``) ໂດຍເນັ້ນໃສ່ສະເພາະລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຍັງຄ້າງຢູ່ ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງວ່າວຽກນັ້ນກຳລັງລັນຢູ່ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:13
msgid "Now `gather_job_timeout` is evaluated. A new counter is now triggered."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ `gather_job_timeout` ຈະຖືກປະເມີນ. ຕົວນັບເວລາໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If this new [command]``find_job`` job responds that the original job is "
"actually running on the client, then Salt master will wait for that client's "
"response for another `gather_job_timeout` interval before issuing the next "
"[command]``find_job`` job."
msgstr "ຖ້າວຽກ [command]``find_job`` ໃໝ່ນີ້ຕອບກັບມາວ່າ ວຽກເດີມກຳລັງລັນຢູ່ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍແທ້, Salt master ຈະລໍຖ້າການຕອບກັບຈາກລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນອີກໜຶ່ງຊ່ວງເວລາ `gather_job_timeout` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``find_job`` ຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In case of reaching `gather_job_timeout` without having any response from "
"the client (neither for the initial [command]``test.ping`` nor for the "
"[command]``find_job`` job), Salt master will return with only the gathered "
"responses from the responding clients."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຮອດເວລາ `gather_job_timeout` ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຕອບກັບໃດໆ ຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ (ທັງຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``test.ping`` ທຳອິດ ຫຼື ວຽກ [command]``find_job``), Salt master ຈະສົ່ງຄືນສະເພາະການຕອບກັບທີ່ລວບລວມໄດ້ຈາກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕອບກັບມາເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:16
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} globally sets `timeout` and `gather_job_timeout` "
"to 120 seconds.  So, in the worst case, a Salt call targeting unreachable "
"clients will end up _with 240 seconds of waiting_ until getting a response."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຕັ້ງຄ່າ `timeout` ແລະ `gather_job_timeout` ໄວ້ທີ່ 120 ວິນາທີ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຮ້າຍແຮງທີ່ສຸດ, ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Salt ຫາລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕິດຕໍ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ ຈະຕ້ອງ _ລໍຖ້າເຖິງ 240 ວິນາທີ_ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນຕອບກັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:17
msgid ""
"You can configure these values differently by creating a "
"[filename]``/etc/salt/master.d/custom.conf`` configuration file according to "
"syntax in [filename]``/etc/salt/master.conf``."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ແຕກຕ່າງອອກໄປໄດ້ ໂດຍການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [filename]``/etc/salt/master.d/custom.conf`` ຕາມຮູບແບບໃນ [filename]``/etc/salt/master.conf``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Presence Ping Timeouts"
msgstr "ການໝົດເວລາຂອງ Presence Ping"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Before Actions are executed on Salt clients, whether they scheduled via the "
"Web UI or the API, {productname} performs a \"presence ping\" command to "
"ensure the respective `salt-minion` processes are active and able to "
"respond. Then, a ping gather job runs on the Salt master to handle the "
"incoming pings from the clients. Actual commands will begin only after all "
"clients have either responded to the ping, or timed out."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ Actions ຈະຖືກລັນຢູ່ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເວລາຜ່ານ Web UI ຫຼື API ກໍຕາມ, {productname} ຈະເຮັດການຄຳສັ່ງ \"presence ping\" ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂະບວນການ `salt-minion` ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງນັ້ນເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ແລະ ສາມາດຕອບກັບໄດ້. ຈາກນັ້ນ, ວຽກລວບລວມ ping ຈະລັນຢູ່ເທິງ Salt master ເພື່ອຈັດການກັບ ping ທີ່ສົ່ງມາຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ. ຄຳສັ່ງຕົວຈິງຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດໄດ້ຕອບກັບ ping ຫຼື ໝົດເວລາແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The presence ping is an ordinary Salt command, but is not subject to the "
"same timeout parameters as all other Salt commands "
"(`timeout`/`gather_job_timeout`, described above). Rather, it has its own "
"parameters "
"(`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`/`java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout`) "
"that can be set in [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To allow for quicker detection of unresponsive clients, the timeout values "
"for presence pings are by default significantly shorter than the general "
"defaults. You can configure the presence ping parameters in "
"[filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, however the default values should be "
"sufficient in most cases."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກວດພົບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ, ຄ່າການໝົດເວລາສຳລັບ presence pings ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະສັ້ນກວ່າຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທົ່ວໄປຫຼາຍ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີ presence ping ໄດ້ໃນ [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນກໍພຽງພໍແລ້ວໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:22
msgid ""
"A lower total presence ping timeout value will increase the chance of false "
"negatives.  In some cases, a client might be marked as non-responding, when "
"it is responding but did not respond quickly enough.  Additionally, setting "
"this total presence ping timeout value too low could result in a client "
"hanging at the boot screen.  A higher total presence ping timeout will "
"increase the accuracy of the test, as even slow clients will respond to the "
"presence ping before timing out.  Additionally, a higher presence ping "
"timeout could limit throughput if you are targeting a large number of "
"clients, when some of them are slow."
msgstr "ຄ່າການໝົດເວລາ presence ping ທີ່ຕ່ຳເກີນໄປ ຈະເພີ່ມໂອກາດຂອງຄວາມຜິດພາດ (false negatives). ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ລູກຂ່າຍອາດຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ ທັງທີ່ມັນກຳລັງຕອບສະໜອງຢູ່ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄວພໍ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄ່ານີ້ຕ່ຳເກີນໄປອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍຄ້າງຢູ່ໜ້າຈໍບູດ. ຄ່າ presence ping ທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳໃນການທົດສອບ, ເພາະວ່າແມ່ນແຕ່ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຊ້າກໍຈະມີເວລາຕອບກັບກ່ອນໝົດເວລາ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຄ່າທີ່ສູງເກີນໄປອາດຈະຈຳກັດປະສິດທິພາບການເຮັດວຽກ (throughput) ຖ້າທ່ານກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ໂດຍທີ່ມີບາງໂຕເຮັດວຽກຊ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:23
msgid ""
"If a client does not reply to a ping within the allocated time, it is marked "
"as [systemitem]``not available``, and is excluded from the command.  The "
"{webui} shows a [systemitem]``minion is down or could not be contacted`` "
"message in this case."
msgstr "ຖ້າລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ຕອບກັບ ping ພາຍໃນເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ, ມັນຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າ [systemitem]``not available``, ແລະ ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນອອກຈາກຄຳສັ່ງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ {webui} ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມ [systemitem]``minion is down or could not be contacted``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The presence ping timeout parameter changes the timeout setting for the "
"presence ping, in seconds.  Adjust the "
"[systemitem]``java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`` parameter.  Defaults to 4 "
"seconds."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ presence ping timeout ຈະປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າການໝົດເວລາສຳລັບ presence ping ເປັນວິນາທີ. ໃຫ້ປັບຄ່າ [systemitem]``java.salt_presence_ping_timeout``. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 4 ວິນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The presence ping gather job parameter changes the timeout setting for "
"gathering the presence ping, in seconds.  Adjust the "
"[systemitem]``java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout`` parameter.  "
"Defaults to 1 second."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ presence ping gather job ຈະປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າການໝົດເວລາສຳລັບການລວບລວມ presence ping ເປັນວິນາທີ. ໃຫ້ປັບຄ່າ [systemitem]``java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout``. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1 ວິນາທີ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt SSH Clients (SSH Push)"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH (SSH Push)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Salt SSH clients are slightly different than regular clients (zeromq). Salt "
"SSH clients do not use Salt PUB/RET channels but a wrapper Salt command "
"inside of an SSH call.  Salt `timeout` and `gather_job_timeout` are not "
"playing a role here."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH ຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກລູກຂ່າຍປົກກະຕິ (zeromq) ເລັກນ້ອຍ. ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ Salt PUB/RET ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ທີ່ຖືກຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ (wrapper) ໄວ້ພາຍໃນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ SSH. ຄ່າ Salt `timeout` ແລະ `gather_job_timeout` ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນກໍລະນີນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:28
msgid ""
"{productname} defines a timeout for SSH connections in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "{productname} ກຳນົດຄ່າການໝົດເວລາສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "# salt_ssh_connect_timeout = 180\n"
msgstr "# salt_ssh_connect_timeout = 180\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Often Used Salt Commands"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains the most commonly used Salt commands.  For a complete "
"list of available Salt commands, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/cli/index.html."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບມີຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆທີ່ສຸດ. ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/cli/index.html."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-run"
msgstr "salt-run"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:4
msgid "Display all clients that are running:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-run manage.up\n"
msgstr "salt-run manage.up\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:6
msgid "Display all clients that are not running:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-run manage.down\n"
msgstr "salt-run manage.down\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:8
msgid "Display the current status of all Salt clients:"
msgstr "ສະແດງສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທັງໝົດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-run manage.status\n"
msgstr "salt-run manage.status\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Check the version of Salt running on the {productname} Server and active "
"clients:"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງເວີຊັນຂອງ Salt ທີ່ລັນຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname} ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-run manage.versions\n"
msgstr "salt-run manage.versions\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-cp"
msgstr "salt-cp"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:13
msgid "Copy a file to a client or set of clients:"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ຊຸດຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-cp '*' foo.conf /root\n"
msgstr "salt-cp '*' foo.conf /root\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -l"
msgstr "salt-key -l"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:16
msgid "List public keys:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຄີສາທາລະນະ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -l all\n"
msgstr "salt-key -l all\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -a my-minion"
msgstr "salt-key -a my-minion"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:19
msgid "Accept pending key for a minion:"
msgstr "ຍອມຮັບຄີທີ່ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າ (pending key) ສຳລັບ minion:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -a my-minion\n"
msgstr "salt-key -a my-minion\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -A"
msgstr "salt-key -A"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:22
msgid "Accept all pending keys:"
msgstr "ຍອມຮັບຄີທີ່ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າທັງໝົດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -A\n"
msgstr "salt-key -A\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt grains"
msgstr "salt grains"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:25
msgid "List all available grains:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ grains ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:27
msgid "List collected grain system data:"
msgstr "ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ລວບລວມມາຈາກ grains:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' grains.items\n"
msgstr "salt '*' grains.items\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Using Yomi"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ Yomi"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Yomi (yet one more installer) is an installer for {suse} and openSUSE "
"operating systems.  Yomi is designed as a Salt state, and can be used for "
"installing {suse} operating systems on new systems."
msgstr "Yomi (yet one more installer) ແມ່ນຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {suse} ແລະ openSUSE. Yomi ຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ເປັນ Salt state, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {suse} ລົງໃນລະບົບໃໝ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, Yomi can be used as part of provisioning new clients, as "
"an alternative to {ay}."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, Yomi ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບໃໝ່ (provisioning) ໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍ, ເພື່ອເປັນທາງເລືອກແທນ {ay}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:4
msgid "Yomi consists of two components:"
msgstr "Yomi ປະກອບມີສອງສ່ວນປະກອບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The Yomi formula, which contains the Salt states and modules required to "
"perform the installation."
msgstr "Yomi formula, ຊຶ່ງປະກອບມີ Salt states ແລະ ໂມດູນຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The operating system image, which includes the pre-configured "
"``salt-minion`` service."
msgstr "Operating system image, ຊຶ່ງລວມມີບໍລິການ ``salt-minion`` ທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Both components can be used independently of {productname}, or integrated "
"with it.  This section describes how to use it with {productname}."
msgstr "ທັງສອງສ່ວນປະກອບສາມາດໃຊ້ແຍກຈາກ {productname} ໄດ້, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນກໍໄດ້. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການໃຊ້ມັນຮ່ວມກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For more information about using Yomi independently, see "
"https://github.com/openSUSE/yomi."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ Yomi ແບບແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://github.com/openSUSE/yomi."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For build assets, see "
"https://build.opensuse.org/project/show/systemsmanagement:yomi."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຊັບສິນການສ້າງ (build assets), ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://build.opensuse.org/project/show/systemsmanagement:yomi."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:10
msgid "To use Yomi for installing a client operating system, follow this process:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ Yomi ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:11
msgid "Install the ``yomi-formula`` package."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ ``yomi-formula``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:12
msgid "Prepare the Salt pillar for the new installation."
msgstr "ກຽມ Salt pillar ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:13
msgid "Boot the new client using the PXE boot image for Yomi."
msgstr "ບູດລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ PXE boot image ສຳລັບ Yomi."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:14
msgid ""
"To use Yomi with {productname}, ensure you have enough available memory.  To "
"boot from USB or DVD image, you need at least 512{nbsp}MB.  To boot from a "
"PXE server, you need at least 2{nbsp}GB."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ Yomi ກັບ {productname}, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳພຽງພໍ. ໃນການບູດຈາກ USB ຫຼື DVD image, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 512MB. ໃນການບູດຈາກ PXE server, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 2GB."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Yomi Formula"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Yomi Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to install the Yomi formula, which is available "
"as a package in {productname}."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ Yomi formula, ຊຶ່ງມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການເປັນແພັກເກດໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The ``yomi-formula`` package contains the Salt states and modules that "
"describe the Yomi state, and the formulas with forms to create the pillar.  "
"It also contains documentation about the different sections of the pillar, "
"and some examples about how to parameterize installations based on "
"{opensuse} or {sle}."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ ``yomi-formula`` ປະກອບມີ Salt states ແລະ ໂມດູນທີ່ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບ Yomi state, ແລະ formulas ພ້ອມກັບ forms ເພື່ອສ້າງ pillar. ມັນຍັງປະກອບມີເອກະສານກ່ຽວກັບພາກສ່ວນຕ່າງໆ ຂອງ pillar, ແລະ ຕົວຢ່າງບາງຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການກຳນົດພາຣາມິເຕີໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ໂດຍອີງຕາມ {opensuse} ຫຼື {sle}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:18
msgid "The formula package performs these actions:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ formula ຈະເຮັດວຽກເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Adds a new configuration file called ``yomi-formula.conf`` in the "
"[path]``/etc/salt/master.d/`` directory.  This configuration file defines "
"the Python module and Salt states required by Yomi."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``yomi-formula.conf`` ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/``. ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ກຳນົດໂມດູນ Python ແລະ Salt states ທີ່ Yomi ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Installs the Yomi Salt states in the "
"[path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/states/`` directory."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Yomi Salt states ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/states/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Provides some example configuration files in the [path]``/usr/share/yomi/`` "
"directory."
msgstr "ມີຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/usr/share/yomi/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Installs the required forms and sub-forms in the "
"[path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/metadata/`` directory."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ forms ແລະ sub-forms ທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/metadata/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Provides some pillar examples in the [path]``/usr/share/yomi/pillar/`` "
"directory."
msgstr "ມີຕົວຢ່າງ pillar ໃຫ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/usr/share/yomi/pillar/``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the Yomi Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Yomi Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For more information about the Yomi formula, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Yomi formula, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the PXE Image"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ PXE Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:31
msgid ""
"To provision a new client, you need an operating system image to boot from.  "
"You can use any image that contains a ``salt-minion`` service enabled, "
"together with a minimal set of tools that are required during the "
"installation, for example ``parted`` or ``btrfstools``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ OS image ເພື່ອໃຊ້ບູດ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ image ໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ມີບໍລິການ ``salt-minion`` ເປີດຢູ່, ພ້ອມກັບຊຸດເຄື່ອງມືພື້ນຖານທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ ເຊັ່ນ ``parted`` ຫຼື ``btrfstools``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Yomi provides an already prepared image, based on openSUSE Tumbleweed, "
"openSUSE Leap (for {uyuni}), or SLE (for {susemgr}).  For {productname}, the "
"image is packaged as an RPM.  This is done in a similar way to how "
"``pxe-default-image`` is distributed."
msgstr "Yomi ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ image ທີ່ກຽມໄວ້ແລ້ວ ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ openSUSE Tumbleweed, openSUSE Leap (ສຳລັບ {uyuni}), ຫຼື SLE (ສຳລັບ {susemgr}). ສຳລັບ {productname}, image ຈະຖືກແພັກເປັນ RPM ຊຶ່ງຖືກແຈກຈ່າຍໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ ``pxe-default-image``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The package installs a standard PXE OEM image generated by Kiwi, the initial "
"kernel and initrd in the [path]``/srv/pxe-yomi-image/`` directory, and the "
"second stage kernel, initrd and image in the "
"[path]``/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image`` directory."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ PXE OEM image ມາດຕະຖານທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ Kiwi, ໂດຍມີ kernel ແລະ initrd ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/srv/pxe-yomi-image/``, ແລະ ພາກສ່ວນທີສອງຂອງ kernel, initrd ແລະ image ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the PXE Image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ PXE Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:35
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:37
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, install the "
"``pxe-yomi-image`` service:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງບໍລິການ ``pxe-yomi-image``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in pxe-yomi-image-sle15\n"
msgstr "zypper in pxe-yomi-image-sle15\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15\n"
msgstr "zypper in pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:39
msgid "When you have the package installed, you can register Yomi in {cobbler}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດລົງທະບຽນ Yomi ໃນ {cobbler} ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Yomi in {cobbler}"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ Yomi ໃນ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:41
msgid ""
"{productname} uses {cobbler} to manage the PXE boot service, so you will "
"need to register the image in {cobbler}."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ {cobbler} ເພື່ອຈັດການບໍລິການ PXE boot, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນ image ໃນ {cobbler}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering the Yomi Image in {cobbler}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນ Yomi Image ໃນ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:43
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, create a "
"directory for the Yomi image:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີສຳລັບ Yomi image:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image\n"
msgstr "mkdir /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Define a distribution in {cobbler}, including the path to install the second "
"stage kernel and initrd, the location of the full image, and any further "
"kernel options."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ distribution ໃນ {cobbler}, ລວມທັງເສັ້ນທາງການຕິດຕັ້ງພາກສ່ວນທີສອງຂອງ kernel ແລະ initrd, ບ່ອນເກັບ image ເຕັມ, ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກ kernel ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Adjust this command to include the correct version of the product, and the "
"TFTP server address:"
msgstr "ປັບຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃຫ້ລວມເອົາເວີຊັນຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ TFTP server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler distro add \\\n"
"  --name=pxe-yomi-image \\\n"
"  --kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/linux \\\n"
"  --initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/initrd \\\n"
"  "
"--boot-files='/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.initrd "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.kernel "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.md5=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.md5 "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.config.bootoptions=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15-x86_64-1.0.0.config.bootoptions "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.xz' "
"\\\n"
"  --kernel-options='rd.kiwi.install.pxe "
"rd.kiwi.install.image=tftp://<server-address>/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz "
"rd.kiwi.ramdisk ramdisk_size=2097152 net.ifnames=1'\n"
msgstr ""
"cobbler distro add \\\n"
"  --name=pxe-yomi-image \\\n"
"  --kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/linux \\\n"
"  --initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/initrd \\\n"
"  --boot-files='/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.initrd /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.kernel /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.md5=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.md5 /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.config.bootoptions=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15-x86_64-1.0.0.config.bootoptions /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.xz' \\\n"
"  --kernel-options='rd.kiwi.install.pxe rd.kiwi.install.image=tftp://<server-address>/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz rd.kiwi.ramdisk ramdisk_size=2097152 net.ifnames=1'\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler distro add \\\n"
"  --name=pxe-yomi-image \\\n"
"  --kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/linux \\\n"
"  --initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/initrd \\\n"
"  "
"--boot-files='/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.initrd "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.kernel "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.md5=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.md5 "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.config.bootoptions=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15-x86_64-1.0.0.config.bootoptions "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.xz' "
"\\\n"
"  --kernel-options='rd.kiwi.install.pxe "
"rd.kiwi.install.image=tftp://<server-address>/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz "
"rd.kiwi.ramdisk ramdisk_size=2097152 net.ifnames=1'\n"
msgstr ""
"cobbler distro add \\\n"
"  --name=pxe-yomi-image \\\n"
"  --kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/linux \\\n"
"  --initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/initrd \\\n"
"  --boot-files='/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.initrd /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.kernel /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.md5=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.md5 /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.config.bootoptions=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15-x86_64-1.0.0.config.bootoptions /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.xz' \\\n"
"  --kernel-options='rd.kiwi.install.pxe rd.kiwi.install.image=tftp://<server-address>/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz rd.kiwi.ramdisk ramdisk_size=2097152 net.ifnames=1'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:49
msgid ""
"By default, the ``salt-minion`` service in ``pxe-yomi-image`` is configured "
"to find the Salt master under the ``salt`` address.  If the DNS server is "
"not able to resolve this address, you need to adjust the ``kernel-options`` "
"parameter from the {cobbler} command that register the distribution, and add "
"a new kernel command line of ``ym.master=master_address``.  This will "
"override the default configuration for the ``salt-minion``."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ບໍລິການ ``salt-minion`` ໃນ ``pxe-yomi-image`` ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຊອກຫາ Salt master ທີ່ທີ່ຢູ່ ``salt``. ຖ້າ DNS server ບໍ່ສາມາດແປຊື່ທີ່ຢູ່ນີ້ໄດ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບປ່ຽນພາຣາມິເຕີ ``kernel-options`` ຈາກຄຳສັ່ງ {cobbler} ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນ distribution ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄຳສັ່ງ kernel ໃໝ່ເປັນ ``ym.master=master_address``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະທັບຊ້ອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ ``salt-minion``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering the Yomi Profile in {cobbler}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນ Yomi Profile ໃນ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:51
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, define a "
"profile in {cobbler} based on the image."
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ profile ໃນ {cobbler} ໂດຍອີງຕາມ image ນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler profile add \\\n"
"  --name pxe-yomi-profile \\\n"
"  --distro=pxe-yomi-image\n"
msgstr ""
"cobbler profile add \\\n"
"  --name pxe-yomi-profile \\\n"
"  --distro=pxe-yomi-image\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:53
msgid "OPTIONAL: Create a system in {cobbler}."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ສ້າງ system ໃນ {cobbler}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:54
msgid ""
"If you know the MAC address for the new client to be provisioned, you can "
"have it boot directly from the Yomi image."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຮູ້ MAC address ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຫ້ມັນບູດໂດຍກົງຈາກ Yomi image ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler system add \\\n"
"   --name=yomi \\\n"
"   --mac=00:11:22:33:44:55 \\\n"
"   --profile=pxe-yomi-profile\n"
msgstr ""
"cobbler system add \\\n"
"   --name=yomi \\\n"
"   --mac=00:11:22:33:44:55 \\\n"
"   --profile=pxe-yomi-profile\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:56
msgid ""
"When the new node has been provisioned, remove the temporary {cobbler} "
"system:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ node ໃໝ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລຶບ system ຊົ່ວຄາວໃນ {cobbler} ອອກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "cobbler system remove --name=yomi\n"
msgstr "cobbler system remove --name=yomi\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Salt Pillar Preparation"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການກຽມ Salt Pillar"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:59
msgid ""
"The parameters of the new installation are defined with a Salt pillar.  The "
"pillar includes parameters that the Yomi state requires during the "
"installation, including the partitions, file systems, repositories, packages "
"installed, and services enabled."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ຈະຖືກກຳນົດດ້ວຍ Salt pillar. Pillar ລວມເອົາພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ Yomi state ຕ້ອງການໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ລວມທັງການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ (partitions), ລະບົບໄຟລ໌, ຄັງຊອບແວ, ແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ, ແລະ ບໍລິການທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:60
msgid ""
"The pillar is defined using the formulas with forms.  In this example, we "
"prepare the pillar for a minimal openSUSE Tumbleweed installation.  You can "
"find examples for {sle} in the example directory "
"[path]``/usr/share/yomi/pillar/``."
msgstr "Pillar ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍໃຊ້ formulas ພ້ອມກັບ forms. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາກຽມ pillar ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ openSUSE Tumbleweed ແບບພື້ນຖານທີ່ສຸດ (minimal). ທ່ານສາມາດຫາຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບ {sle} ໄດ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/usr/share/yomi/pillar/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:61
msgid ""
"To begin, boot the client that you want to provision using the Yomi PXE boot "
"image, using the {cobbler} procedures described earlier in this section."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ບູດລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ Yomi PXE boot image ຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນ {cobbler} ທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:62
msgid ""
"When the ``salt-minion`` service is running on the new client, accept the "
"key by navigating to menu:Salt[Keys].  When the key is accepted, you can "
"view and manage the client by navigating to menu:Systems[Overview].  "
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab, and add all the Yomi Installer "
"formulas to the client.  When you have added all the formulas, complete the "
"forms and sub-forms.  This section outlines each form and provides example "
"settings for a minimal installation.  For a detailed explanation of every "
"option, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອບໍລິການ ``salt-minion`` ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຍອມຮັບຄີໂດຍການເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Salt[Keys]. ເມື່ອຄີຖືກຍອມຮັບແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງ ແລະ ຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ໂດຍການເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Overview]. ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Formulas``, ແລະ ເພີ່ມ Yomi Installer formulas ທັງໝົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ. ເມື່ອເພີ່ມ formulas ທັງໝົດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນ forms ແລະ sub-forms. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ສະຫຼຸບແຕ່ລະ form ແລະ ໃຫ້ຕົວຢ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບພື້ນຖານ. ສຳລັບຄຳອະທິບາຍລະອຽດຂອງແຕ່ລະຕົວເລືອກ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:64
msgid ""
"The Yomi form contains some general configuration options.  For example, the "
"keyboard language and layout, the locale information, and the option to "
"perform a full reset of the system after provisioning."
msgstr "Yomi form ປະກອບມີບາງຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປ. ເຊັ່ນ: ພາສາ ແລະ ຜັງຄີບອດ (keyboard layout), ຂໍ້ມູນ locale, ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກເພື່ອຣີເຊັດລະບົບທັງໝົດຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:65
msgid "For this example, set the [parameter]``Reboot`` parameter to ``yes``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງພາຣາມິເຕີ [parameter]``Reboot`` ເປັນ ``yes``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:67
msgid ""
"This sub-form provides information about the devices, partitioning, file "
"system (including the BtrFS subvolumes, for example), and LVM and RAID "
"configuration."
msgstr "Sub-form ນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບອຸປະກອນ, ການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ, ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ (ລວມທັງ BtrFS subvolumes), ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ LVM ແລະ RAID."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:68
msgid ""
"For this example, we assume that the new client has a single device named "
"``/dev/sda``, and that it belongs to a non-UEFI system.  In this case, we "
"have only three partitions: one for the boot loader, one for swap and one "
"for the system.  We also expect to have an ext4 file system for the root "
"directory."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາສົມມຸດວ່າລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ມີອຸປະກອນດຽວຊື່ວ່າ ``/dev/sda``, ແລະ ມັນເປັນລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ UEFI. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ພວກເຮົາມີພຽງສາມ partitions: ອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ boot loader, ອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ swap ແລະ ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບລະບົບ. ພວກເຮົາຍັງກຳນົດໃຫ້ມີລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ext4 ສຳລັບ root directory."

